(4,3,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'best-of-egypt-10-day-tour-pyramids-nile-river-cruise','{\"en\":\"Best of Egypt 10-Day Tour: Pyramids & Nile River Cruise\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on our Best Egypt Vacation package 10-Day Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Nile Cruise. Experience ancient wonders with 5-star service & expert guides.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Best of Egypt 10-Day Tour: Pyramids &amp; Nile River Cruise: Explore the wonders of Egypt with the finest amenities and personalized service on our Egypt private tour packages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Discover the treasures of this ancient land in style with our exclusive Egypt best tour packages. Immerse yourself in the rich history and luxury of Egypt with our meticulously crafted &lsquo;Egypt travel packages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Embark on a journey through time and culture with our premium Egypt travel experiences. Delve into the mystique of the pyramids and temples with our expertly guided Egypt tours. Experience the allure of the Nile River while indulging in top-notch accommodations and dining on our Egypt luxury vacation packages.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Uncover the secrets of the pharaohs and explore the vibrant markets and bazaars with our tailored Egypt travel itineraries. Let us elevate your Egyptian adventure with our all-inclusive tours designed for discerning travelers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Embark on a four-night Nile river cruise, gliding in comfort through stirring desert landscapes and going ashore to discover ancient Egypt&rsquo;s most awe-inspiring sites.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore the Egyptian Museum of Antiquities (or the Grand Egyptian Museum, upon its opening) to view a vast trove of artifacts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Venture inside one of the pyramids and view the enigmatic Great Sphinx on the Giza Plateau<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Descend into the tomb of King Tut and the colorful tomb of Seti I, father of legendary Ramses II, in the Valley of the Kings.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Marvel at the colossal statues and towering colonnade of the sprawling Temple of Luxor, and listen as your expert Egyptologist deciphers the hieroglyphs carved upon them.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Journey to Abu Simbel to set eyes upon the imposing twin temples of Ramses II and Queen Nefertari.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',10,NULL,9,'{\"en\":\"10 Days, 9 Nights\"}',NULL,1599.00,NULL,1599.00,NULL,1599.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,1599.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-20 18:34:11',10,'{\"en\":\"Best of Egypt 10-Day Tour: Pyramids & Nile River Cruise\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on our Best Egypt Vacation package 10-Day Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Nile Cruise. Experience ancient wonders with 5-star service & expert guides.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','24','Best-of-Egypt-10-Day-Tour-Pyramids-Nile-River-Cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-20 18:34:11','2026-04-01 14:51:07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(5,11,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'11-day-cairo-7-night-nile-cruise','{\"en\":\"11-Day Egypt Tour: Giza Pyramids & 7-Night Nile River Cruise Package\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Journey through ancient Egypt with our 11-day tour. Explore the iconic Pyramids of Giza and Sphinx, then embark on a 7-night Nile River cruise to discover Luxor, Aswan, and the Valley of the Kings. An unforgettable adventure awaits.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>11-Day Egypt Tour: Giza Pyramids &amp; 7-Night Nile River Cruise Package<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This journey is the ideal way to see Egypt. Not only can you enjoy the wonderful ancient sites along the Nile, from Luxor to Aswan but also Visit famous Pyramids Of Giza, feel an authentic spirit of old Cairo ! Be sure, it will be one of the most exciting Egypt tours, you&rsquo;ve ever made.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Experience the majesty of ancient Egypt with our comprehensive <strong>11-Day Egypt Tour: Giza Pyramids &amp; 7-Night Nile River Cruise Package.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your historical journey in Cairo, exploring the sole remaining Ancient Wonder: the Great Pyramids and Sphinx of Giza. You\'ll also delve into the rich history within the Egyptian Museum and the ancient capital of Memphis.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The core of the trip is a luxurious 7-night full board cruise, sailing the legendary Nile from Luxor to Aswan. Stops include the colossal temples of Karnak and Luxor, the monumental tombs of the Valley of the Kings, the unique double temple of Kom Ombo, the well-preserved Temple of Horus at Edfu, and the serene Philae Temple. This package guarantees an in-depth, effortless exploration of Egypt&rsquo;s greatest archaeological treasures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Cairo:<\\/strong> Giza Pyramids &amp; Sphinx, Egyptian Museum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Nile Cruise:<\\/strong> Temple of Karnak, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Temple of Hatshepsut, Colossi of Memnon, Temple of Edfu, Temple of Kom Ombo, Philae Temple, High Dam, and the Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Optional:<\\/strong> Abu Simbel Temples excursion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',11,NULL,9,'{\"en\":\"11 Days, 9 Nights\"}',NULL,2200.00,NULL,2200.00,NULL,2200.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,2200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 13:20:06',3,'{\"en\":\"11-Day Egypt Tour: Giza Pyramids & 7-Night Nile River Cruise Package\"}','{\"en\":\"Journey through ancient Egypt with our 11-day tour. Explore the iconic Pyramids of Giza and Sphinx, then embark on a 7-night Nile River cruise to discover Luxor, Aswan, and the Valley of the Kings. An unforgettable adventure awaits.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','25','11-day-cairo-7-night-nile-cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 13:20:06','2026-04-01 14:50:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(6,12,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'egypt-holiday-package-for-9-days-8-nights-cairo-luxor-and-hurghada','{\"en\":\"Egypt Holiday Package for 9 Days 8 Nights Cairo Luxor and Hurghada\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore ancient Egypt with a 9-day Cairo, Luxor, and Hurghada holiday package. Discover pyramids, Nile cruises, and Red Sea adventures. Book your unforgettable Egypt tour now!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Unforgettable 9-Days, 8-Nights Egypt Adventure: Cairo, Luxor &amp; Hurghada<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<div>Explore the best of Egypt with our meticulously crafted 9-day Cairo, Luxor, and Hurghada holiday package. This professional tour seamlessly blends the country\'s unparalleled ancient history with luxurious Red Sea relaxation.<\\/div>\\r\\n<div>Begin in Cairo, where you\'ll stand in awe of the legendary Giza Pyramids and the enigmatic Sphinx. Delve into pharaonic treasures at the Egyptian Museum, setting the stage for your historical journey. Next, fly or take a scenic transfer to Luxor, the world\'s largest open-air museum. Here, an expert Egyptologist will guide you through the monumental Karnak and Luxor Temples, and the royal tombs of the Valley of the Kings.<\\/div>\\r\\n<div>The adventure culminates with pure leisure in Hurghada. Enjoy 2-3 nights of sun, sand, and sparkling, crystal-clear waters on the Red Sea coast. Relax on pristine beaches or take advantage of world-class snorkeling and diving opportunities. This all-inclusive package guarantees comfort, hassle-free transfers, and an unforgettable experience, making it the ultimate Egypt vacation for history buffs and beach lovers alike. Book your journey into the land of the Pharaohs today.<\\/div>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><br \\/>&bull; Embark on a captivating journey through ancient wonders.<br \\/>&bull; Immerse yourself in the rich history.<br \\/>&bull; discover the awe-inspiring temples of Luxor.<br \\/>&bull; create unforgettable memories on this alluring adventure.<\\/p>\"}','days',9,NULL,8,'{\"en\":\"9 Days, 8 Nights\"}',NULL,1999.00,NULL,1999.00,NULL,1999.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,99,0,0,1999.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 15:34:28',10,'{\"en\":\"Egypt Holiday Package for 9 Days 8 Nights Cairo Luxor and Hurghada\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore ancient Egypt with a 9-day Cairo, Luxor, and Hurghada holiday package. Discover pyramids, Nile cruises, and Red Sea adventures. Book your unforgettable Egypt tour now!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','27','egypt-holiday-package-for-9-days-8-nights-cairo-luxor-and-hurghada','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 15:34:28','2026-04-01 14:51:12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(7,11,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'10-day-egypt-tour-cairo-alexandria-nile-cruise','{\"en\":\"10-Day Egypt Tour: Cairo, Alexandria & Nile Cruise\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a 10-Day Egypt Tour of Cairo, Alexandria & a Nile Cruise. Discover ancient pyramids, majestic temples, and coastal beauty. Book your adventure today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Experience a comprehensive 10-day Egypt tour, including Cairo&rsquo;s iconic sites, Alexandria&rsquo;s coastal beauty, and a relaxing Nile River cruise. Learn more and book today!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Tour the famous, ancient pyramids and the Sphinx in Giza.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy a cruise along the Nile River.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Tour Valley of the Kings, Temple of Hatshepsut, and more in Luxor.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Take a day trip to Alexandria to tour the catacombs, citadel, and library.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Hotels and Boats<\\/strong> Category: 4 Star Hotel, 5 Star Nile Cruise<\\/p>\"}','days',10,NULL,9,'{\"en\":\"10 Days, 9 Nights\"}',NULL,1560.00,NULL,1560.00,NULL,1560.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,1560.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 16:06:58',10,'{\"en\":\"10-Day Egypt Tour: Cairo, Alexandria & Nile Cruise\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a 10-Day Egypt Tour of Cairo, Alexandria & a Nile Cruise. Discover ancient pyramids, majestic temples, and coastal beauty. Book your adventure today!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','28','10-day-egypt-tour-cairo-alexandria-nile-cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 16:06:58','2026-04-01 14:51:20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(8,9,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'9-days-egypt-tour-cairo-luxor-aswan-nile-cruise-guided-tours','{\"en\":\"9 Days Egypt Luxury Tour: Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Nile Cruise | Guided Tours\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a 9-day guided tour of Egypt. Explore Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan, and enjoy a magnificent Nile Cruise. Book your unforgettable Egyptian adventure today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Experience the magic of Egypt with our 9-day tour. Discover Cairo&rsquo;s pyramids, cruise the Nile from Luxor to Aswan, and enjoy expert-guided tours. Book your dream Egypt vacation today!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Embark on an unforgettable 9-day journey through the heart of ancient Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore the Great Pyramids and Sphinx.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Visit Karnak and Luxor Temples.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Tour the Valley of the Kings and Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Discover the temples of Edfu and Kom Ombo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>See the treasures at the Egyptian Museum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Good to Know:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Comfortable shoes are require<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Sun hat is required<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Comfortable clothes<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Check-out time at the hotel in Cairo at 12:00 midday<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Late Check-out is subject to availability and maximum till 2:00 PM<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Drop off to Cairo Airport available 24 hours<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',9,NULL,8,'{\"en\":\"9 Days, 8 Nights\"}',NULL,2450.00,NULL,2450.00,NULL,2450.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,2450.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 16:56:07',1,'{\"en\":\"9 Days Egypt Luxury Tour: Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Nile Cruise | Guided Tours\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a 9-day guided tour of Egypt. Explore Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan, and enjoy a magnificent Nile Cruise. Book your unforgettable Egyptian adventure today!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','29','9-days-egypt-tour-cairo-luxor-aswan-nile-cruise-guided-tours','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 16:56:07','2026-04-01 14:48:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(9,23,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'7-nights-luxury-nile-cruise','{\"en\":\"7-Nights Luxury Nile Cruise Luxor To Luxor\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a 7-Nights Luxury Nile Cruise Luxor To Luxor. Explore iconic temples & tombs on a 5-star ship with gourmet dining. Book your timeless Egyptian journey!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>7-Night Luxury Nile Cruise from Luxor to Luxor Indulge in Timeless Elegance<br \\/>Embark on an exquisite 7-night journey along the legendary Nile River, a voyage that seamlessly blends the captivating history of ancient Egypt with the unparalleled comfort and sophistication of a 5-star luxury cruise.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This meticulously crafted itinerary, beginning and concluding in the magnificent city of Luxor, offers an immersive exploration of the Nile Valley&rsquo;s most iconic archaeological sites and breathtaking landscapes. Prepare to be pampered with world-class amenities, gourmet dining, and expertly guided tours that will transport you back in time to the era of pharaohs and gods.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>7-night luxury Nile cruise is an extended immersion into the heart of Egypt, providing ample time to not only visit the major historical sites but also to relax and savor the unique rhythm of life along the river. These cruises are designed for discerning travelers who appreciate the finer things in life and seek an unforgettable cultural experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The sheer scale and intricate details of Karnak Temple, the beautifully illuminated Luxor Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The vibrant artistry within the tombs of the Valley of the Kings, the unique architecture of Hatshepsut\'s Temple, the experience of navigating the Esna Lock.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The exceptionally preserved Temple of Horus in Edfu, the unique dual dedication of the Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The scale of the High Dam, the ancient stoneworking techniques at the Unfinished Obelisk, the beautiful island setting of Philae Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The optional but highly recommended visit to the colossal temples of Abu Simbel, a relaxing afternoon of sailing and enjoying the Nile scenery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>full day dedicated to leisurely sailing, allowing you to fully appreciate the beauty of the Nile and enjoy the ship\'s amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 Days, 7 Nights\"}',NULL,1550.00,NULL,1550.00,NULL,1550.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,1550.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 17:53:02',10,'{\"en\":\"7-Nights Luxury Nile Cruise Luxor To Luxor\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a 7-Nights Luxury Nile Cruise Luxor To Luxor. Explore iconic temples & tombs on a 5-star ship with gourmet dining. Book your timeless Egyptian journey!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','30','7-nights-luxury-nile-cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 17:53:02','2026-04-09 12:47:07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(10,13,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'5-days-trip-to-egypt-cairo-and-luxor','{\"en\":\"5-Days Trip to Egypt Cairo and Luxor\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a 5-day trip to Egypt, exploring the wonders of Cairo and Luxor. Discover the Pyramids, Sphinx, and temples. Book your adventure today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<div>Spend 5 days exploring the attractions of Cairo and Luxor. On private guided tours, you will start your trip in Cairo. This is where you visit the iconic Great Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx. After that, you will tour the Egyptian Museum, concluding with a shopping trip at the Khan El Khalili Bazaar. <br \\/><br \\/>Then, head south of Egypt and tour the city of Luxor. In Luxor, you will discover the wonders of the ancient Egyptian civilization and get to see the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, the Valley of the Kings, Karnak, and the Luxor Temples.<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;5-day trip to Egypt focusing on Cairo and Luxor is a perfect way to experience the country&rsquo;s ancient history, iconic landmarks, and vibrant culture. This itinerary offers a mix of awe-inspiring monuments, fascinating museums, and the timeless beauty of the Nile.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Great Pyramids of Giza &amp; Sphinx: Iconic symbols of ancient Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Egyptian Museum: A treasure trove of ancient artifacts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Karnak Temple: A breathtaking complex of sanctuaries, obelisks, and columns.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Valley of the Kings: The final resting place of Egypt&rsquo;s greatest pharaohs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Luxor Temple: A stunning example of ancient Egyptian architecture.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',5,NULL,4,'{\"en\":\"5 Days, 4 Nights\"}',NULL,650.00,NULL,650.00,NULL,650.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,99,0,0,650.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 20:09:30',5,'{\"en\":\"5-Days Trip to Egypt Cairo and Luxor\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a 5-day trip to Egypt, exploring the wonders of Cairo and Luxor. Discover the Pyramids, Sphinx, and temples. Book your adventure today!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','31','5-days-trip-to-egypt-cairo-and-luxor','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 20:09:30','2026-07-21 11:11:15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(11,23,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'5-day-luxury-nile-cruise-luxor-to-aswan-with-balloon-ride','{\"en\":\"5-day luxury Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan with Balloon Ride\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a 5-day luxury Nile cruise from Luxor, including a hot air balloon ride and a visit to Abu Simbel. Experience the best of Egypt\'s ancient wonders.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Enjoy a 5-star cruise experience with full-board accommodation, elegant cabins, and top-notch service. This journey combines history, adventure, and luxury, making it a perfect way to explore Egypt&rsquo;s timeless beauty.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Other texts:<\\/strong> Highlights<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Sail to Aswan along the Nile River on a 5-star Luxury boat.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Admire the natural landscapes and small Egyptian villages along the river.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy delicious Egyptian meals.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Relaxing Nile River Journey\\\": Focus on the serene and picturesque nature of cruising the Nile.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore Luxor and Karnak Temples\\\": Highlight the grandeur and historical significance of these major sites.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>discover 5-Star Nile Cruise Luxury .<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',5,NULL,4,'{\"en\":\"5 Days, 4 Nights\"}',NULL,1810.00,NULL,1810.00,NULL,1810.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,1810.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-21 20:36:04',10,'{\"en\":\"5-day luxury Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan with Balloon Ride\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a 5-day luxury Nile cruise from Luxor, including a hot air balloon ride and a visit to Abu Simbel. Experience the best of Egypt\'s ancient wonders.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','32','5-day-luxury-Nile-Cruise-Luxor-to-Aswan-with-Balloon-Ride','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-21 20:36:04','2026-04-09 12:13:57',