e-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Valley of Kings royal tombs<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Karnak Temple architectural magnificence<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Aswan High Dam engineering marvel<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Philae Temple island sanctuary<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Professional Egyptologist guidance throughout<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Comfortable accommodation and transportation<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Book today securing limited availability for 2025 departure dates experiencing Egypt\'s golden heritage firsthand.​<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>