(32,1,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-days-ancient-egypt-discovery','{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery tour by Egypt Tours Company. Explore Cairo, Luxor, Aswan with expert guides. Egypt Historical Packages available!\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery&nbsp;<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Overview<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Experience the timeless wonders of Egypt on this exclusive 8-Day Ancient Egypt Discovery tour, carefully designed for travelers seeking history, comfort, and personalized service. From the iconic Pyramids of Giza and the treasures of the Grand Egyptian Museum to the magnificent temples of Luxor, Dendera, Aswan, and Abu Simbel, this journey showcases the country\'s most remarkable archaeological sites while offering the highest level of luxury.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your adventure begins in Cairo, where you\'ll explore the legendary Giza Plateau, home to the Great Pyramid, the Great Sphinx, and the ancient monuments of Saqqara and Memphis. Discover Egypt\'s extraordinary heritage at the Grand Egyptian Museum before flying to Luxor, the world\'s greatest open-air museum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In Upper Egypt, immerse yourself in the grandeur of the Valley of the Kings, the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, the towering columns of Karnak Temple, and the beautifully illuminated Luxor Temple. Continue your journey to the remarkably preserved Dendera Temple, dedicated to the goddess Hathor, before traveling south to the enchanting city of Aswan.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Marvel at the breathtaking temples of Abu Simbel, one of Egypt\'s most impressive UNESCO World Heritage Sites, carved directly into the mountainside by Ramses II. Complete your exploration with visits to the beautiful Philae Temple, the Aswan High Dam, and the ancient Unfinished Obelisk while enjoying the peaceful atmosphere of the Nile.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Throughout your journey, you\'ll stay in carefully selected luxury hotels, travel with private air-conditioned transportation, enjoy domestic flights between Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan, and be accompanied by a professional Egyptologist guide who brings thousands of years of history to life. With a perfect balance of guided sightseeing and leisure time, this tour offers an unforgettable experience for couples, families, and travelers who wish to discover Egypt\'s greatest treasures in comfort and style.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 days \\/ 7 nights\"}',NULL,1990.00,NULL,1990.00,NULL,1990.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,80,0,0,1990.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,1,'2025-11-06 08:50:38',2,'{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery\"}','{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery tour by Egypt Tours Company. Explore Cairo, Luxor, Aswan with expert guides. Egypt Historical Packages available!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','71','8-Days-Ancient-Egypt-Discovery','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-06 08:50:38','2026-08-28 20:46:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(33,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-days-ancient-egypt-discovery-2','{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery tour by Egypt Tours Company. Explore Cairo, Luxor, Aswan with expert guides. Egypt Historical Packages available!\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 id=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Important Travel Advisories and Recommendations for 8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery Tour prices and itineraries are subject to change based on seasonal variations, availability, and booking dates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Egypt Tours Company reserves the right to modify the tour sequence while maintaining all included visits.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hotel and cruise boat categories remain consistent, though specific properties may vary based on availability.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>During peak travel seasons including Christmas, New Year, and Easter holidays, rates increase and early booking is essential.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flight schedules between Cairo, Aswan, and Luxor may be adjusted, requiring itinerary sequence modifications.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Weather conditions particularly during summer months can affect outdoor activities and monument visits.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Political situations and security measures may necessitate route or site changes for traveler safety.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Entrance fees to special tombs like Tutankhamun or Seti I in the Valley of Kings require separate tickets not included in the standard package.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional excursions including Abu Simbel temples, hot air balloon rides, and sound and light shows are subject to availability and weather conditions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travelers should inform Egypt Tours Company of dietary restrictions, medical conditions, mobility limitations, or special requirements during booking.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ramadan observances may affect restaurant operations and opening hours though tour operations continue normally.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Currency exchange rates fluctuate and payments in foreign currency are calculated at prevailing rates on the payment date.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Essential Items to Pack<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Lightweight breathable cotton or linen clothes suitable for warm climate.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Modest long pants and maxi skirts for temple visits.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable walking shorts and long-sleeve shirts for sun protection.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Light jacket for air-conditioned spaces and cool evenings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Swimsuit for cruise pool.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Scarf or shawl for women visiting religious sites.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable walking shoes with good arch support.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Sandals for casual wear.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hat or cap for sun protection.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>Health and Personal Care<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>High SPF sunscreen and after-sun lotion.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Insect repellent spray.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Personal prescription medications with copies of prescriptions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Basic first aid supplies including bandages and pain relievers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hand sanitizer and wet wipes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Lip balm with SPF protection.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Personal toiletries and hygiene products.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Motion sickness medication for Nile cruise if prone to seasickness.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 days \\/ 7 nights\"}',NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-06 09:12:12',10,'{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery\"}','{\"en\":\"8 Days Ancient Egypt Discovery tour by Egypt Tours Company. Explore Cairo, Luxor, Aswan with expert guides. Egypt Historical Packages available!\"}