(34,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'4-days-egypt-short-break-pyramids-grand-egyptian-museum-and-nile-cruise','{\"en\":\"4 Days Egypt short break Pyramids & Grand Egyptian Museum and Nile Cruise dinner \"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience 4 Days Egypt Short Break Pyramids & Grand Egyptian Museum with Nile Cruise dinner. Perfect Egypt Holiday Package for quick getaways.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 id=\\\"travel-advisory-and-important-notes\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Travel Advisory and Important Notes for 4 Days Egypt short break Pyramids &amp; Grand Egyptian Museum and Nile Cruise dinner<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Check pricing and final rates<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Prices for Egypt Tours Company packages may fluctuate due to seasonal demand, hotel availability, and exchange rate variations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>At booking, confirm the final rates to avoid unexpected costs.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Plan itinerary adjustments with your guide<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Your guide may adjust itinerary sequences and timings based on:\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Traffic conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Museum opening hours<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cruise departure schedules<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Group size<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>These adjustments aim to optimize your overall experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Book Grand Egyptian Museum tickets early<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Reserve museum tickets in advance because daily capacity is controlled.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Popular time slots fill quickly, especially from November through March (peak tourism months).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Verify passport and visa requirements<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Ensure your passport is valid for at least 6 months beyond your travel dates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check the latest Egypt visa requirements for your nationality before departure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Inform special needs at booking<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>If you have health conditions, mobility limitations, or dietary restrictions, inform Egypt Tours Company at booking time.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>This allows for appropriate arrangements for your comfort and safety.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"6\\\">\\r\\n<li>Protect documents and be aware of security<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Keep photocopies of important documents separate from originals.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Consider registering with your embassy if traveling during politically sensitive periods.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Note: Tourist areas generally have enhanced security presence.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>If you\'d like, I can convert these into a printable checklist or tailor them to your specific trip dates and nationality.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"unique-program-highlights\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Unique Program Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Overview of the 4 Days Egypt short break Pyramids &amp; Grand Egyptian Museum and Nile Cruise dinner:<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Exclusive itinerary designed for maximum impact with minimal time commitment.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Combines three unmissable Cairo experiences into one well-timed program.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Grand Egyptian Museum crown jewel<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Opened November 2025; the world&rsquo;s largest archaeological museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Houses over 100,000 artifacts spanning 5,000 years of civilization.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Highlights include King Tutankhamun&rsquo;s complete 5,398-piece treasure collection in one display.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Also features Khufu&rsquo;s reconstructed Solar Boat and colossal statues.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Thoughtfully paced itinerary<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Full morning sessions dedicated to the Pyramids of Giza and the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Aims for deep exploration with minimal tourist fatigue.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Balanced schedule to maximize viewing time and immersion.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Strategic hotel location<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Hotel is near the Giza Plateau to minimize long commutes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Provides pyramid views from your accommodation, enhancing the experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Nile dinner cruise evening<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Evening entertainment with a Nile dinner cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cultural immersion through traditional belly dance and Tanoura spinning dervish performances.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Authentic Egyptian cuisine prepared fresh onboard.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>If you&rsquo;d like, I can convert these into a printable checklist, a concise itinerary outline with daily timings, or tailor the steps to specific travel dates and interests.<\\/p>\"}','days',4,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"4 Days\"}',NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-06 10:15:00',10,'{\"en\":\"4 Days Egypt Short Break Tourist Program: Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum & Nile Cruise Dinner\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience 4 Days Egypt Short Break Pyramids & Grand Egyptian Museum with Nile Cruise dinner. Perfect Egypt Holiday Package for quick getaways.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','74','4-Days-Egypt-short-break-Pyramids-Grand-Egyptian-Museum-and-Nile-Cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-06 10:15:00','2026-07-05 11:27:23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(35,8,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'4-nights-5-days-cairo-and-alexandria-tour-package','{\"en\":\"4 Nights 5 Days Cairo and Alexandria Tour Package\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt with our 4 Nights 5 Days Cairo & Alexandria Tour Package. Visit pyramids, museums & Mediterranean gems. Book your Egypt Holiday Package now!\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 id=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Advisory and Warnings for 4 Nights 5 Days Cairo and Alexandria Tour Package<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Tour prices fluctuate based on seasonal&nbsp;demand, hotel availability, and fuel costs. Final&nbsp;pricing confirmation requires checking current rates 30 days before travel&nbsp;dates. High season periods (October-April) and holiday weeks command premium rates.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Itinerary sequences&nbsp;may adjust due to attraction opening hours, Friday&nbsp;closures, or special events. Tour operators reserve&nbsp;rights to modify visit order while maintaining all included sites. Advance notification of significant changes will&nbsp;be communicated promptly.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Weather conditions impact&nbsp;outdoor activities, particularly during summer months (June-August)&nbsp;when temperatures exceed 40&deg;C.&nbsp;Morning tours start early to avoid midday heat exposure. Winter&nbsp;visits (December-February) may require light jackets for evening&nbsp;activities.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Political demonstrations occasionally occur in Cairo downtown areas near&nbsp;Tahrir Square. Tour routes avoid protest zones,&nbsp;and professional guides monitor local conditions continuously. Egyptian tourism police maintain strong&nbsp;security presence at all major attractions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Health precautions include drinking only bottled water and avoiding street food vendors. Pharmacies stock&nbsp;international medications, but bringing personal prescriptions is recommended. Travel&nbsp;insurance covering medical emergencies and trip cancellations provides essential protection.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Currency exchange rates vary&nbsp;between hotels, airports, and local exchange offices. ATMs accepting international cards are&nbsp;widely available in Cairo and Alexandria. Carrying mixed denominations of Egyptian Pounds facilitates small purchases&nbsp;and tipping.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Things to Pack for 4 Nights 5 Days Cairo and Alexandria Tour Package<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"marker:text-quiet list-disc\\\">\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Lightweight breathable cotton shirts and t-shirts<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Long&nbsp;loose pants or maxi skirts for&nbsp;site visits<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Modest dress covering shoulders and knees<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Light&nbsp;jacket or cardigan for air-conditioned venues<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Comfortable&nbsp;closed-toe walking shoes with good support<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Sandals for hotel&nbsp;and casual evening wear<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Swimwear for hotel pool facilities<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Wide-brimmed sun&nbsp;hat<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Sunglasses with UV protection<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">Scarf for women visiting mosques<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',5,NULL,4,'{\"en\":\"5 Days, 4 Nights\"}',NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-06 19:27:37',10,'{\"en\":\"4 Nights 5 Days Cairo and Alexandria Tour Package\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt with our 4 Nights 5 Days Cairo & Alexandria Tour Package. Visit pyramids, museums & Mediterranean gems. Book your Egypt Holiday Package now!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','75','4-Nights-5-Days-Cairo-and-Alexandria-Tour-Package','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-06 19:27:37','2026-07-05 11:10:06',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(36,26,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'5-days-egypt-package-cairo-luxor-abu-simbel','{\"en\":\"5 Days Egypt Package: Cairo, Luxor & Abu Simbel\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt in 5 days with our Egypt Historical Package. Visit Cairo, Luxor & Abu Simbel. Book your dream tour with Egypt Tours Company now.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\">What Makes This 5 Days Egypt Package: Cairo, Luxor &amp; Abu Simbel Unique?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">This Egypt tour package stands apart through its comprehensive coverage of UNESCO World Heritage Sites within an efficient timeframe. Unlike extended tours, this five day Egypt itinerary focuses exclusively on the nation\'s most significant archaeological treasures without unnecessary diversions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\">What Historical Treasures Await at the Egyptian Museum?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Overview of Cairo&rsquo;s Egyptian Museum<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Houses over 120,000 authentic artifacts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Covers about 5,000 years of Egyptian civilization.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Tutankhamun collection<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Includes the complete funerary treasures of King Tutankhamun.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Treasures discovered in 1922 by Howard Carter.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Key types of exhibits on display<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Golden sarcophagi and intricate jewelry.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ceremonial objects showcasing ancient craftsmanship.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Gallery organization and chronology<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Exhibits are organized chronologically.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Traces Egypt&rsquo;s evolution from prehistoric settlements to Roman occupation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Mummies and preservation<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Mummies of famous pharaohs, including Ramses II.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Displayed in climate-controlled chambers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Provides tangible connections to Egypt&rsquo;s rulers during the golden ages.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\">What Travel Essentials Should You Pack?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Clothing for Egypt&rsquo;s climate<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Pack lightweight, breathable cotton or linen clothing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Include long-sleeved shirts and trousers for sun protection and to respect local norms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Sun protection and headwear<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Bring high-SPF sunscreen.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Pack a wide-brimmed hat.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Eye and feet comfort<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Bring quality sunglasses.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Pack comfortable walking shoes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Electronics and power<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Carry universal power adapters (Egypt uses European-style two-pin outlets).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Daily essentials in a small backpack<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Water bottle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Camera.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Medications.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travel documents.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Security backups<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Make photocopies of passports.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Make photocopies of travel insurance documentation (keep copies separate from originals).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2 animate-in fade-in-25 duration-700\\\">This 5 Days Egypt Package: Cairo, Luxor &amp; Abu Simbel delivers unmatched value for travelers seeking comprehensive historical immersion across Cairo, Luxor, and Abu Simbel. The carefully structured itinerary balances iconic attractions with comfortable pacing, ensuring memorable experiences without exhausting schedules.​<\\/p>\"}','days',5,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"5 Days\"}',NULL,799.00,NULL,799.00,NULL,799.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,799.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-06 20:26:40',6,'{\"en\":\"5 Days Egypt Package: Cairo, Luxor & Abu Simbel\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt in 5 days with our Egypt Historical Package. Visit Cairo, Luxor & Abu Simbel. Book your dream tour with Egypt Tours Company now.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','76','5-Days-Egypt-Package-Cairo-Luxor-Abu-Simbel','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-06 20:26:40','2026-08-28 20:44:16',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(37,26,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'3-days-cairo-luxor-tour-package','{\"en\":\"3 Days Cairo & Luxor tour package \"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience Egypt\'s wonders with our 3 Days Cairo & Luxor tour package. Visit pyramids, temples & ancient treasures. Book your Egypt Short Breaks now!\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">3 Days Cairo &amp; Luxor tour package<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>This is a 3 Days Cairo &amp; Luxor tour package introducing Egypt&rsquo;s ancient civilization.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>It combines Cairo&rsquo;s Old Kingdom highlights with Luxor&rsquo;s New Kingdom treasures.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>It uses domestic flights, expert Egyptologist guides, and 4-star accommodations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Cairo highlights to explore<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Giza Pyramids, the last remaining wonder of the ancient world, built over 4,500 years ago.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Grand Egyptian Museum to see 5,000 years of history and the Tutankhamun treasures discovered in 1922.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Luxor highlights to explore<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Experience Luxor as the &ldquo;world&rsquo;s greatest open-air museum.&rdquo;<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See Thebes&rsquo; legacy through temple complexes and decorated tombs of pharaohs like Ramses II and Hatshepsut.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour the Valley of the Kings, the royal necropolis where mummies and treasures are preserved.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Karnak Temple Complex, developed over 2,000 years and one of the largest religious sites ever built.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Tour structure and pacing<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>The itinerary uses efficient domestic flights between Cairo and Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guides are expert Egyptologists who explain hieroglyphics, beliefs, and daily life in pharaonic times.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>The schedule is designed to maximize time at each site with comfortable pacing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Day-by-day touring approach<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Morning touring is planned to take advantage of cooler temperatures and fewer crowds.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>This enhances photography opportunities and overall experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"tips--warnings\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Tips &amp; Warnings<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Tour pricing<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Prices can change due to seasonal demand, fuel surcharges, and hotel availability.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Action: Always confirm the final price before making a reservation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Flight scheduling<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Cairo&ndash;Luxor flight timings may vary with seasons and airline changes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Action: Check and re-confirm flight times close to departure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Site capacity and scheduling<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Some archaeological sites limit visitor numbers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Action: Plan for early morning starts to improve access and reduce crowds.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Weather considerations<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Egypt can experience extreme heat in May&ndash;September.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Action: Prepare for hot outdoor touring; stay hydrated and pace activities accordingly.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Extra charges for tombs<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Specialized tomb entries in the Valley of the Kings may incur additional costs.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Action: Budget for potential extra fees and confirm what&rsquo;s included.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"what-to-bring\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">What to Bring<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"marker:text-quiet list-disc\\\">\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Valid passport with minimum 6 months validity<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Lightweight, breathable long-sleeved clothing<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Comfortable walking shoes with good grip<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Wide-brimmed sun hat and sunglasses<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">High SPF sunscreen and lip balm<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Reusable water bottle with filter<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Small backpack for daily essentials<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Power adapter (Type C or Type F plugs)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Camera with extra memory cards and batteries<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Personal medications and basic first aid supplies<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',3,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"3 Days\"}',NULL,599.00,NULL,599.00,NULL,599.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,599.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-07 12:24:54',2,'{\"en\":\"3 Days Cairo & Luxor tour package \"}','{\"en\":\"Experience Egypt\'s wonders with our 3 Days Cairo & Luxor tour package. Visit pyramids, temples & ancient treasures. Book your Egypt Short Breaks now!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','77','3-Days-Cairo-&-Luxor-tour-package-','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-07 12:24:54','2026-08-28 18:51:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(38,26,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'3-days-cairo-short-break','{\"en\":\"3 Days Cairo short break \"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Book 3 Days Cairo Short Break with Egypt Tours Company. Egyptian Museum, Pyramids, Islamic Cairo tours. Unforgettable Egypt Short Breaks.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Cairo stands as one of the world\'s most fascinating cities, blending millennia of history with vibrant modern culture. This 3-day short break offers travelers an immersive experience through Egypt\'s capital, showcasing iconic landmarks and hidden treasures. Egypt Tours Company provides carefully crafted itineraries that maximize your time while ensuring comfortable exploration of Cairo\'s unmissable attractions.​<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"why-choose-this-cairo-short-break-package\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Why Choose 3 Days Cairo short break?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Targeted immersion: This Cairo Short Break Package is designed for travelers seeking concentrated cultural immersion within a limited timeframe.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Balanced itinerary: The plan balances famous archaeological sites with authentic local experiences to ensure comprehensive coverage of Cairo&rsquo;s highlights.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Cultural context: Cairo serves as a gateway to understanding ancient Pharaonic civilization and Islamic heritage, enriching the travel experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Strong visitor interest: With over 15 million tourists visiting Egypt annually, the package taps into a proven demand for Cairo&rsquo;s cultural offerings.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Expert guidance: Professional guides provide deep knowledge and context to enhance site visits and experiences.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Efficient experience: The package focuses on maximizing impact and learning in a short time, making it ideal for travelers with tight schedules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\">What Should You Pack for 3 Days Cairo short break&nbsp;?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Footwear: Bring comfortable walking shoes, as you&rsquo;ll spend lots of time exploring archaeological sites and weaving through bazaar alleyways.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Clothing: Pack lightweight, modest clothing to respect local customs and stay cool in Cairo&rsquo;s warm climate (average temperatures 25&ndash;35&deg;C year-round).<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Sun protection: Include sunscreen, sunglasses, and a wide-brimmed hat to shield yourself from the intense desert sun during outdoor excursions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Daypack: Bring a small backpack to carry water bottles, cameras, and personal items comfortably throughout daily activities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\"}','days',3,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"3 Days\"}',NULL,430.00,NULL,430.00,NULL,430.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,430.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-07 12:46:14',2,'{\"en\":\"3 Days Cairo short break \"}','{\"en\":\"Book 3 Days Cairo Short Break with Egypt Tours Company. Egyptian Museum, Pyramids, Islamic Cairo tours. Unforgettable Egypt Short Breaks.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','78','3-Days-Cairo-short-break-','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-07 12:46:14','2026-08-28 18:37:31',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(39,26,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'3-days-cairo-luxor-abu-simbel-package','{\"en\":\"3 days Cairo Luxor & Abu Simbel package\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Egypt\'s treasures: 3-day Cairo Luxor Abu Simbel package with pyramids, Valley of Kings & ancient temples. Egypt Historical Packages.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\">What Historical Sites Will You Visit in 3 days Cairo Luxor &amp; Abu Simbel package?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Abu Simbel &ndash; Great Temple of Ramses II<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Great Temple of Ramses II at Abu Simbel<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Time period: New Kingdom, around 1264 BC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Focus: Massive statue fa&ccedil;ade, inscriptions, and temple complexes<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Abu Simbel &ndash; Temple of Hathor<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Temple of Hathor at Abu Simbel<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Time period: New Kingdom<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Focus: Hypostyle halls, goddess Hathor imagery, connecting temples<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Valley of the Kings<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Explore the royal tombs of the New Kingdom pharaohs<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Time window: 1539&ndash;1075 BC<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Focus: Tutankhamun&rsquo;s tomb area (where applicable), tomb decorations, and mortuary chambers<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Queen Hatshepsut&rsquo;s Mortuary Temple<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit Hatshepsut&rsquo;s mortuary temple at Deir el-Bahari<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Significance: Noted for its unique architecture and axial, terraced design<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Karnak Temple Complex<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Tour the Karnak Complex<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Main focus: Temple of Amun-Ra, pylons, hypostyle hall, sacred lake<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Time span: Built and expanded over roughly 2,000 years by successive pharaohs<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"6\\\">\\r\\n<li>Luxor Temple<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit Luxor Temple<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Main contributors: Amenhotep III and Ramses II<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Focus: Processional axis, court temples, and inner sanctums<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\"><strong>What should I bring for the 3 days Cairo Luxor &amp; Abu Simbel package?<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Footwear<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Bring comfortable walking shoes or sneakers suitable for long days of sightseeing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Sun protection<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>hat<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>sunglasses<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>sunscreen (broad-spectrum, high SPF)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Clothing<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>light, breathable clothing<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>ensure shoulders and knees are covered for temple visits<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Camera gear<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>camera equipment for capturing monuments (camera, extra batteries, memory cards)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Medications and health items<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>personal medications (enough for the trip plus a small backup)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>basic first-aid supplies (band-aids, pain relievers)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"6\\\">\\r\\n<li>Travel documents<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>travel insurance documents<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>passport copies (digital and printed)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',3,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"3 Days\"}',NULL,599.00,NULL,599.00,NULL,599.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,599.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-07 13:12:00',2,'{\"en\":\"3 days Cairo Luxor & 