(40,26,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'2-days-aswan-and-abu-simbel-package','{\"en\":\"2 days Aswan and Abu Simbel package\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore ancient wonders with our 2 days Aswan and Abu Simbel package. Visit Philae Temple, High Dam, and Ramses II temples. Book now!\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2 id=\\\"discover-the-timeless-wonders-of-upper-egypt\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Discover the Timeless Wonders of our 2 days Aswan and Abu Simbel package<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Experience the unparalleled grandeur of ancient Egyptian civilization through this carefully curated 2 days Aswan and Abu Simbel package that combines Aswan\'s architectural marvels with Abu Simbel\'s legendary rock temples. Egypt Tours Company\'s meticulously designed tour package offers privileged access to six UNESCO-recognized historical sites that have captivated travelers for millennia.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"travel-advisories-and-important-recommendations\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">Travel Advisories and Important Recommendations<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Transportation times (Aswan to Abu Simbel)<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Transportation times can vary based on road conditions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Security checkpoints can impact travel time.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Convoy schedules for tourist safety set by Egyptian authorities can affect timing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travelers should confirm departure times 24&ndash;48 hours before the tour begins.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Temple entrance and photography policies<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Entrance regulations and photography policies may change without prior notice (as per Egyptian Ministry of Antiquities guidelines).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visitors with mobility limitations should inform the tour operator in advance.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Temple sites involve stairs, uneven surfaces, and boat transfers to Philae Temple, which can impact accessibility.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Travel insurance and holiday schedules<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Obtain travel insurance that covers medical emergencies, trip cancellations, and personal belongings (strongly recommended for all international travelers).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>During Ramadan or Egyptian national holidays, operating hours and service availability may differ from standard schedules.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',2,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"2 Days\"}',NULL,265.00,NULL,265.00,NULL,265.00,NULL,NULL,2,0,88,0,0,265.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,2,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-07 13:33:45',1,'{\"en\":\"2 days Aswan and Abu Simbel package\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore ancient wonders with our 2 days Aswan and Abu Simbel package. Visit Philae Temple, High Dam, and Ramses II temples. Book now!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','80','2-days-Aswan-and-Abu-Simbel-package','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-07 13:33:45','2026-08-28 18:42:31',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(41,17,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'nile-cruise-aswan-to-luxor-3-nights','{\"en\":\"Nile cruise Aswan to Luxor 3 nights\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience a 3-night Nile cruise tour package Aswan to Luxor. Egypt Classic Packages featuring temples, sightseeing & luxury. Reserve today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">The Nile cruise aswan to Luxor 3 nights represents one of the most historically significant routes along the Nile River, connecting two of Egypt\'s most treasured cities through a waterway that has served as the lifeblood of civilization for over 5,000 years. This 3-night cruise experience offers travelers an unparalleled opportunity to witness the grandeur of ancient Egyptian architecture while enjoying modern luxury amenities aboard a five-star vessel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\"><strong>Consultation &amp; Warnings<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Be aware of price and itinerary variability<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Prices and itineraries can change with seasons, fuel costs, and government regulations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Understand the tour program may be modified<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Egypt Tours Company may adjust the tour due to weather, security concerns, or archaeological site maintenance.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Confirm bookings based on availability<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Booking is subject to availability; early reservations are strongly recommended during peak seasons (October to April).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Consider travel insurance<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Obtain travel insurance to cover medical emergencies, trip cancellations, or unexpected delays.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Check vaccination recommendations<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Consult your healthcare provider for any recommended vaccinations before traveling to Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"6\\\">\\r\\n<li>Note cruise schedule flexibility<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Nile cruise schedules may be adjusted due to water levels, lock timings, or port authority regulations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\"><strong>Things to Carry&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul class=\\\"marker:text-quiet list-disc\\\">\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Valid passport with at least 6 months validity<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Comfortable walking shoes for temple visits<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Sunglasses and wide-brimmed hat for sun protection<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Sunscreen with high SPF (30 or above)<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p]:my-0\\\">\\r\\n<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt