(43,16,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'nile-cruise-luxor-to-aswan-4-nights-5-days','{\"en\":\"4-Night Luxury Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan | Abu Simbel Included \"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Book the ultimate Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days. Egypt Luxury Nile Cruise featuring Karnak, Valley of Kings, and Philae Temple.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\">Embark on an unforgettable journey through ancient Egyptian civilization aboard our premium Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days. This carefully curated 5-day adventure combines luxury accommodation with immersive cultural experiences, allowing you to witness the magnificent temples and monuments that have stood for millennia along the legendary Nile River.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\\\"><strong>Important Advisories and Tips<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Pricing and seasons<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Prices vary by season, cabin category, and group size.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Peak season is December&ndash;February and typically has higher rates than shoulder months.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Itinerary adjustments<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>itineraries may adjust slightly due to river conditions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cruise traffic at temple docking points or government regulations can affect site access hours.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Booking timing<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>During high season, book at least 30&ndash;60 days in advance to secure preferred cabin locations and cruise ship options.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Vessel substitutions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Egypt Tours Company reserves the right to substitute similar-quality vessels if operational needs require changes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Currency and pricing<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Exchange rates fluctuate; confirm final pricing in your preferred currency before payment.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"6\\\">\\r\\n<li>Optional excursions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Optional excursions require minimum participant numbers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Book these in advance through your onboard cruise director.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"7\\\">\\r\\n<li>Photography restrictions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Temple photography is restricted at certain sites, especially inside tombs at the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"8\\\">\\r\\n<li>Dress code and conduct<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Dress modestly at religious and historical sites.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cover shoulders and knees to respect cultural traditions and site regulations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Ultimately, this Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days represents an unparalleled opportunity to immerse yourself in 5,000 years of continuous civilization while enjoying modern luxury amenities. The journey encompasses 8 spectacular archaeological sites, expert-guided explorations, and the timeless experience of sailing the world\'s longest river through landscapes barely changed since pharaonic times. Whether you\'re a first-time Egypt visitor or returning enthusiast, this 5-day adventure with Egypt Tours Company delivers educational enrichment, cultural insights, and memories that endure long after you\'ve returned home.<\\/p>\"}','days',5,NULL,4,'{\"en\":\"5 Days, 4 Nights\"}',NULL,1480.00,NULL,1480.00,NULL,1480.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,88,0,0,1480.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-07 17:26:23',10,'{\"en\":\"4-Night Luxury Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan | Abu Simbel Included \"}','{\"en\":\"Book the ultimate Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days. Egypt Luxury Nile Cruise featuring Karnak, Valley of Kings, and Philae Temple.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','83','Nile-Cruise-Luxor-to-Aswan-4-nights-5-days','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-07 17:26:23','2026-08-28 21:04:10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(44,17,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'2025-11-08-nile-cruise-luxor-to-aswan-4-nights-5-days','{\"en\":\"Luxury Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the luxury Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days Package with Egypt Tours Company. 4 nights of luxury exploring ancient temples and pharaonic wonders.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Embark on an unforgettable Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days package that combines Egypt\'s ancient wonders with modern luxury aboard a 5-star vessel. This meticulously crafted journey spans 4 nights and 5 days, allowing travelers to explore pharaonic temples, royal tombs, and architectural marvels while sailing the legendary Nile River. Egypt Tours Company delivers comprehensive experiences that satisfy history enthusiasts and luxury seekers alike.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\">Why Choose This Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days Experience<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Choose a Luxor&ndash;Aswan Nile cruise package to visit key Egyptian sites.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travel route covers two ancient centers: Luxor and Aswan, with stops at seven UNESCO sites (including Karnak, Valley of the Kings, Edfu, Kom Ombo, and Philae).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Prefer river cruising over bus tours for comfortable travel and scenic views of rural Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a 4-night itinerary to balance sightseeing with relaxation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Benefit from moving accommodations and full-board meals (no daily packing or meal planning).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Have Egyptologists onshore to explain hieroglyphics, rituals, and construction details.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Start in Luxor with two full days on East and West Banks for monuments.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Sail south to less crowded sites like Edfu and Kom Ombo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>End in Aswan for a relaxed finale, with optional felucca sail or Abu Simbel extension planning.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p>Ultimately, a Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days package delivers unmatched access to Egypt\'s greatest archaeological treasures combined with comfortable river transportation and full-service amenities.<\\/p>\"}','days',5,NULL,4,'{\"en\":\"5 Days, 4 Nights\"}',NULL,1350.00,NULL,1350.00,NULL,1350.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,80,0,0,1350.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-08 12:14:38',10,'{\"en\":\"Luxury Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the luxury Nile Cruise Luxor to Aswan 4 nights 5 days Package with Egypt Tours Company. 4 nights of luxury exploring ancient temples and pharaonic wonders.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','84','2025-11-08-Nile-Cruise-Luxor-to-Aswan-4-nights-5-days','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-11-08 12:14:38','2026-08-28 21:31:06',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
