pricing as standard).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2 class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0\\\"><strong>Essential Items to Pack for Your Journey<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Clothing for hot climates: Pack lightweight, breathable clothes: cotton shirts, loose trousers, and walking shorts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"2\\\">\\r\\n<li>Footwear: Bring comfortable closed-toe walking shoes with good arch support for archaeological sites and uneven terrain.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"3\\\">\\r\\n<li>Beach and water activities: Pack swimwear, a beach towel, and water shoes for Red Sea resort activities and snorkeling.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"4\\\">\\r\\n<li>Sun protection: Wide-brimmed sun hat, polarized sunglasses, and high SPF sunscreen.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"5\\\">\\r\\n<li>Climate control and layering: Light jacket or sweater for air-conditioned transports, evening Nile breezes, and early mornings (e.g., Abu Simbel).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"6\\\">\\r\\n<li>Hydration and gadgets: Insulated, refillable water bottle with built-in filter.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"7\\\">\\r\\n<li>Documents and backups: Photocopies of passport, visa, and travel insurance stored separately from originals.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<ol start=\\\"8\\\">\\r\\n<li>Health and safety: Personal first aid kit (anti-diarrheal meds, pain relievers, band-aids, prescription meds in original packaging).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',14,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"14 Days\"}',NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,0.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-08 14:09:37',10,'{\"en\":\"14 day Egypt tour package& Red Sea adventure \"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt\'s wonders with our 14 day Egypt tour package & Red Sea adventure. Visit pyramids, Nile cruise & beaches. Egypt Tours Company.