(48,1,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'10-days-egypt-highlights-cairo-alexandria-luxor','{\"en\":\" 10 Days Egypt Highlights – Cairo, Alexandria & Luxor\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Egypt\'s greatest ancient treasures on this 10-day private tour through Cairo, Alexandria, Luxor, and Aswan. Visit the Giza Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, Valley of the Kings, Karnak Temple, Dendera, Abydos, Philae Temple, and Abu Simbel with expert Egyptologist guides.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Exploring Egypt\'s timeless wonders across three iconic destinations delivers an unforgettable journey through ancient civilization and Mediterranean heritage. This &nbsp;10 Days Egypt Highlights &ndash; Cairo, Alexandria &amp; Luxor combines Cairo\'s monumental pyramids, Alexandria\'s coastal treasures, and Luxor\'s magnificent temples into a comprehensive historical experience. Egypt Tours Company crafts this itinerary to maximize cultural immersion while ensuring comfortable travel and expert guidance throughout your exploration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 id=\\\"what-makes-this-10-day-egypt-tour-package-unique\\\" class=\\\"mb-2 mt-4 font-display font-semimedium text-base first:mt-0 md:text-lg [hr+&amp;]:mt-4\\\">What Makes This &nbsp;10 Days Egypt Highlights &ndash; Cairo, Alexandria &amp; Luxor Package Unique?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n<li>Visit three key Egyptian destinations: Cairo, Alexandria, and Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Spend enough days in each location to deeply explore major attractions and hidden gems.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ensure seamless transitions with private transportation between cities.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Arrange pre-booked accommodations in each city for convenience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Rely on Egypt Tours Company&rsquo;s expertise and seamless logistics.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Experience a mix of famous landmarks and authentic local experiences.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travel with professional Egyptologists who provide engaging, narrative context about pharaohs, queens, and ancient civilizations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ol>