(53,21,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-day-deluxe-nile-cruise-package-from-luxor-to-luxor-ultimate-egypt-experience','{\"en\":\"8-Day Deluxe Nile Cruise Package from Luxor to Luxor | Ultimate Egypt Experience\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Enjoy an 8-day deluxe Nile cruise from Luxor to Luxor. Explore Karnak, Valley of the Kings, Edfu, Kom Ombo, Aswan & Philae with expert guides and full-board comfort.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Enjoy an unforgettable 8-day deluxe Nile cruise from Luxor to Luxor, combining ancient history, luxurious comfort, and scenic Nile landscapes. This extended journey allows you to explore Egypt&rsquo;s most impressive temples and monuments at a relaxed pace. Visit Karnak Temple, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, Edfu, Kom Ombo, Aswan&rsquo;s Philae Temple, and the High Dam with a professional Egyptologist guide. Sail through the heart of Egypt while enjoying spacious cabins, gourmet meals, and exceptional service on board. This package offers the perfect blend of culture, relaxation, and immersive sightseeing, making it ideal for travelers seeking a deeper experience of the Nile. All transfers, entrance fees, and guided tours are included for a seamless and memorable holiday.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Sail the Nile on a 5-star deluxe cruise from Luxor to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover ancient wonders including Karnak, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, and Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Edfu Temple, one of Egypt&rsquo;s best-preserved temples dedicated to Horus.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the unique Kom Ombo Temple, shared by Sobek &amp; Horus.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a private, guided excursion to the magnificent Abu Simbel Temples.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Experience Aswan&rsquo;s highlights: Philae Temple, High Dam, and Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Full-board luxury accommodation with beautiful Nile views.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide and all transfers in air-conditioned vehicles.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 Days, 7 Nights\"}',NULL,1450.00,NULL,1450.00,NULL,1450.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,99,0,0,1450.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-12-08 13:13:04',10,'{\"en\":\"8-Day Deluxe Nile Cruise Package from Luxor to Luxor| Ultimate Egypt Experience\"}','{\"en\":\"Enjoy an 8-day deluxe Nile cruise from Luxor to Luxor. Explore Karnak, Valley of the Kings, Edfu, Kom Ombo, Aswan & Philae with expert guides and full-board comfort.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','93','8-Day-Deluxe-Nile-Cruise-Package-from-Luxor-to-Luxor-Ultimate-Egypt-Experience','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-12-08 13:13:04','2026-04-08 20:26:29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(54,13,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'2-day-luxor-sightseeing-tour-east-and-west-bank-with-optional-balloon-ride','{\"en\":\"2-Day Luxor Sightseeing Tour East And West Bank with Optional Balloon Ride\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Luxor’s East and West Bank in two days, including Karnak, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple and optional hot air balloon.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>2-Day Luxor Sightseeing Tour | East &amp; West Bank with Optional Balloon Ride<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This 2-day Luxor tour highlights the ancient wonders of Thebes. Explore Karnak Temple&rsquo;s colossal columns and sacred precincts, then visit Luxor Temple with its royal statues and illuminated halls. On the West Bank, step inside beautifully decorated tombs in the Valley of the Kings and admire the majestic terraces of Hatshepsut Temple. Add a magical sunrise hot air balloon experience for stunning aerial views of Luxor. With private transfers, an expert Egyptologist and comfortable scheduling, this tour offers a complete and memorable journey through one of Egypt&rsquo;s greatest archaeological cities.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Karnak Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional Balloon Ride.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',2,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"2 Day \"}',NULL,130.00,NULL,130.00,NULL,130.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,99,0,0,130.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-12-09 17:30:21',1,'{\"en\":\"2-Day Luxor Sightseeing Tour | East & West Bank with Optional Balloon Ride\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover Luxor’s East and West Bank in two days, including Karnak, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple and optional hot air balloon.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','94','2-Day-Luxor-Sightseeing-Tour-East-And-West-Bank-with-Optional-Ballo