\\"2148\\\" data-end=\\\"2178\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1hsagq0\\\">Sail between Aswan and Luxor<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2179\\\" data-end=\\\"2200\\\" data-section-id=\\\"kuot5x\\\">Visit Philae Temple<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2201\\\" data-end=\\\"2229\\\" data-section-id=\\\"ch3dil\\\">Explore Abu Simbel Temples<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2230\\\" data-end=\\\"2266\\\" data-section-id=\\\"b5qgk2\\\">Discover Kom Ombo and Edfu Temples<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"2268\\\" data-end=\\\"2285\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1j7nz4c\\\">Luxor Wonders<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2286\\\" data-end=\\\"2404\\\">\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2286\\\" data-end=\\\"2307\\\" data-section-id=\\\"17xr9d7\\\">Valley of the Kings<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2308\\\" data-end=\\\"2336\\\" data-section-id=\\\"8jjhu7\\\">Temple of Queen Hatshepsut<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2337\\\" data-end=\\\"2360\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1thtmkx\\\">Karnak Temple Complex<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2361\\\" data-end=\\\"2375\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1xt9qkx\\\">Luxor Temple<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2376\\\" data-end=\\\"2404\\\" data-section-id=\\\"o32fn7\\\">Dendera &amp; Abydos excursion<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"2406\\\" data-end=\\\"2424\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1aps28z\\\">Red Sea Escape<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2425\\\" data-end=\\\"2517\\\">\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2425\\\" data-end=\\\"2452\\\" data-section-id=\\\"e9f3hc\\\">Relax at Hurghada beaches<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2453\\\" data-end=\\\"2485\\\" data-section-id=\\\"14n7vg4\\\">Optional snorkeling and diving<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2486\\\" data-end=\\\"2517\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1lq09r0\\\">Resort stay with leisure time<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3 data-start=\\\"2519\\\" data-end=\\\"2543\\\" data-section-id=\\\"161zfv1\\\">Alexandria Discovery<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"2544\\\" data-end=\\\"2620\\\">\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2544\\\" data-end=\\\"2569\\\" data-section-id=\\\"r7fltr\\\">Bibliotheca Alexandrina<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2570\\\" data-end=\\\"2599\\\" data-section-id=\\\"9duyxx\\\">Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"2600\\\" data-end=\\\"2620\\\" data-section-id=\\\"ar33c4\\\">Citadel of Qaitbay<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"14-Day | 13-Nights\"}',NULL,3999.00,NULL,3999.00,NULL,3999.00,NULL,NULL,4,0,99,0,0,3999.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,8,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<h1 data-start=\\\"5454\\\" data-end=\\\"5485\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1maof6i\\\">Why Book With Egypt Tour Pro?<\\/h1>\\r\\n<ul data-start=\\\"5486\\\" data-end=\\\"5669\\\">\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"5486\\\" data-end=\\\"5520\\\" data-section-id=\\\"xicz6x\\\">Private customized experiences<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"5521\\\" data-end=\\\"5557\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1jozqtj\\\">Professional local Egyptologists<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"5558\\\" data-end=\\\"5586\\\" data-section-id=\\\"72srke\\\">Flexible departure dates<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"5587\\\" data-end=\\\"5613\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1tgv1yw\\\">Premium accommodations<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"5614\\\" data-end=\\\"5637\\\" data-section-id=\\\"hanekh\\\">24\\/7 travel support<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-start=\\\"5638\\\" data-end=\\\"5669\\\" data-section-id=\\\"x49iad\\\">Authentic local experiences<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-06-17 17:53:28',10,'{\"en\":\"14 Day Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor, Hurghada & Alexandria\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the ultimate 14 Day Egypt Tour Package with Egypt Tour Pro. Visit Cairo, the Giza Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, Nile Cruise, Abu Simbel, Luxor, Hurghada Red Sea, and Alexandria with expert guides, hotels, domestic flights, and unforgettable experiences.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','110','14-Day-Egypt-Tour-Package-Cairo-Nile-Cruise-Luxor-Hurghada-Alexandria','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-06-17 17:53:28','2026-06-17 19:19:43',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(71,5,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-day-cairo-nile-cruise-hurghada-family-tour','{\"en\":\"8-Day Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada Family Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the perfect 8-day Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada Family Tour. Visit the Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, sail the Nile, explore ancient temples, and relax on the Red Sea with a private family-friendly itinerary.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the perfect blend of history, adventure, and relaxation on this <strong>8-Day Cairo, Nile Cruise &amp; Hurghada Family Tour<\\/strong>, specially designed for families seeking an unforgettable vacation in Egypt. This private journey combines Egypt\'s world-famous ancient wonders with a luxurious Nile cruise and the beautiful beaches of the Red Sea, creating an ideal experience for travelers of all ages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your family adventure begins in Cairo, where you\'ll stand before the magnificent Pyramids of Giza, marvel at the legendary Great Sphinx of Giza, and explore the spectacular Grand Egyptian Museum, home to thousands of priceless treasures from ancient Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From Cairo, fly to Aswan to board your luxury Nile cruise. Sail along the legendary Nile River while visiting remarkable temples, including Philae Temple, Kom Ombo Temple, Temple of Edfu, Karnak Temple Complex, Valley of the Kings, and Mortuary Temple of Hatshepsut. Your expert Egyptologist guide will bring ancient history to life through engaging stories that captivate both children and adults.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The adventure continues in Hurghada, where your family can unwind on golden sandy beaches, swim in the crystal-clear waters of the Red Sea, or choose from exciting optional activities such as snorkeling, boat trips, or desert adventures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With private guided tours, family-friendly accommodations, domestic flights, comfortable transportation, and a carefully planned itinerary, this tour offers the perfect balance of sightseeing and leisure. Whether you\'re traveling with young children or teenagers, this vacation creates lifelong memories while showcasing the very best of Egypt in just eight unforgettable days.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private family-friendly Egypt tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Pyramids of Giza and the Great Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Domestic flight from Cairo to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>3-night Nile River Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the Temple of Edfu.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Karnak Temple and the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Relax on the beaches of Hurghada.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional snorkeling and Red Sea activities.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Expert private Egyptologist guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Family-friendly hotels and Nile cruise accommodation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned transportation throughout the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 days \\/ 7 nights\"}',NULL,1780.00,NULL,1780.00,NULL,1780.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,98,0,0,1780.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,8,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Why Choose This Family Tour?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This itinerary has been thoughtfully designed to provide families with the perfect balance of sightseeing, relaxation, and cultural experiences.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Family-Friendly Pace<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Unlike many Egypt tours that involve long road journeys, this itinerary includes domestic flights and carefully planned sightseeing, allowing families to spend more time enjoying Egypt and less time traveling.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Private Guided Experience<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy the flexibility of a private tour with your own licensed Egyptologist guide, who tailors each visit to your family\'s interests and pace.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Perfect Mix of History and Leisure<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From exploring the iconic pyramids and ancient temples to relaxing on the beaches of the Red Sea, this itinerary offers something for every family member.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Comfortable Accommodation<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Stay in carefully selected family-friendly hotels and a luxury Nile cruise offering spacious cabins, excellent dining, swimming pools, and exceptional service.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Safe and Hassle-Free Travel<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Private transportation, professional drivers, airport assistance, and experienced local guides ensure a smooth and stress-free vacation from arrival to departure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><br \\/>---<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Best Time to Take This Tour<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This family vacation is available year-round, but the most pleasant weather is generally between October and April, when daytime temperatures are ideal for sightseeing.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>October&ndash;November: Warm weather with fewer crowds.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>December&ndash;February: Peak travel season with comfortable temperatures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>March&ndash;April: Mild weather, blooming landscapes, and excellent sightseeing conditions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>May&ndash;September: Hotter temperatures, but ideal for enjoying the beaches and Red Sea resorts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-05 21:20:21',10,'{\"en\":\"8-Day Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada Family Tour | Egypt Family Vacation\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the perfect 8-day Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada Family Tour. Visit the Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, sail the Nile, explore ancient temples, and relax on the Red Sea with a private family-friendly itinerary.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','111','8-day-cairo-nile-cruise-hurghada-family-tour','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-05 21:20:21','2026-07-05 22:24:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N