(72,5,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'10-day-egypt-family-holiday','{\"en\":\"10-Day Egypt Family Holiday | Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Enjoy a memorable 10-Day Egypt Family Holiday with visits to the Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, a luxury Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and relaxing beaches in Hurghada. Perfect for families seeking adventure and comfort.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Experience the perfect combination of ancient history, cultural discovery, and seaside relaxation on this 10-Day Egypt Family Holiday, thoughtfully designed for families seeking an unforgettable vacation. From the timeless monuments of Cairo to a luxury Nile Cruise and the crystal-clear waters of the Red Sea, this journey offers exciting experiences for travelers of all ages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your adventure in Cairo, where you\'ll explore the legendary <strong>Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong>, admire the mysterious Great Sphinx of Giza, and discover thousands of priceless artifacts at the Grand Egyptian Museum. Continue your journey with a short domestic flight to Aswan, where you\'ll board a luxurious Nile cruise and sail through the heart of ancient Egypt, visiting magnificent temples and breathtaking archaeological sites.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Explore iconic landmarks including Philae Temple, Kom Ombo Temple, Temple of Edfu, Valley of the Kings, Mortuary Temple of Hatshepsut, and the spectacular Karnak Temple Complex with your private Egyptologist guide.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After discovering Egypt\'s ancient wonders, unwind in <strong>Hurghada<\\/strong>, one of the Red Sea\'s most popular family destinations. Spend two relaxing days enjoying sandy beaches, swimming pools, snorkeling opportunities, and optional excursions such as desert safaris or boat trips to nearby islands.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With private transportation, luxury accommodations, family-friendly experiences, and personalized service throughout your journey, this 10-day holiday offers the perfect balance of exploration and relaxation, creating unforgettable memories for every member of the family.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private family-friendly Egypt tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Pyramids of Giza and the Great Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Old Cairo and its historic landmarks.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Domestic flight from Cairo to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxury 3-night Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Edfu Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Karnak Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Relax for 3 nights in Hurghada.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional snorkeling and Red Sea boat trips.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Family-friendly hotels and luxury accommodations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',10,NULL,9,'{\"en\":\"10 Days \\/ 9 Nights\"}',NULL,2450.00,NULL,2450.00,NULL,2450.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,99,0,0,2450.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-06 11:01:17',10,'{\"en\":\"10-Day Egypt Family Holiday | Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Enjoy a memorable 10-Day Egypt Family Holiday with visits to the Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, a luxury Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and relaxing beaches in Hurghada. Perfect for families seeking adventure and comfort.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','112','10-day-egypt-family-holiday','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-06 11:01:17','2026-07-06 11:55:36',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(73,5,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'12-day-complete-egypt-family-tour','{\"en\":\"12-Day Complete Egypt Family Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover ancient Egypt on a 12-day historical tour covering Cairo, a Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and Alexandria. Fully guided with Egyptologist, top sights, and luxury accommodations.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Create unforgettable memories with your loved ones on this 12-Day Complete Egypt Family Tour, an exciting journey through Egypt\'s most iconic destinations. Specially designed for families, this private tour combines ancient history, a luxurious Nile cruise, and four relaxing nights on the beautiful Red Sea coast.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your adventure in Cairo, where you\'ll marvel at the legendary Pyramids of Giza, meet the mysterious Great Sphinx of Giza, and discover thousands of priceless treasures inside the magnificent Grand Egyptian Museum. Continue exploring the rich history of Old Cairo before flying to Aswan, where you\'ll board a luxurious 5-star Nile cruise.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cruise along the Nile, visiting spectacular temples including Philae Temple, Kom Ombo Temple, Temple of Edfu, Karnak Temple Complex, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, and Mortuary Temple of Hatshepsut.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Complete your Egyptian holiday with four nights in Hurghada, where golden beaches, crystal-clear waters, and optional snorkeling, diving, island cruises, and desert safaris provide the perfect ending to your family vacation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With private guides, carefully selected accommodations, comfortable transportation, and a flexible itinerary, this 12-day tour offers the ideal combination of discovery, relaxation, and unforgettable family experiences.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private family-friendly tour throughout Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Pyramids of Giza and the Great Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Old Cairo and Khan El Khalili Bazaar.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Domestic flight from Cairo to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxury 5-star Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional Abu Simbel excursion.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Edfu Temple by horse-drawn carriage.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Karnak Temple and Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Hatshepsut Temple and Colossi of Memnon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional sunrise Hot Air Balloon ride.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Four relaxing nights in Hurghada.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional snorkeling, diving, island cruises, and desert safari.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide throughout the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Perfect for Families<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Families with children.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Multi-generational family vacations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>First-time visitors to Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travelers looking for a mix of culture and beach relaxation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private and tailor-made family holidays<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"12-Day 11-Night \"}',NULL,2900.00,NULL,2900.00,NULL,2900.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,99,0,0,2900.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-06 17:46:53',10,'{\"en\":\"12-Day Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan & Alexandria\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover the best of Egypt on a 12-Day Complete Egypt Family Tour. Explore the Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, enjoy a luxury Nile Cruise, visit Luxor and Aswan, and relax for 4 nights in Hurghada on the Red Sea.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','113','12-Day-Complete-Egypt-Family-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-06 17:46:53','2026-07-07 10:23:17',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(74,24,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'11-day-egypt-tour-package-cairo-nile-cruise-hurghada','{\"en\":\"11-Day Egypt Classic Tour Package: Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover the best of Egypt on this 11-day classic tour featuring Cairo, the Pyramids of Giza, a 3-night Nile Cruise from Aswan to Luxor, and 4 relaxing nights in Hurghada. Includes guided sightseeing, hotels, transfers, and domestic flights.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Experience the perfect combination of Egypt\'s ancient history and Red Sea relaxation on this 11-day Egypt Classic Tour. Begin in Cairo, exploring the legendary Pyramids of Giza, the Grand Egyptian Museum, and Old Cairo. Fly to Aswan to board a luxurious Nile Cruise sailing through Upper Egypt while discovering magnificent temples including Philae, Kom Ombo, Edfu, Karnak, and Luxor Temple. End your journey with four nights in Hurghada, where you can relax on beautiful beaches, enjoy crystal-clear waters, or join optional snorkeling and diving excursions before returning to Cairo for your international departure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Great Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the treasures of Old Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a 3-night luxury Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Philae Temple in Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Kom Ombo and Edfu Temples.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Karnak and Luxor Temples.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Valley of the Kings and Queen Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Relax for four nights on the Red Sea in Hurghada.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Professional Egyptologist guide throughout all sightseeing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"11-Day \\/ 10-Night \"}',NULL,2660.00,NULL,2660.00,NULL,2660.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,99,0,0,2660.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-06 20:17:04',2,'{\"en\":\"11-Day Egypt Classic Tour Package: Cairo, Nile Cruise & Hurghada\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover ancient Egypt on a 12-day historical tour covering Cairo, a Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and Alexandria. Fully guided with Egyptologist, top sights, and luxury accommodations.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','114','11-day-egypt-tour-package-cairo-nile-cruise-hurghada','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-06 20:17:04','2026-08-28 18:03:58',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(75,7,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'6-days-egypt-tour-package-cairo-nile-cruise','{\"en\":\"6 Days Egypt Tour Package: Cairo & Nile Cruise\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the best of Egypt in 6 days with Cairo, the Giza Pyramids, the Grand Egyptian Museum, and a 3-night luxury Nile Cruise from Aswan to Luxor. Private guided tours, domestic flights, and 5-star accommodation included.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>6 Days Egypt Tour Package: Cairo &amp; 3-Night Nile Cruise<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover Egypt\'s most iconic treasures on this unforgettable 6-day Egypt tour package. Begin your adventure in Cairo, where you\'ll explore the legendary Giza Pyramids, the Great Sphinx, and the spectacular Grand Egyptian Museum. Then fly to Aswan to board a luxurious 5-star Nile Cruise, sailing through the heart of ancient Egypt while visiting magnificent temples including Philae, Kom Ombo, Edfu, Karnak, and Luxor Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Complete your journey with a visit to the Valley of the Kings, Queen Hatshepsut\'s Temple, and the Colossi of Memnon before returning to Cairo for your departure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Perfect for first-time visitors, this itinerary combines Egypt\'s ancient history, breathtaking monuments, luxury accommodation, and exceptional service into one seamless travel experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Meet &amp; assist at Cairo International Airport.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Great Pyramids of Giza.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Great Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Fly from Cairo to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Stay aboard a luxury 5-star Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Edfu Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour Karnak Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the Colossi of Memnon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide throughout the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Why Choose This Tour?<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Perfect introduction to Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private guided sightseeing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxury 5-star accommodations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Domestic flights included.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Egypt\'s most famous attractions.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ideal balance of history and relaxation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Suitable for couples, families, and first-time visitors.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"6-Day 5-Nights\"}',NULL,1290.00,NULL,1290.00,NULL,1290.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,84,0,0,1290.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-11 18:50:15',10,'{\"en\":\"6 Days Egypt Tour Package | Cairo & 3-Night Nile Cruise | Luxury Tours of Egypt\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the best of Egypt in 6 days with Cairo, the Giza Pyramids, the Grand Egyptian Museum, and a 3-night luxury Nile Cruise from Aswan to Luxor. Private guided tours, domestic flights, and 5-star accommodation included.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','115','6-days-egypt-tour-package-cairo-nile-cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-11 18:50:15','2026-07-11 19:28:57',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(76,24,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'10-day-egypt-tour-package','{\"en\":\" 10 Day Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor & Aswan\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover the best 10 Day Egypt Tour Package with Egypt Tour Pro. Visit Cairo, the Giza Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, Saqqara, Luxor, Aswan, and enjoy a 5-star Nile Cruise with expert Egyptologist guides.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2><strong>&nbsp;10 Day Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor &amp; Aswan<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Experience the very best of Egypt on this unforgettable 10 Day Egypt Tour Package, carefully designed to combine the country\'s most iconic landmarks with the timeless beauty of a luxurious Nile Cruise. From the majestic Pyramids of Giza and the world-famous Grand Egyptian Museum to the magnificent temples of Luxor and Aswan, every day reveals another chapter of Egypt\'s extraordinary history.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your journey in Cairo, where you\'ll discover the Great Pyramids, the Great Sphinx, the treasures of the Grand Egyptian Museum, the ancient Step Pyramid of Saqqara, and the vibrant atmosphere of Old Cairo. Then fly to Aswan to board your elegant 5-star Nile Cruise and sail along the legendary River Nile while visiting spectacular temples including Philae, Kom Ombo, Edfu, Karnak, and Luxor Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Explore the fascinating Valley of the Kings, admire the magnificent Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, and stand before the impressive Colossi of Memnon. Enhance your adventure with optional experiences such as the breathtaking Abu Simbel Temples and an unforgettable sunrise Hot Air Balloon flight over Luxor.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you\'re visiting Egypt for the first time or returning to explore more of its incredible heritage, this tour offers the perfect balance of history, culture, comfort, and authentic local experiences. With professional Egyptologist guides, carefully selected accommodations, private transportation, and exceptional service from Egypt Tour Pro, you\'ll create memories that last a lifetime.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Discover the iconic Giza Pyramids, the Great Sphinx, and the Grand Egyptian Museum.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the ancient Step Pyramid of Saqqara, the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization (NMEC), and historic Old Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Fly to Luxor and board a luxurious 5-star Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the magnificent Karnak Temple and Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Valley of the Kings and the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the beautifully preserved Temple of Edfu and the unique double Temple of Kom Ombo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the breathtaking Abu Simbel Temples with an optional excursion to a traditional Nubian Village.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Aswan\'s highlights, including the High Dam, Philae Temple, and the Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a full-day excursion to the Mediterranean city of Alexandria.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Travel with a professional Egyptologist guide throughout your journey.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Stay in carefully selected hotels in Cairo and enjoy four nights aboard a luxurious 5-star Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',10,NULL,9,'{\"en\":\"10 Days, 9 Nights\"}',NULL,2099.00,NULL,2099.00,NULL,2099.00,NULL,NULL,2,0,85,0,0,2099.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-14 20:34:12',0,'{\"en\":\" 10 Day Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor & Aswan\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover the best 10 Day Egypt Tour Package with Egypt Tour Pro. Visit Cairo, the Giza Pyramids, Grand Egyptian Museum, Saqqara, Luxor, Aswan, and enjoy a 5-star Nile Cruise with expert Egyptologist guides.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','116','10-day-egypt-tour-package','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-14 20:34:12','2026-08-28 18:05:11',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(77,2,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'10-day-best-egypt-tour-package','{\"en\":\"10-Day Best Egypt Tour Package with Nile Cruise, Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Abu Simbel\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover the best of Egypt on a 10-day tour package featuring Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, Abu Simbel, and a 5-Star Nile Cruise. Explore ancient wonders with expert Egyptologist guides.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>10-Day Best of Egypt Tour Package&nbsp;<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h2>Tour Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the timeless beauty of Egypt on this carefully designed 10-Day Best of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\\"><strong>Egypt Tour Package<\\/strong><\\/a>, an unforgettable journey that combines the country\'s most famous ancient monuments with the comfort of a luxurious <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Nile-Cruise\\\"><strong>Nile River cruise<\\/strong><\\/a>. Perfect for first-time visitors and travelers seeking a complete Egyptian experience, this itinerary takes you from the legendary landmarks of Cairo to the magnificent temples of Luxor and Aswan, ending with a visit to the breathtaking Abu Simbel Temples.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your adventure begins in Cairo, where you\'ll explore the world-famous <strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-pyramid-of-giza\\\">Great Pyramids of Giza<\\/a><\\/strong>, the iconic Great Sphinx, and the remarkable <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/grand-egyptian-museum\\\"><strong>Grand Egyptian Museum<\\/strong><\\/a>, home to one of the world\'s greatest collections of ancient Egyptian treasures. Continue your journey through history with a visit to Saqqara, where the <strong>Step Pyramid of King Djoser<\\/strong> marks the beginning of pyramid construction, before discovering the ancient capital of Memphis.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From Cairo, you\'ll travel to Luxor, often called the world\'s greatest open-air museum. Here you\'ll walk among the towering columns of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/Karnak-Temple\\\"><strong>Karnak Temple<\\/strong><\\/a>, admire the beauty of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/luxor-temple\\\"><strong>Luxor Temple<\\/strong><\\/a>, and cross the Nile to the West Bank to explore the royal tombs of the<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/The-Valley-of-the-Kings\\\"><strong> Valley of the Kings<\\/strong><\\/a>. You\'ll also visit the magnificent Temple of Queen Hatshepsut and the impressive Colossi of Memnon, two of Upper Egypt\'s most celebrated archaeological sites.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>One of the highlights of this Egypt tour is your relaxing 5-Star Nile Cruise, allowing you to experience the legendary river that gave life to one of the world\'s oldest civilizations. As your cruise sails between Luxor and Aswan, you\'ll stop at the remarkably preserved Temple of Edfu, dedicated to the falcon god Horus, and the unique Kom Ombo Temple, famous for its twin design honoring both Sobek, the crocodile god, and Horus the Elder. Every day along the Nile offers spectacular scenery, comfortable accommodations, delicious cuisine, and unforgettable moments.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your journey continues in Aswan, a city known for its peaceful atmosphere and beautiful Nile landscapes. Here you\'ll discover the engineering achievement of the Aswan High Dam, visit the enchanting <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/philae-temple\\\"><strong>Philae Temple<\\/strong><\\/a>, dedicated to the goddess Isis, and see the enormous Unfinished Obelisk, which reveals how ancient Egyptians carved massive stone monuments directly from the granite bedrock.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>No visit to southern Egypt would be complete without experiencing the awe-inspiring <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/abu-simbel-temples\\\"><strong>Abu Simbel Temples<\\/strong><\\/a>, one of the greatest architectural masterpieces of the ancient world. Carved into a mountainside during the reign of Pharaoh Ramesses II, these magnificent temples stand as a symbol of ancient Egyptian power and engineering. Their remarkable relocation during the construction of the Aswan High Dam remains one of the greatest archaeological rescue projects in history.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Throughout your journey, you\'ll travel in comfort with private air-conditioned transportation, stay in carefully selected accommodations, and enjoy the expertise of professional licensed Egyptologist guides who bring Egypt\'s fascinating history to life. Every detail has been thoughtfully planned to provide a seamless travel experience while allowing plenty of time to appreciate the country\'s extraordinary cultural heritage.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you\'re standing before the majestic pyramids, sailing peacefully along the Nile, exploring magnificent temples, or watching the sunrise over Abu Simbel, every day offers unforgettable memories and incredible discoveries. This itinerary perfectly balances sightseeing, relaxation, and authentic cultural experiences, making it one of the most complete Egypt tour packages available.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>If you\'d like to extend your holiday, this tour also pairs perfectly with our other Egypt travel experiences, including <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\/luxury-Packages\\\"><strong>Luxury Egypt Tours<\\/strong><\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\/private-egypt-tours\\\"><strong>Private Egypt Tours<\\/strong><\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\/family-egypt-tours\\\"><strong>Egypt Family Tours<\\/strong><\\/a>, and our collection of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Nile-Cruise\\\"><strong>Nile Cruise Packages<\\/strong><\\/a>. You can also explore our detailed guides to each destination through our <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/attractions\\\"><strong>Attractions section<\\/strong><\\/a> and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/blog\\/egypt-travel-guide\\\"><strong>Egypt Travel Guide<\\/strong><\\/a> blog to learn more about the fascinating history behind every site you\'ll visit.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join Egypt Tour Pro and experience the very best of ancient history, breathtaking landscapes, and warm Egyptian hospitality on an unforgettable 10-day journey through one of the world\'s most extraordinary destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Explore the legendary Great Pyramids of Giza, one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World, and stand before the iconic Great Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover thousands of priceless treasures at the Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM), including remarkable artifacts from ancient Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit Saqqara and the famous Step Pyramid of King Djoser, the world\'s oldest large-scale stone monument.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the ruins of Memphis, the first capital of ancient Egypt and a UNESCO World Heritage Site.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Fly to Luxor and discover the magnificent Karnak Temple Complex, the largest religious complex ever built.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Experience the beauty of Luxor Temple, spectacularly illuminated in the evening and rich in pharaonic history.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the royal tombs in the Valley of the Kings, including the burial places of Egypt\'s greatest pharaohs.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit the impressive Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, one of Egypt\'s architectural masterpieces.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Stop at the Colossi of Memnon, two monumental statues that have guarded the Theban Necropolis for over 3,000 years.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Enjoy a relaxing 4-night 5-Star Nile Cruise between Luxor and Aswan, sailing along the world\'s longest river.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit the remarkably preserved Temple of Edfu, dedicated to Horus, one of ancient Egypt\'s most important gods.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Discover the unique double temple of Kom Ombo, dedicated to both Sobek, the crocodile god, and Horus the Elder.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the highlights of Aswan, including the High Dam, the beautiful Philae Temple, and the massive Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Take an unforgettable excursion to the magnificent Abu Simbel Temples, built by Pharaoh Ramesses II and considered among Egypt\'s greatest monuments.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Travel with an experienced licensed Egyptologist guide throughout your journey.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Enjoy comfortable accommodation in carefully selected 5-star hotels and a deluxe Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Experience authentic Egyptian hospitality while travelling in modern, air-conditioned vehicles.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Benefit from a carefully planned itinerary that balances sightseeing, relaxation, and cultural experiences for an unforgettable Egyptian adventure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',10,NULL,9,'{\"en\":\"10 Days, 9 Nights\"}',NULL,2550.00,NULL,2550.00,NULL,2550.00,NULL,NULL,2,0,87,0,0,2550.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-21 12:23:33',10,'{\"en\":\"10-Day Best Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Abu Simbel\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover the best of Egypt on a 10-day tour package featuring Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, Abu Simbel, and a 5-Star Nile Cruise. Explore ancient wonders with expert Egyptologist guides.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','117','10-day-best-egypt-tour-package','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-21 12:23:33','2026-07-21 15:17:51',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(78,2,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-day-egypt-tour-package-cairo-nile-cruise-luxor-aswan','{\"en\":\"8-Day Egypt Tour Package with Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan & Optional Abu Simbel\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the best of Ancient Egypt on this 8-day Egypt tour package featuring Cairo, the Pyramids of Giza, the Grand Egyptian Museum, a 5-star Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and the optional Abu Simbel Temples. Includes domestic flights, private guided tours, and handpicked accommodations.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>8-Day Egypt Tour Package with Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan &amp; Optional Abu Simbel<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h2><strong> Tour Overview<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the timeless wonders of Ancient Egypt on this carefully designed 8-Day <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\\"><strong>Egypt Tour Package<\\/strong><\\/a>, combining the country\'s most iconic landmarks with the unforgettable experience of a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Luxury-Nile-Cruise-Packages\\\"><strong>luxury Nile Cruise<\\/strong><\\/a>. From the legendary <strong>Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong> to the magnificent temples of <strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cities\\/luxor\\\">Luxor<\\/a><\\/strong> and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cities\\/aswan\\\"><strong>Aswan<\\/strong><\\/a>, this journey offers the perfect balance of history, culture, and relaxation while allowing you to experience thousands of years of civilization in just over a week.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your adventure begins in Cairo, where you\'ll stand before the awe-inspiring<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-pyramid-of-giza\\\"><strong> Great Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong><\\/a>, the last remaining Wonder of the Ancient World. Explore the mysterious <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-sphinx-of-giza\\\"><strong>Great Sphinx<\\/strong><\\/a> before discovering the incredible treasures of the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/grand-egyptian-museum\\\"><strong>Grand Egyptian Museum<\\/strong><\\/a>, home to one of the world\'s largest collections of ancient Egyptian artifacts. With an expert Egyptologist guide by your side, you\'ll gain a deeper understanding of the pharaohs, their remarkable achievements, and the legacy they left behind.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A short domestic flight takes you to Aswan, the gateway to southern Egypt and the starting point of your luxurious 5-star Nile Cruise. Before boarding, you\'ll visit the elegant Philae Temple, dedicated to the goddess Isis, the impressive Aswan High Dam, and the fascinating Unfinished Obelisk, where you\'ll learn how the ancient Egyptians carved enormous granite monuments.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As your Nile Cruise begins, you\'ll experience one of the world\'s most scenic river journeys. Relax on the sun deck as the cruise sails through beautiful landscapes lined with palm trees, traditional villages, and fertile farmland that has sustained Egyptian civilization for thousands of years.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For travelers wishing to experience one of Egypt\'s greatest monuments, an optional early morning excursion to the spectacular <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/abu-simbel-temples\\\"><strong>Abu Simbel Temples<\\/strong><\\/a> is highly recommended. Built by Pharaoh Ramesses II and relocated stone by stone during the construction of the Aswan High Dam, these colossal rock-cut temples are among the most remarkable archaeological achievements in the world.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Continue your cruise with visits to the unique Temple of Kom Ombo, dedicated to Sobek and Horus, and the exceptionally preserved Temple of Edfu, one of the finest surviving temples from ancient Egypt. Each stop along the Nile reveals another chapter of Egypt\'s fascinating history, making the journey itself just as memorable as the destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Upon reaching Luxor, often described as the world\'s greatest open-air museum, you\'ll explore the magnificent <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/Karnak-Temple\\\"><strong>Karnak Temple<\\/strong><\\/a> and <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/luxor-temple\\\"><strong>Luxor Temple <\\/strong><\\/a>before crossing to the West Bank to visit the legendary Valley of the Kings, where generations of pharaohs were laid to rest. You\'ll also discover the impressive <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/Hatshepsut-Temple\\\"><strong>Temple of Queen Hatshepsut <\\/strong><\\/a>and the towering Colossi of Memnon before flying back to Cairo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your final full day introduces you to another side of Egypt\'s heritage. Visit <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/saqqara-step-pyramid\\\"><strong>Saqqara<\\/strong><\\/a>, home to the Step Pyramid of Djoser&mdash;the world\'s oldest large-scale stone building&mdash;before exploring the outstanding National Museum of Egyptian Civilization, where thousands of years of history are brought together under one roof. Continue to the Citadel of Saladin and admire the magnificent Mosque of Muhammad Ali while enjoying panoramic views over Cairo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Throughout the tour, you\'ll travel in comfort with private air-conditioned transportation, domestic flights, carefully selected 5-star accommodations, and the expertise of professional Egyptologist guides. Whether you\'re visiting Egypt for the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/blog\\/Egypt-Travel-Tips-for-First-Time-Visitors\\\"><strong>first time<\\/strong><\\/a> or fulfilling a lifelong dream, this 8-Day Egypt Tour Package offers an unforgettable introduction to one of the world\'s greatest civilizations, combining famous landmarks, authentic cultural experiences, and the timeless beauty of the Nile into a seamless and rewarding <strong>journey<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Experience the very best of Egypt on this carefully crafted 8-day journey, combining the country\'s most iconic archaeological treasures with the unforgettable experience of a luxury Nile Cruise.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Discover the legendary Great Pyramids of Giza, the last remaining Wonder of the Ancient World.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Stand before the mysterious Great Sphinx, one of Egypt\'s most recognizable landmarks.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the remarkable Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM), home to thousands of priceless ancient artifacts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Fly from Cairo to Aswan and enjoy seamless travel between Egypt\'s most famous destinations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit the impressive Aswan High Dam, one of the country\'s greatest engineering achievements.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Take a scenic motorboat ride to the beautiful Philae Temple, dedicated to the goddess Isis.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Discover the fascinating Unfinished Obelisk and learn how ancient Egyptians carved giant granite monuments.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Spend four unforgettable nights aboard a luxurious 5-Star Nile Cruise sailing between Aswan and Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Join an optional excursion to the spectacular Abu Simbel Temples, one of UNESCO\'s greatest archaeological masterpieces.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the unique Kom Ombo Temple, dedicated to the crocodile god Sobek and Horus the Elder.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit the exceptionally well-preserved Temple of Horus at Edfu, one of Egypt\'s finest ancient temples.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Walk through the magnificent Karnak Temple Complex, the largest religious complex ever built.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Admire the elegant beauty of Luxor Temple, connected to Karnak by the ancient Avenue of Sphinxes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the legendary Valley of the Kings, where Egypt\'s greatest pharaohs were buried.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit the spectacular Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, one of the finest architectural masterpieces of Ancient Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Stop at the impressive Colossi of Memnon, standing proudly for more than 3,400 years.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Discover Saqqara, home to the world\'s oldest stone pyramid built for King Djoser.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Explore the outstanding National Museum of Egyptian Civilization (NMEC) and its famous Royal Mummies Hall.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Visit the historic Citadel of Saladin and the magnificent Mosque of Muhammad Ali overlooking Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Enjoy delicious lunches at carefully selected local restaurants during sightseeing tours.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Travel with an experienced licensed Egyptologist guide throughout your journey.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Experience private air-conditioned transportation and personalized service from arrival to departure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 days \\/ 7 nights\"}',NULL,1999.00,NULL,1999.00,NULL,1999.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,1999.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-21 15:14:56',1,'{\"en\":\"8-Day Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Aswan, Luxor & Nile Cruise\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the best of Ancient Egypt on this 8-day Egypt tour package featuring Cairo, the Pyramids of Giza, the Grand Egyptian Museum, a 5-star Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and the optional Abu Simbel Temples. Includes domestic flights, private guided tours, and handpicked accommodations.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','118','8-day-egypt-tour-package-cairo-nile-cruise-luxor-aswan','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-21 15:14:56','2026-07-21 16:09:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(79,18,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'5-day-nile-cruise-luxor-to-aswan-with-abu-simbel','{\"en\":\"5-Day Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan with Abu Simbel – Private Egypt Tour\"}',NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<h2>5-Day Luxury Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan with Abu Simbel<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Tour Overview<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Experience the timeless beauty of the Nile on this unforgettable 5-Day Nile Cruise from <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/cities\\/Tourism-in-Luxor\\\">Luxor<\\/a> to <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/cities\\/Tourism-in-aswan\\\">Aswan <\\/a>with Abu Simbel included. Designed for travelers seeking comfort, culture, and exceptional service, this journey combines Egypt\'s most celebrated archaeological treasures with the elegance of a five-star <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\/Egypt-Luxury-Nile-Cruise\\\">luxury cruise<\\/a>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your adventure in Luxor, often called the world\'s greatest open-air museum, where you\'ll explore the magnificent Karnak Temple, the beautiful Luxor Temple, the Valley of the Kings, the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, and the Colossi of Memnon. Sail peacefully along the Nile while enjoying spacious cabins, fine dining, panoramic sun decks, and personalized hospitality.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Continue to the remarkably preserved Temple of Horus at Edfu before discovering the unique double temple of Kom Ombo, dedicated to Sobek and Horus the Elder. Arrive in Aswan to visit the stunning Philae Temple, the High Dam, and the Unfinished Obelisk before completing your journey with a visit to the spectacular Abu Simbel Temples, one of Egypt\'s greatest masterpieces and a UNESCO World Heritage Site.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Throughout the cruise, admire picturesque Nile scenery, lush palm groves, charming riverside villages, and breathtaking sunsets while enjoying world-class accommodation and gourmet cuisine. Whether you\'re celebrating a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\/Egypt-Honeymoon-Packages\\\">honeymoon<\\/a>, planning a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\/Family-Egypt-Tours\\\">family vacation<\\/a>, or simply seeking an unforgettable <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\/egypt-luxury-tours\\\">luxury holiday<\\/a>, this itinerary offers the perfect balance of history, relaxation, and authentic Egyptian hospitality.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>5-day luxury Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Abu Simbel Temples included.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Karnak Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Queen Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the Colossi of Memnon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Edfu Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Aswan High Dam.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Daily breakfast, lunch, and dinner.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Expert Egyptologist guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Scenic Nile sailing experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ideal for couples, families, and private travelers<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','days',5,NULL,4,'{\"en\":\"5 Days, 4 Nights\"}',NULL,970.00,NULL,970.00,NULL,970.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,970.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-25 14:31:39',10,'{\"en\":\"5-Day Nile Cruise from Luxor to Aswan with Abu Simbel | Luxury Tours Of Egypt\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','119','5-day-nile-cruise-luxor-to-aswan-with-abu-simbel','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-25 14:31:39','2026-07-25 15:05:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(80,15,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-day-private-luxury-egypt-tour','{\"en\":\"8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour Package with Cairo, Luxor, Aswan & Luxury Nile Cruise\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience Egypt in style on this 8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour. Stay in luxury 5-star hotels, cruise the Nile aboard a premium luxury ship, explore Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, and the iconic temples of Ancient Egypt with your own private Egyptologist guide.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<h2>Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover Egypt in unparalleled comfort on this 8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour, an exclusive journey designed for travelers seeking the finest accommodations, exceptional service, and unforgettable experiences. Combining Egypt\'s most iconic ancient wonders with a premium<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Luxury-Nile-Cruise-Packages\\\"><strong> luxury Nile Cruise<\\/strong><\\/a>, this itinerary offers the perfect balance of history, elegance, and personalized travel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your luxury adventure begins in Cairo, where you\'ll be welcomed by your personal representative and transferred to one of the city\'s finest five-star luxury hotels. From the moment you arrive, every detail is carefully arranged to ensure a seamless and stress-free experience. Whether you\'re celebrating a honeymoon, anniversary,<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\/family-egypt-tours\\\"><strong> family holiday<\\/strong><\\/a>, or simply looking for a first-class vacation, this tour allows you to discover Egypt at your own pace with the guidance of a professional private Egyptologist.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Explore the legendary <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-pyramid-of-giza\\\"><strong>Great Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong><\\/a>, the last surviving Wonder of the Ancient World, and stand before the mysterious <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-sphinx-of-giza\\\"><strong>Great Sphinx<\\/strong><\\/a>, one of history\'s most iconic monuments. Continue to the spectacular<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/grand-egyptian-museum\\\"><strong> Grand Egyptian Museum<\\/strong><\\/a> (GEM), where priceless treasures, monumental statues, and fascinating artifacts reveal the remarkable story of one of the world\'s oldest civilizations. Enjoy a leisurely lunch at a carefully selected restaurant before returning to your luxury hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A domestic flight takes you to Luxor, often called the world\'s greatest open-air museum, where your exclusive luxury Nile Cruise awaits. Settle into your elegant suite and enjoy outstanding hospitality as you begin sailing along the timeless Nile River. Unlike ordinary cruises, a luxury Nile Cruise offers spacious accommodations, fine dining, personalized service, panoramic sun decks, and a peaceful atmosphere that transforms every moment into part of the experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Discover the magnificent <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/Karnak-Temple\\\"><strong>Karnak Temple<\\/strong><\\/a>, the largest religious complex ever built, and admire the elegant beauty of <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/luxor-temple\\\"><strong>Luxor Temple<\\/strong><\\/a>, beautifully illuminated by centuries of history. Cross to Luxor\'s West Bank to explore the legendary Valley of the Kings, where Egypt\'s greatest pharaohs were buried, before visiting the extraordinary Temple of Queen Hatshepsut and the towering Colossi of Memnon.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As your cruise continues south, visit the beautifully preserved <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/edfu-temple\\\"><strong>Temple of Horus<\\/strong><\\/a> at Edfu and the remarkable Kom Ombo Temple, uniquely dedicated to two ancient gods. Relax on deck as the cruise glides through picturesque villages, lush farmland, and tranquil Nile landscapes that have remained largely unchanged for thousands of years.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Upon reaching Aswan, discover the elegant <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/philae-temple\\\"><strong>Philae Temple<\\/strong><\\/a>, dedicated to the goddess Isis, visit the impressive Aswan High Dam, and explore the fascinating Unfinished Obelisk. Travelers wishing to enhance their experience can join an optional private excursion to the breathtaking Abu Simbel Temples, one of UNESCO\'s most celebrated archaeological sites and one of Egypt\'s greatest architectural achievements.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Throughout your journey, you\'ll enjoy private sightseeing, luxury accommodations, domestic flights, and carefully planned transportation, allowing you to focus entirely on the beauty and history surrounding you. Every excursion is conducted at a relaxed pace, giving you time to appreciate each destination without feeling rushed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Throughout your journey, you\'ll enjoy private sightseeing, luxury accommodations, domestic flights, and carefully planned transportation, allowing you to focus entirely on the beauty and history surrounding you. Every excursion is conducted at a relaxed pace, giving you time to appreciate each destination without feeling rushed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This 8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour is ideal for discerning travelers who expect exceptional quality, personalized attention, and authentic cultural experiences. Combining Egypt\'s most famous landmarks with luxurious accommodations and world-class service, it promises an unforgettable journey through one of the world\'s most fascinating destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Experience Egypt\'s timeless wonders with exceptional comfort, personalized service, and carefully selected luxury accommodations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>- Enjoy a 100% private guided tour with your own professional Egyptologist throughout your journey.<br \\/>- Stay in handpicked 5-star luxury hotels in Cairo, offering outstanding comfort and world-class hospitality.<br \\/>- Sail aboard a luxury Nile Cruise, featuring elegant cabins, gourmet dining, premium facilities, and personalized service.<br \\/>- Explore the legendary Great Pyramids of Giza, the last remaining Wonder of the Ancient World.<br \\/>- Stand before the iconic Great Sphinx, one of Egypt\'s most recognizable monuments.<br \\/>- Discover the extraordinary treasures of the Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM), home to thousands of priceless ancient artifacts.<br \\/>- Fly between Cairo and Luxor, and from Aswan back to Cairo, maximizing your sightseeing time.<br \\/>- Visit the magnificent Karnak Temple Complex, the largest religious complex ever built.<br \\/>- Explore the elegant Luxor Temple, beautifully connected to Karnak by the ancient Avenue of Sphinxes.<br \\/>- Discover the royal tombs of the Valley of the Kings, including beautifully decorated burial chambers of the New Kingdom pharaohs.<br \\/>- Visit the spectacular Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, one of Egypt\'s greatest architectural masterpieces.<br \\/>- Stop at the impressive Colossi of Memnon, standing proudly for over 3,400 years.<br \\/>- Explore the remarkably preserved Temple of Horus at Edfu, one of the finest ancient temples in Egypt.<br \\/>- Visit the fascinating Kom Ombo Temple, uniquely dedicated to Sobek and Horus the Elder.<br \\/>- Cruise through the breathtaking landscapes of the Nile Valley while relaxing aboard your luxury ship.<br \\/>- Discover the enchanting Philae Temple, beautifully located on Agilkia Island.<br \\/>- Visit the impressive Aswan High Dam and the fascinating Unfinished Obelisk.<br \\/>- Enhance your journey with an optional private excursion to the UNESCO-listed Abu Simbel Temples.<br \\/>- Enjoy private airport transfers and luxury transportation throughout your journey.<br \\/>- Savor delicious cuisine at carefully selected restaurants and aboard your luxury Nile Cruise.<br \\/>- Benefit from flexible sightseeing, personalized attention, and 24\\/7 support from the Egypt Tour Pro team.<br \\/>- Experience one of Egypt\'s finest luxury vacations, combining ancient history with modern elegance and exceptional service.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',8,NULL,7,'{\"en\":\"8 days \\/ 7 nights\"}',NULL,2850.00,NULL,2850.00,NULL,2850.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,85,0,0,2850.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<h2>Why Choose This Luxury Tour?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide throughout the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxury 5-star hotels and premium Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flexible sightseeing schedule.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>VIP airport meet and assist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned deluxe vehicle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Personalized service from arrival to departure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Carefully selected fine dining experiences.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ideal for couples, honeymooners, families, and luxury travelers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-26 15:07:38',1,'{\"en\":\"8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour | 5-Star Hotels & Luxury Nile Cruise\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience Egypt in style on this 8-Day Private Luxury Egypt Tour. Stay in luxury 5-star hotels, cruise the Nile aboard a premium luxury ship, explore Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, and the iconic temples of Ancient Egypt with your own private Egyptologist guide.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','120','8-day-private-luxury-egypt-tour','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-26 15:07:38','2026-07-26 16:05:12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(81,2,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'15-day-ultimate-egypt-vacation','{\"en\":\"15-Day Ultimate Egypt Vacation\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the ultimate 15-day Egypt vacation with Cairo, Giza Pyramids, Aswan, Luxor, a luxury Nile Cruise, and Hurghada Red Sea beaches. Private guided tour with expert Egyptologists.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>15-Day Ultimate Egypt Vacation<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the very best of Egypt on this unforgettable 15-Day Ultimate <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tour-packages\\/egypt-vacation-packages\\\">Egypt Vacation<\\/a>. Designed for travelers who want to experience the country\'s most iconic landmarks and hidden treasures, this journey combines ancient history, vibrant culture, luxurious accommodations, and breathtaking Red Sea beaches.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your adventure in Cairo, where you\'ll explore <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-pyramid-of-giza\\\">the Great Pyramids<\\/a> of Giza, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/great-sphinx-of-giza\\\">the Sphinx<\\/a>, the Grand Egyptian Museum, Saqqara, and Old Cairo. Fly to Aswan to visit the beautiful Philae Temple before boarding a <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Nile-Cruise\\\">luxury Nile Cruise<\\/a>. Sail along the Nile while discovering Kom Ombo, Edfu, Luxor Temple, Karnak Temple, the Valley of the Kings, and the Temple of Hatshepsut.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After your Nile cruise, continue to Hurghada for several days of relaxation on the Red Sea, where you can enjoy pristine beaches, snorkeling, diving, desert safaris, or simply unwind at your resort. Finish your journey back in Cairo with free time for shopping before your departure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This private Egypt vacation includes expert Egyptologist guides, comfortable transportation, carefully selected hotels, a luxury Nile cruise, and personalized service to ensure an unforgettable travel experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"15-Day \\/ 14-Night \"}',NULL,3890.00,NULL,3890.00,NULL,3890.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,85,0,0,3890.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-07-31 07:58:59',10,'{\"en\":\"15-Day Ultimate Egypt Vacation Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise & Red Sea\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the ultimate 15-day Egypt vacation with Cairo, Giza Pyramids, Aswan, Luxor, a luxury Nile Cruise, and Hurghada Red Sea beaches. Private guided tour with expert Egyptologists.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','121','15-day-ultimate-egypt-vacation','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-07-31 07:58:59','2026-07-31 12:05:50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(82,12,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'15-day-ultimate-nile-cruise-red-sea-holiday','{\"en\":\"15-Day Ultimate Nile Cruise & Red Sea Holiday\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover ancient Egypt on a 12-day historical tour covering Cairo, a Nile Cruise, Luxor, Aswan, and Alexandria. Fully guided with Egyptologist, top sights, and luxury accommodations.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>Tour Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Experience the ultimate combination of Egypt\'s ancient wonders and the stunning Red Sea on this carefully designed 15-Day Egypt Tour Package. This itinerary is ideal for travelers who want to immerse themselves in thousands of years of history while enjoying a relaxing beach holiday at one of Hurghada\'s all-inclusive resorts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your journey begins with time to unwind on the beautiful shores of the Red Sea before boarding a luxurious 7-night Nile Cruise, one of the most complete cruising experiences available in Egypt. Unlike standard 3- or 4-night cruises, this extended itinerary allows you to explore Egypt at a comfortable pace while visiting both world-famous landmarks and lesser-known archaeological treasures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Travel with your expert Egyptologist guide through the heart of Ancient Egypt as you discover the magnificent Karnak Temple, the elegant Luxor Temple, the legendary Valley of the Kings, Queen Hatshepsut\'s Temple, the Colossi of Memnon, the remarkably preserved Temple of Horus at Edfu, the unique twin Temple of Kom Ombo, the beautiful Philae Temple in Aswan, the impressive High Dam, the fascinating Luxor Museum, the colorful Luxor local market, the magnificent Medinet Habu Temple, and the spectacular Temple of Hathor at Dendera. You may also choose to join an optional excursion to the breathtaking Abu Simbel Temples, considered among Egypt\'s greatest monuments.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After your unforgettable Nile Cruise, return to Hurghada for several days of relaxation at an all-inclusive beach resort. Spend your days enjoying golden sandy beaches, crystal-clear waters, swimming pools, and optional Red Sea adventures including Orange Bay, Paradise Island, snorkeling, scuba diving, and thrilling desert safari excursions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This package perfectly combines culture, relaxation, luxury, and adventure, making it one of the best Egypt vacation packages for couples, families, honeymooners, and first-time visitors.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Perfect For<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>First-time visitors to Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Couples and honeymooners.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Families.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxury travelers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>History enthusiasts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Beach lovers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Long-stay holidays.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Winter sun vacations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"15-Day \\/ 14-Night \"}',NULL,3890.00,NULL,3890.00,NULL,3890.00,NULL,NULL,2,0,90,0,0,3890.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,1,'2026-08-08 09:02:44',10,'{\"en\":\"15-Day Egypt Tour Package | 7-Night Nile Cruise & 7 Nights Hurghada All-Inclusive\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover Egypt on an unforgettable 15-day vacation featuring a 7-night Nile Cruise between Luxor and Aswan and 7 nights at an all-inclusive Hurghada resort. Explore the Pyramids\' ancient counterparts in Upper Egypt, including Karnak Temple, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Edfu, Kom Ombo, Philae Temple, Dendera, Medinet Habu, and enjoy optional Abu Simbel, snorkeling, diving, Orange Bay, Paradise Island, and desert safari adventures.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','122','15-day-ultimate-nile-cruise-red-sea-holiday','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-08-08 09:02:44','2026-08-08 12:30:03',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(83,7,NULL,NULL,1,'travel_package',NULL,NULL,'8-day-private-egypt-tour-packag','{\"en\":\"8-Day Private Egypt Tour Package – Cairo, Nile Cruise, Luxor & Aswan\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience an unforgettable 8-day private Egypt tour covering Cairo, Giza, the Grand Egyptian Museum, Aswan, Abu Simbel, Luxor and a luxury Nile Cruise with private guided sightseeing.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>8-Day Private Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise &amp; Luxor<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the wonders of ancient Egypt on an unforgettable 8-day private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\\">Egypt tour package<\\/a> combining Cairo\'s legendary monuments with a luxurious <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\/Egypt-Nile-Cruise\\\">Nile Cruise<\\/a> between Aswan and Luxor. Designed for travelers who want comfort, flexibility and personalized sightseeing, this private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/luxurytoursofegypt.com\\/tour-packages\\/Egypt-Vacation-Packages\\\">Egypt vacation<\\/a> takes you to the country\'s most important historical treasures with your own professional Egyptologist guide.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Begin your journey in Cairo, where you will explore the magnificent Giza Pyramids and the Great Sphinx, followed by a visit to the Grand Egyptian Museum, home to an extraordinary collection of ancient Egyptian artifacts. Continue south to Aswan, the peaceful gateway to the Nile, where you will visit the beautiful Philae Temple and the High Dam before boarding your Nile Cruise.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>During your cruise, discover the spectacular temples of Abu Simbel, Kom Ombo and Edfu, while enjoying the scenery of the Nile Valley. Your journey continues to Luxor, the world\'s greatest open-air museum, where you will explore the Valley of the Kings, Temple of Hatshepsut, Colossi of Memnon, Karnak Temple and Luxor Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The tour concludes in Cairo with visits to historic Cairo, the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization and Khan El Khalili Bazaar. With private transfers, expert guides, carefully selected accommodation and a well-organized itinerary, this tour offers an exceptional way to experience Egypt in comfort and style.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private 8-day Egypt vacation with a flexible itinerary.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Great Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Grand Egyptian Museum in Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Fly from Cairo to Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Philae Temple and the Aswan High Dam.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a luxury Nile Cruise from Aswan to Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the magnificent temples of Abu Simbel.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Kom Ombo Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Temple of Edfu.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the East Bank of Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Hatshepsut Temple and the Colossi of Memnon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Karnak Temple and Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Walk through the historic Khan El Khalili Bazaar.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide throughout sightseeing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned transportation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable 5-star hotels and luxury Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Personalized service and flexible private touring.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>8-Day Private Egypt Tour Package<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Duration: 8 Days \\/ 7 Nights.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour Type: Private Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Destinations: Cairo &ndash; Giza &ndash; Aswan &ndash; Abu Simbel &ndash; Kom Ombo &ndash; Edfu &ndash; Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Accommodation: 5-Star Hotels &amp; Luxury Nile Cruise.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guide: Private English-Speaking Egyptologist Guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Transportation: Private air-conditioned vehicles &amp; domestic flight.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Meals: Breakfast and lunch duringcairo tours, plus meals onboard the Nile Cruise according to the cruise program.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>Why Choose This Private Egypt Tour?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>This itinerary is designed for travelers who want to experience Egypt without the limitations of a large group tour.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With a private guide and private transportation, you can enjoy a more personalized experience, ask questions throughout your sightseeing and spend more time at the places that interest you most.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The itinerary also combines Egypt\'s most important destinations in one well-organized journey: Cairo, Giza, Aswan and Luxor, together with a Nile Cruise connecting the major temples of Upper Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Luxury Tours of Egypt provides assistance from your arrival at Cairo Airport until your departure, helping make your vacation comfortable, organized and stress-free.<\\/p>\"}','days',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8-Day \\/ 7-Night \"}',NULL,1890.00,NULL,1890.00,NULL,1890.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,88,0,0,1890.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-08-28 16:30:07',10,'{\"en\":\"8-Day Private Egypt Tour Package | Cairo, Nile Cruise & Luxor\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience an unforgettable 8-day private Egypt tour covering Cairo, Giza, the Grand Egyptian Museum, Aswan, Abu Simbel, Luxor and a luxury Nile Cruise with private guided sightseeing.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_travel_package','123','8-day-private-egypt-tour-packag','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2026-08-28 16:30:07','2026-08-28 16:56:15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(84,37,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'aswan-private-tour-high-dam-philae-temple','{\"en\":\"Aswan Private Tour: High Dam, Philae Temple\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore Aswan\'s wonders on an unforgettable private tour. Visit the High Dam, Philae Temple & Unfinished Obelisk. Book the best Aswan private tours with us!\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Overview<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Discover the ancient heritage and modern achievements of southern Egypt on a private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tours\\/Aswan-Tours\\\">Aswan<\\/a> Highlights Day Tour. This carefully designed excursion introduces you to three of the city\'s most important landmarks: the beautiful Philae Temple, the fascinating <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/unfinished-obelisk\\\">Unfinished Obelisk<\\/a> and the impressive <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/aswan-high-dam\\\">Aswan High Dam<\\/a>. Accompanied by a professional private Egyptologist, you will explore the history of Aswan from ancient times to the modern era while traveling comfortably in a private air-conditioned vehicle. Begin with <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/philae-temple\\\">Philae Temple<\\/a>, a remarkable sanctuary dedicated primarily to the goddess Isis and beautifully reconstructed on Agilkia Island after the original site was threatened by the rising waters of Lake Nasser. Continue to the Unfinished Obelisk in Aswan\'s ancient granite quarries, where you can see how ancient craftsmen worked enormous blocks of stone. Finally, visit the Aswan High Dam, one of Egypt\'s most significant modern engineering projects. This private tour offers an excellent introduction to Aswan for first-time visitors, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Nile-Cruise\\\">Nile cruise<\\/a> passengers and travelers with limited time.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the beautiful Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a boat ride to Agilkia Island.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn about the worship of the goddess Isis.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the ancient granite quarries of Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the enormous Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn about ancient Egyptian stone-working techniques.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the impressive Aswan High Dam.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the importance of the Nile River to ancient and modern Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Professional private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned transportation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hotel and Nile cruise pickup and drop-off.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flexible private sightseeing experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Bottled water during the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>Book Your Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Experience the essential highlights of Aswan with a private Egyptologist and comfortable transportation. Explore the sacred Philae Temple, discover the ancient techniques behind the Unfinished Obelisk and learn how the modern Aswan High Dam transformed the Nile Valley.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you are staying in Aswan, arriving on a Nile cruise or simply have limited time in the city, this private sightseeing experience provides an ideal introduction to the history, culture and landscapes of southern Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Contact Egypt Tour Pro today to check availability and arrange your private Aswan Highlights Day Tour.<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,6,NULL,'{\"en\":\"6 Hours\"}',NULL,45.00,NULL,45.00,NULL,45.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,45.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<p>Notes<\\/p>\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-16 16:47:08',10,'{\"en\":\"Aswan Private Tour: High Dam, Philae Temple\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Aswan\'s wonders on an unforgettable private tour. Visit the High Dam, Philae Temple & Unfinished Obelisk. Book the best Aswan private tours with us!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','21','aswan-private-tour-high-dam-philae-temple','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-16 16:47:08','2026-08-29 11:32:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(85,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-hurghada-paradise-island-snorkeling-cruise','{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Paradise Island Snorkeling Cruise\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a Paradise Island Snorkeling Cruise from Hurghada. Enjoy a full-day trip with stunning sea views, a sandy beach, and underwater exploration.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Embark on a breathtaking snorkeling adventure to Paradise Island, where you can experience the beauty of the Red Sea\'s underwater world, enjoy a delicious lunch, and relax on a stunning island. Choose between the morning or sunset tour to suit your schedule and preferences.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Delicious lunch on Paradise Beach Island<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Snorkeling and beach relaxation<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Eat a delicious meal on a boat<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Language<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Operated in: English, German, French, Spanish, Russian<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8\"}',NULL,40.00,NULL,40.00,NULL,40.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,40.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-17 09:00:49',10,'{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Paradise Island Snorkeling Cruise\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a Paradise Island Snorkeling Cruise from Hurghada. Enjoy a full-day trip with stunning sea views, a sandy beach, and underwater exploration.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','22','From-Hurghada:-Paradise-Island-Snorkeling-Cruise','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-17 09:00:49','2026-04-01 14:52:27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(86,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-hurghada-luxor-day-trip-with-bus','{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Luxor Day Trip With Bus\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on, from Hurghada Luxor Day Trip With Bus to explore ancient Egypt\'s wonders. Visit the Valley of the Kings, Karnak Temple, and more with an expert guide.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Unlock the secrets of Egyptian history and explore the ancient mystery of Luxor &ndash; the city of Pharaohs. Explore the gateway to the Valley Of The Kings and the Mortuary Temple of Hatshepsut with an Egyptologist guide and enjoy an authentic lunch.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Be collected from your accommodation in Hurghada and travel to Luxor in an air-conditioned vehicle for a full-day excursion. Relive the ancient days as you make your way through Pharaoh-era temples and visit the Valley of The Kings for its renowned tombs.<br \\/>An opportunity not to be missed, get a first-hand view of wonders that have been around for thousands of years. Continue your tour and visit the Mortuary Temple of Hatshepsut, also known as the Foremost of Noble Ladies, and marvel at its ancient monuments.<br \\/>Next, go to the Colossi of Memnon and visit the two astonishing stone statues of Pharaoh Amenhotep III. Take a break to refresh yourself with a delicious lunch at a local restaurant. Next, visit the East Banks of the Nile, aboard a ferry boat crossing for 5 minutes from West to East Bank of Luxor.<br \\/>The pristine temple complex of the Temple of Karnak is your first destination in the East Valley. At the end of your tour, you will be transferred back to your accommodation in Hurghada.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>What to Expect:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Long Travel Day:<\\/strong> The journey between Hurghada and Luxor is considerable, so be prepared for a long day of travel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Early Start:<\\/strong> Tours typically begin very early to maximize daylight hours in Luxor.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Historical Immersion:<\\/strong> You\'ll be immersed in the rich history and culture of ancient Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Photo Opportunities:<\\/strong> Numerous opportunities to capture stunning photographs of the ancient monuments.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Important Considerations:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Comfort:<\\/strong> Wear comfortable shoes and clothing, and bring sunscreen, a hat, and plenty of water.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Operator Reputation:<\\/strong> Choose a reputable tour operator to ensure a safe and reliable experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Transportation:<\\/strong> Confirm the mode of transportation, and the condition of the vehicle being used.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,90.00,NULL,90.00,NULL,90.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,80,0,0,90.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-18 09:29:32',10,'{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Luxor Day Trip With Bus\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a Hurghada Luxor Day Trip With Bus to explore ancient Egypt\'s wonders. Visit the Valley of the Kings, Karnak Temple, and more with an expert guide.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','23','from-hurghada-luxor-day-trip-with-bus','2026-09-13 09:54:41','2025-09-18 09:29:32','2026-04-01 14:54:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(87,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-hurghada-giza-pyramids-trip-with-group','{\"en\":\"From Hurghada Giza Pyramids Trip With Small Group\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on our Hurghada Giza Pyramids Trip With Group. A full-day bus tour to see the Great Pyramid, Sphinx & Egyptian Museum. Book your adventure from Hurghada!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Discover the wonders of Cairo on this full-day tour from Hurghada. Marvel at the imposing Great Pyramid and the charming Great Sphinx. Browse through the fascinating artifacts at the Egyptian Museum and learn about them from your professional guide. Get picked up from your hotel in Hurghada at around 2 AM and transfer in an air-conditioned van to the bus . Board your well-facilitated, air-conditioned Shared Bus and begin your journey to Cairo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Relax and take a nap on the way in your recliner seat. Refreshments like tea, coffee, juice, sandwiches, and mineral water will also be provided during the journey. Upon arrival in Cairo, meet your Egyptologist tour guide and go first to the world-famous Giza Plateau.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Admire the beauty of the Great Pyramid of Giza, one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World, along with the other two pyramids. Explore the mysterious Great Sphinx, the old pharaoh&rsquo;s father of terror, and the Valley Temple before lunch at one of the best restaurants.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After a delicious lunch, visit the renowned Museum of Egyptian Antiquities, commonly referred to as the Egyptian Museum. Constructed in a neo-classical style, this beautiful museum houses about 120,000 artifacts and works of Egyptian art. Finally, enjoy a journey back to Hurghada by Bus, followed by a direct transfer to your accommodation.<\\/p>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,60.00,NULL,60.00,NULL,60.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,60.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-18 15:17:13',10,'{\"en\":\"From Hurghada Giza Pyramids Trip With Group\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on our Hurghada Giza Pyramids Trip With Group. A full-day bus tour to see the Great Pyramid, Sphinx & Egyptian Museum. Book your adventure from Hurghada!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','26','from-hurghada-giza-pyramids-trip-with-group','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-18 15:17:13','2026-04-01 14:54:34',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(88,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'luxor-hot-air-balloon-ride','{\"en\":\"Luxor Hot Air Balloon Ride \"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Luxor Hot Air Balloon Ride: Sunrise views over the Valley of the Kings. Experience an unforgettable sunrise flight above ancient Thebes, the Nile River, and Luxor\'s iconic temples. \"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Luxor Hot Air Balloon Ride; After early morning pickup from your central Luxor hotel or cruise ship, travel by air-conditioned vehicle to the launch site on the west bank of the Nile River. On arrival, enjoy a light pre-flight refreshments, and meet your expert pilot and ground crew. Next, listen to a comprehensive safety briefing and step inside the balloon&rsquo;s sturdy basket with your pilot and several other passengers. Then, feel your adrenaline surge as the brightly colored balloon rises into the sky for your approximate 40-50 minutes flight.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>As you ascend, behold the thrilling bird&rsquo;s-eye views as the sunlight illuminates the temples and monuments below. Gaze down over Karnak, Queen Hatshepsut&rsquo;s Temple, and other monuments while you absorb the peaceful dawn. Then, if the wind conditions are right, float over the Ramesseum, the impressive funerary temple of Pharaoh Ramses II, and gaze down at its pylons, statues, and courtyards.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>While you float through the sky, a ground support van and crew will follow your balloon and will be there when you land. After a safe touchdown, step back onto land and receive your personal flight certificate. Finally, drive back to Luxor where your experience ends with a drop-off at your hotel or ship in time for breakfast and your morning tour departures.<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,2,NULL,'{\"en\":\"2 Hours\"}',NULL,80.00,NULL,80.00,NULL,80.00,NULL,NULL,7,0,70,0,0,80.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-18 21:40:05',10,'{\"en\":\"Hot Air Balloon Ride Over Luxor\"}','{\"en\":\"Luxor Hot Air Balloon Ride: Sunrise views over the Valley of the Kings. Experience an unforgettable sunrise flight above ancient Thebes, the Nile River, and Luxor\'s iconic temples. \"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','27','Luxor-Hot-Air-Balloon-Ride','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-18 21:40:05','2026-04-01 14:54:00',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(89,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-hurghada-dolphin-watching-tour-with-snorkeling','{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Dolphin Watching Tour with Snorkeling\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on the ultimate Hurghada Dolphin Watching Tour with Snorkeling. Swim with dolphins, explore vibrant coral reefs, and enjoy a memorable day on the Red Sea.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Embark on a relaxing cruise from Hurghada with plenty of opportunities to swim and snorkel in the sea. Look out for dolphins and admire the reefs below. Enjoy lunch on deck and soak up the sunshine. Get picked up from your hotel or accommodation in an air-conditioned vehicle and drive to the boat pier. Be greeted by the captain and the crew and begin your unforgettable sea voyage. Snorkel in the Red Sea, and maybe even get a chance to swim with dolphins. Your captain will take the boat to locations well-known for dolphin spotting, maintaining a respectful distance. The well-equipped boat will travel to several spots to ensure time for dolphin watching and scenic snorkeling. Marvel at the beauty of the coral and brightly colored fish. Savor a delicious lunch served up by the crew during the cruise and remember to sit back and have fun on the boat ride. Return to the boat pier in the afternoon and enjoy the convenience of a transfer back to your hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Swim with dolphins in the open Red Sea<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Snorkel at one of the best corals reef spots<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Admire the underwater world and colorful fish<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy the banana boat and tablet water sports<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Savor the taste of a buffet lunch served on board<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,32.00,NULL,32.00,NULL,32.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,32.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-18 22:59:45',10,'{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Dolphin Watching Tour with Snorkeling\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on the ultimate Hurghada Dolphin Watching Tour with Snorkeling. Swim with dolphins, explore vibrant coral reefs, and enjoy a memorable day on the Red Sea.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','28','from-hurghada-dolphin-watching-tour-with-snorkeling','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-18 22:59:45','2026-04-01 14:52:13',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(90,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'orange-bay-island-and-snorkeling-trip','{\"en\":\"Orange Bay Island and Snorkeling Trip\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Orange Bay Island Trip from Hurghada: Escape to the Red Sea\'s \\\"Egyptian Caribbean.\\\" Snorkel vibrant coral reefs and relax on the pristine, white sands of Orange Bay. Full-day adventure with lunch & water sports.\"}','{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"\\\" data-block=\\\"true\\\" data-editor=\\\"d4c2r\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"5i8gi-0-0\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"5i8gi-0-0\\\"><span data-offset-key=\\\"5i8gi-0-0\\\">Orange Bay Island and Snorkeling Trip, Snorkel through vibrantly colored marine life at two stunning destinations on this cruise from the Red Sea Governorate to Orange Bay and the Giftun islands. Be served a mouth-watering lunch, soft drinks, and mineral water on board.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"\\\" data-block=\\\"true\\\" data-editor=\\\"d4c2r\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"1blie-0-0\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"1blie-0-0\\\"><span data-offset-key=\\\"1blie-0-0\\\">&shy; <\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"\\\" data-block=\\\"true\\\" data-editor=\\\"d4c2r\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"73eu6-0-0\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"73eu6-0-0\\\"><span data-offset-key=\\\"73eu6-0-0\\\">Your adventure begins when you&rsquo;re picked up in the morning at your hotel and then head out for a day-long snorkeling trip to Red Sea destinations. Sail to Orange and Giftun islands, keeping an eye out for dolphins along the way. When you reach Orange Island, swim in crystal water and enjoy the white sandy beach. During the trip, you will make 2 stops for snorkeling, where you&rsquo;ll see astonishing coral reefs inhabited by colorful fish.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"\\\" data-block=\\\"true\\\" data-editor=\\\"d4c2r\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"csn2h-0-0\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"csn2h-0-0\\\"><span data-offset-key=\\\"csn2h-0-0\\\">&shy; <\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"\\\" data-block=\\\"true\\\" data-editor=\\\"d4c2r\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\"><span data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\">Add to your tour by adding the 20-minute massage and VR 360&deg; snorkeling experience option or 10-minute parasailing options. Relax on the sundeck and enjoy the fresh sea breezes while cruising back to the marina and enjoy hotel drop-off after.<\\/span><\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr\\\" data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><span data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\"><strong>Pristine Beach Relaxation:<\\/strong> Spend about <strong>two hours<\\/strong> on the famous Orange Bay Island, which is a protected part of the Giftun Islands National Park. The highlight is the exceptionally <strong>soft, white sand<\\/strong> and the stunning, <strong>shallow, crystal-clear turquoise waters.<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\"><strong>Photo Opportunities:<\\/strong> The island is famous for its \\\"Instagrammable\\\" spots, including the wooden swings and hammocks set up in the shallow sea, providing iconic Red Sea holiday pictures.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\"><strong>Beach Amenities:<\\/strong> The island offers a relaxed beach club atmosphere with sunbeds, umbrellas, and beach bars\\/cafes (purchases on the island are usually an extra cost).<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\"><strong>Snorkeling Stops:<\\/strong> The boat cruise includes two separate stops at designated coral reef sites in the open sea. These are carefully selected areas known for their pristine and vibrant marine life.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span data-offset-key=\\\"8uode-0-0\\\"><strong>Vibrant Marine Life:<\\/strong> The Red Sea is one of the world\'s best snorkeling destinations. You will have the chance to see a kaleidoscope of <strong>colorful fish<\\/strong> (like parrotfish, angelfish, and clownfish) and complex, thriving <strong>coral gardens<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,35.00,NULL,35.00,NULL,35.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,77,0,0,35.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 09:06:02',10,'{\"en\":\"Orange Bay Island and Snorkeling Trip\"}','{\"en\":\"Orange Bay Island Trip from Hurghada: Escape to the Red Sea\'s \\\"Egyptian Caribbean.\\\" Snorkel vibrant coral reefs and relax on the pristine, white sands of Orange Bay. Full-day adventure with lunch & water sports.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','29','orange-bay-island-and-snorkeling-trip','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 09:06:02','2026-04-01 14:52:18',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(91,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'luxor-west-bank-private-tour-valley-of-kings-hatshepsut-temple','{\"en\":\"Luxor West-bank Private Tour Valley of kings & hatshepsut Temple\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore Luxor\'s West Bank on a private tour: Valley of the Kings, the vibrant tombs of the pharaohs, Hatshepsut Temple, and the Colossi of Memnon. Book your Egyptologist guide today,\"}','{\"en\":\"<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">\\r\\n<section id=\\\"processing-state-8\\\" class=\\\"processing-state_container ng-tns-c3955304238-72 is-gpi-avatar ng-trigger ng-trigger-processingStateShowHide ng-star-inserted is-done-processing\\\">\\r\\n<div id=\\\"processing-state-8-summary\\\" class=\\\"processing-state_details ng-trigger ng-trigger-menuExpansion ng-tns-c3955304238-72 is-gpi-avatar ng-star-inserted\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"tool-summary ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"tool-summary-message ng-tns-c3955304238-72 gds-body-l ng-star-inserted\\\">\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\"><strong>Luxor West Bank Private Tour Valley of kings &amp; hatshepsut Temple: Journey to the Land of Eternity<\\/strong><\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">Step back in time and unlock the secrets of ancient Egyptian royalty on this exclusive <strong>private tour<\\/strong> of Luxor&rsquo;s magnificent West Bank, the ancient capital of Thebes. Far from the bustling East Bank, this is the sacred \\\"Land of the Dead,\\\" where pharaohs prepared for their journey to the afterlife.<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">Begin your adventure <strong>Luxor West Bank Private Tour Valley of kings &amp; hatshepsut Temple<\\/strong> in the legendary <strong>Valley of the Kings<\\/strong>, the royal necropolis for over 500 years. Descend into the meticulously carved rock tombs, marveling at the preserved <strong>vibrant hieroglyphics<\\/strong> and colourful wall art that detail the rulers&rsquo; lives and their passage into the netherworld. Your private, certified <strong>Egyptologist guide<\\/strong> will illuminate the stories behind these extraordinary burial chambers, bringing figures like Ramses and Tutankhamun to life.<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">Next, explore the striking terraces of the <strong>Mortuary Temple of Hatshepsut<\\/strong>, a architectural masterpiece dedicated to Egypt\'s most powerful female pharaoh. Carved directly into the towering cliffs of Deir el-Bahari, its unique design is a testament to her ambitious reign. Conclude your tour with a photo stop at the colossal <strong>Colossi of Memnon<\\/strong>, the silent, massive guardians of a long-lost mortuary temple.<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">Traveling in a comfortable, <strong>private, air-conditioned vehicle<\\/strong>, you\'ll enjoy a personalized, flexible pace, ensuring a stress-free and truly immersive historical experience. This half-day tour is the perfect way to witness the timeless treasures of ancient Egypt.<\\/div>\\r\\n<h4 class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\"><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Valley of the Kings:<\\/strong> This is the royal necropolis where Pharaohs of the New Kingdom (including Tutankhamun, though his tomb) were buried in richly decorated tombs carved deep into the desert rock. You typically visit a selection of tombs whose walls are covered with vivid, colorful paintings of Egyptian mythology and the journey to the afterlife.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Temple of Hatshepsut (Deir el-Bahari):<\\/strong> A magnificent mortuary temple built for the powerful female Pharaoh Hatshepsut. It\'s famous for its unique multi-terraced design that merges with the towering limestone cliffs behind it, as well as its detailed reliefs depicting her divine birth and expedition to the Land of Punt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\"><strong>Colossi of Memnon:<\\/strong> Two massive stone statues of Pharaoh Amenhotep III. They are the only remnants of his enormous mortuary temple, which was once the largest on the West Bank. They are an impressive photo stop and often the first monumental structures visitors see.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"ng-tns-c3955304238-72\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/section>\\r\\n<\\/div>\"}','hours',NULL,6,NULL,'{\"en\":\"6 Hours\"}',NULL,40.00,NULL,40.00,NULL,40.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,80,0,0,40.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 14:02:48',10,'{\"en\":\"Luxor West-bank Private Tour Valley of kings & hatshepsut Temple\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Luxor\'s West Bank on a private tour: Valley of the Kings, the vibrant tombs of the pharaohs, Hatshepsut Temple, and the Colossi of Memnon. Book your Egyptologist guide today\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','30','Luxor-West-bank-Private-Tour-Valley-of-kings-&-hatshepsut-Temple','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 14:02:48','2026-04-01 14:52:24',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(92,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-hurghada-day-trip-to-cairo-by-plane','{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Day Trip to Cairo by Plane\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience a whirlwind Hurghada Day Trip to Cairo by Plane. See the Giza Pyramids, Sphinx, and Egyptian Museum. Shop at Khan el-Khalili. Book your adventure now!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>From Hurghada Day Trip to Cairo by Plane Embark on a full-day guided tour of Cairo from Hurghada. Travel by plane and visit the pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx. Enjoy a restaurant lunch and explore the treasures of the Egyptian Museum. Upon arrival in Cairo you will be greeted by an Egyptologist who will accompany you throughout the tour. The tour starts in Giza, where you can marvel at the famous and impressive pyramids of Cheops, Chephren, and Mykerinos, as well as the world-renowned Sphinx. The tour also includes a visit to the Valley Temple. After a break for a delicious lunch, then board a typical Felucca boat to cross the Nile to the City (optional). The tour continues on to the Egyptian Museum. Here you can admire the treasures of the young pharaoh Tutankhamun with more than 120,000 masterpieces of Egyptian art and artifacts. In the afternoon you can enjoy shopping at the Khan el-Khalili market. At the end of the tour you&rsquo;ll be transferred to the airport in Cairo to catch the flight back to Hurghada, followed by a direct transfer to your hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Visit the Great Pyramid of Giza, one of the 7 Wonders of the Ancient World.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Marvel at the uniqueness of the Sphinx.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Discover more about the history and artifacts at the world-renowned Egyptian Museum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy shopping at the Khan el-Khalili market.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,280.00,NULL,280.00,NULL,280.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,80,0,0,280.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 20:17:49',10,'{\"en\":\"From Hurghada: Day Trip to Cairo by Plane\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience a whirlwind Hurghada Day Trip to Cairo by Plane. See the Giza Pyramids, Sphinx, and Egyptian Museum. Shop at Khan el-Khalili. Book your adventure now!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','31','from-hurghada-day-trip-to-cairo-by-plane','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 20:17:49','2026-04-01 14:53:39',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(93,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-cairo-private-luxor-day-tour-with-guide-and-flights','{\"en\":\"From Cairo: Private Luxor Day Tour with Guide and Flights\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the best of Luxor on a private day tour from Cairo. Fly to Luxor and explore ancient wonders with a guide. Book your unforgettable trip today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Our delegate will Pick-up you up from your hotel in Cairo or Giza at about 6:00 A.M. by air-conditioned car to head to Cairo International Airport to take the one-hour flight to Luxor. (Flight Tickets included) Upon your arrival, our delegate will be waiting for you with our company sign to start your trip heading to the West Bank of Luxor to visit The Valley of the Kings, also known as the Valley of the Gates of the Kings where, for a period of nearly 500 years from the 16th to 11th century BC, rock-cut tombs were excavated for the pharaohs and powerful nobles of the New Kingdom.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Then move on to the Mortuary Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, The Temple of Hatshepsut is a mortuary temple built during the reign of Pharaoh Hatshepsut of the Eighteenth Dynasty of Egypt. Located opposite the city of Luxor, it is considered to be a masterpiece of ancient architecture.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Its three massive terraces rise above the desert floor and into the cliffs of Deir el-Bahari. Next, move to Medinet Habu, where the burial temple of Ramses III can be found, one of the city&rsquo;s most important religious monuments. Its entrance is 63 meters wide and 22 meters tall and bears a representation of the Pharaoh himself punishing some prisoners.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Then move to the colossi of Memnon where you will see the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III at the Colossi of Memnon, then stop for lunch at a local restaurant. Next, Sail on the Nile River in a traditional felucca sailing boat to discover the beauty of Luxor. Relax with a drink as you soak up the scenery.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>You&rsquo;ll then head to the east bank to visit the biggest temple in Luxor, It&rsquo;s the Karnak Temple. dedicated to the god Amun, his wife Mut, and their son Khonsu. Next, move on to Luxor temple. Built by Amenhotep III in the 18th Dynasty in the modern kingdom, the beautiful temple was completed by Ramses II.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After finishing, you will be transferred to Luxor International Airport to take the one-hour flight to Cairo (Flight Tickets included) Upon your arrival, our delegate will be waiting for you outside Cairo Airport After meeting, you will be transferred to your hotel again in Cairo or Giza<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Round-trip flights from Cairo are included<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Transfers in air-conditioned vehicles are included<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Meals are included in the price of the tour<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Departure &amp; Return Location<\\/strong> Cairo or Giza Hotels<\\/p>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,299.00,NULL,299.00,NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,2,0,86,0,0,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 20:58:01',10,'{\"en\":\"From Cairo: Private Luxor Day Tour with Guide and Flights\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the best of Luxor on a private day tour from Cairo. Fly to Luxor and explore ancient wonders with a guide. Book your unforgettable trip today!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','32','from-cairo-private-luxor-day-tour-with-guide-and-flights','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 20:58:01','2026-04-01 14:53:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(94,37,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-aswan-edfu-kom-ombo-temples-private-tour','{\"en\":\"From Aswan: Edfu & Kom Ombo Temples Private Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore the majestic Edfu and Kom Ombo temples on a private tour from Aswan. Discover ancient wonders with your own guide and comfortable transportation.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>After our representative picks you up from your hotel in Aswan, you&rsquo;ll start your adventure Your first stop will be Edfu to visit The Temple of Horus, one of the most impressive feats of construction completed during the Ptolemaic era and it&rsquo;s one of the best places to visit to experience the audacious ambition of Egypt&rsquo;s temple builders.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Then relax in the car enjoy the road until you arrive at your second stop on the tour the temple of Kom Ombo, and what makes it so unique it&rsquo;s that its double design meant that there were courts, halls, sanctuaries, and rooms duplicated for two sets of gods. And to learn more about it please pay all your attention to the private professional Egyptologist who is included in the two temples.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Finally, You will be dropped off at your hotel in Aswan<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore the temple of Edfu.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore the temple of Kom Ombo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Benefit from the private transportation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,69.00,NULL,69.00,NULL,69.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,69.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 21:24:59',10,'{\"en\":\"From Aswan: Edfu & Kom Ombo Temples Private Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore the majestic Edfu and Kom Ombo temples on a private tour from Aswan. Discover ancient wonders with your own guide and comfortable transportation.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','33','From-Aswan:-Edfu-&-Kom-Ombo-Temples-Private-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 21:24:59','2026-04-01 14:52:09',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(95,37,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'from-aswan-abu-simbel-trip-with-small-group','{\"en\":\"From Aswan Abu Simbel Trip with Small Group\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore the magnificent Abu Simbel temples on our Aswan Abu Simbel Trip with a Small Group. Enjoy a personalized tour with an expert guide and hotel pickup.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Take this special opportunity to visit the Great Temple of Abu Simbel with or without a guide. Discover one of the most magnificent monuments in Egypt with included hotel pickup from Aswan.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;In the early morning 4:00 Am you will be picked up from a hotel in Aswan, then you will be transferred by an air-conditioned bus (with a group of people) to the Abu Simbel temple Upon arrival, enjoy a visit to the Abu Simbel Temple, as the Abu Simbel Temple is among the most magnificent monuments in Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The temple is famous for its four huge seated statues that adorn its fa&ccedil;ade. You will have enough time to explore the temple At the end of your wonderful day, you will be transferred again to your hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Experience:<\\/strong> Small groups (typically 6-12 people) allow for a more personalized and intimate experience compared to larger group tours. You\'ll have more opportunities to interact with your guide and ask questions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Expert Guidance:<\\/strong> Like private tours, small-group trips include the services of a knowledgeable Egyptologist guide who will provide in-depth explanations of the Abu Simbel temples.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Cost-Effectiveness:<\\/strong> Small-group tours are generally more affordable than private tours, making them a good option for budget-conscious travelers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Abu Simbel Temples:<\\/strong> The main attraction is the magnificent Abu Simbel complex, featuring: The Temple of Ramses II, with its iconic colossal statues. The Temple of Nefertari, dedicated to Ramses II\'s wife. You\'ll learn about the temples\' history, architecture, and the remarkable feat of their relocation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Shared Transportation:<\\/strong> Transportation is provided in a comfortable, air-conditioned vehicle, shared with the small group. This is a good way to meet other travelers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Efficient Travel:<\\/strong> Small groups allow for more efficient travel than larger groups.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,55.00,NULL,55.00,NULL,55.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,55.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 21:38:28',10,'{\"en\":\"From Aswan Abu Simbel Trip with Small Group\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore the magnificent Abu Simbel temples on our Aswan Abu Simbel Trip with a Small Group. Enjoy a personalized tour with an expert guide and hotel pickup.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','34','from-aswan-abu-simbel-trip-with-small-group','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 21:38:28','2026-04-01 15:10:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(96,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'dendera-abydos-temple-private-tour-from-luxor','{\"en\":\"Dendera & Abydos Temple Private Tour From Luxor\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt\'s wonders on a private tour from Luxor. Visit the Dendera & Abydos Temples, marvel at ancient art, and discover the Temple of Hathor.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Egypt tour pro representative will pick you up from your hotel in Luxor or Nile Cruise ship to discover the ancient sites. First, visit Abydos, the ancient Egyptian believed of god (Lord of the underworld) to be buried there. The temple was built by King Seti I, and completed by King Ramsess II, known as temple of Seti I.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>It is located in Abydos city about 420 km to the south of Cairo in Sohag Government, and 135 km from Luxor . The paintings of the Gods and Pharaohs on the walls of the Osiris Temple at Abydos are among the most beautifully preserved in Egypt. Then continue to Dendera to visit the Temple of Hathor, goddess of love and joy.The temple is located in Dendera which is situated at the north of Luxor .<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Experience:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>A private tour ensures you have the undivided attention of your Egyptologist guide, allowing for in-depth discussions and tailored information.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>You can set your own pace and spend as much time as you desire at each site.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Dendera Temple (Temple of Hathor):<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>This remarkably preserved temple is dedicated to Hathor, the goddess of love, music, and beauty.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>It\'s famous for its stunning astronomical ceiling, intricate carvings, and the \\\"Dendera Light Bulb\\\" relief.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The temple\'s relatively recent cleaning has revealed vibrant colors, making it a visual feast.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Abydos Temple (Temple of Seti I):<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Abydos was an important cult center for the god Osiris, and the Temple of Seti I is considered one of the finest examples of ancient Egyptian art.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Its exquisite reliefs and well-preserved cartouches provide valuable insights into pharaonic history.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>This temple is known for having some of the most beautiful and well preserved ancient Egyptian art.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 22:17:48',10,'{\"en\":\"Dendera & Abydos Temple Private Tour From Luxor\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt\'s wonders on a private tour from Luxor. Visit the Dendera & Abydos Temples, marvel at ancient art, and discover the Temple of Hathor.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','35','dendera-abydos-temple-private-tour-from-luxor','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 22:17:48','2026-03-27 09:51:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(97,42,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'day-trip-to-alexandria-from-cairo','{\"en\":\"Private Day Trip To Alexandria From Cairo\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a captivating Day Trip to Alexandria from Cairo. Explore ancient Roman ruins, the famous library, and the Citadel of Qaitbay on this unforgettable tour.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Enjoy a full-day trip to the historic city of Alexandria and experience the remnants of a bygone era. After pickup from your hotel in Cairo or Giza, you&rsquo;ll drive towards Alexandria, stopping along the way to use the bathroom and get a coffee. Upon arrival, start your tour of this ancient city.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Head towards the marble-stone Roman amphitheater of Kom El-Deka that once accommodated over 800 visitors. Enjoy the sights of its pleasure garden and mosaic floored Roman baths and villas. Afterward, move on to the Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa where you can feel the aura of ancient Egyptian, Greek, and Roman architectural excellence. The cemetery was constructed in the second century AD and is still one of the seven wonders of the middle ages.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Next, visit Pompey&rsquo;s Pillar, the significant Roman triumphal column in Alexandria. Savor a delicious lunch from a local restaurant and then enjoy an outside photo stop at the Library of Alexandria, one of the largest and most renowned archives of the ancient world.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Later, visit the Citadel of Qaitbay, built above the ruined Alexandria lighthouse. At the end of the tour, you&rsquo;ll be driven back to Cairo or Giza to be dropped off at your accommodation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy a full-day trip to the historic city of Alexandria and experience the remnants of a bygone era.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Marvel at the Roman amphitheater of Kom El-Deka.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Admire the architectural excellence of the Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore Pompey&rsquo;s Pillar, enjoying its artifacts and sculptures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy a photo stop by the well-known Library of Alexandria.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Stroll along the ancient ramparts of the 15th century Citadel of Qaitbay.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,95.00,NULL,95.00,NULL,95.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,95.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 22:30:45',10,'{\"en\":\"Private Day Trip To Alexandria From Cairo\"}','{\"en\":\"Embark on a captivating Day Trip to Alexandria from Cairo. Explore ancient Roman ruins, the famous library, and the Citadel of Qaitbay on this unforgettable tour.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','36','day-trip-to-alexandria-from-cairo','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 22:30:45','2026-04-01 15:10:06',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(98,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'day-tour-to-luxor-from-cairo-by-plane','{\"en\":\"Day Tour to Luxor from Cairo by Plane\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience a magnificent day tour to Luxor from Cairo by plane. Explore ancient tombs and temples with our expert guides. Book your unforgettable Egyptian adventure today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>In the early morning, a Journey To Egypt representative will pick you up from your hotel in Cairo to Cairo international airport for a flight to Luxor where you will be met by your tour guide (Exit door) holding a sign with your name.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Then we&rsquo;ll take you across the Nile to the west bank of Luxor, where the richest and most famous necropolis in the world is situated, the Valley of the Kings. Inside the valley, the famous tombs of the Pharaohs are cut into the living rock, some contain fine paintings with their splendor still preserved; the most famous is that of Tutankhamen, discovered in November 1922. Then proceed to visit Deir El Bahari, one of the most splendid temples in ancient Egypt, built by Queen Hatshepsut around 1500 BC.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Proceed to the Colossi of Memnon; there is a legend which tells how, cracked by an earthquake, the two statues began to speak. Move onto the east bank of the Nile to see the Temples at Karnak; it was dedicated to the cult of Amun, the temple consists of numerous buildings built and added to from time to time by the various Pharaohs right up to Roman times. Finally, you will be transferred to Luxor airport for your flight back to Cairo then transfer to your hotel in Cairo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Valley of the Kings:<\\/strong> This is a major highlight, where you\'ll explore the tombs of pharaohs, including the famous Tutankhamun. The intricate hieroglyphics and vibrant paintings within these tombs are truly remarkable.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Temple of Hatshepsut:<\\/strong> This visually stunning mortuary temple, dedicated to the female pharaoh Hatshepsut, is known for its unique architectural design, blending seamlessly with the surrounding cliffs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Colossi of Memnon:<\\/strong> These two massive stone statues, remnants of a once-grand mortuary temple, provide a powerful visual introduction to the scale of ancient Egyptian monuments.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Karnak Temple:<\\/strong> As one of the world\'s largest religious complexes, Karnak Temple is a sprawling site with impressive columns, obelisks, and sanctuaries, showcasing the grandeur of ancient Egyptian religious architecture.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Luxor Temple:<\\/strong> This beautiful temple, located in the modern city of Luxor, is known for its well-preserved structures and its connection to the Karnak Temple through the Avenue of Sphinxes.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,299.00,NULL,299.00,NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-19 23:11:41',10,'{\"en\":\"Day Tour to Luxor from Cairo by Plane\"}','{\"en\":\"\\\"Experience a magnificent day tour to Luxor from Cairo by plane. Explore ancient tombs and temples with our expert guides. Book your unforgettable Egyptian adventure today!\\\"\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','37','day-tour-to-luxor-from-cairo-by-plane','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-19 23:11:41','2026-08-10 15:04:55',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(99,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'cairo-half-day-tour-to-pyramids-of-giza-and-the-sphinx','{\"en\":\"Cairo Half-Day Tour to Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore the ancient wonders of Egypt with our Half-Day Tour to the Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx. Uncover history with an expert Egyptologist. Book today!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>See the Pyramids of Giza, the largest surviving monuments of the ancient world, and the Sphinx on a half-day tour. Start this thrilling experience as an Egyptologist tour guide picks you up in a comfortable air-conditioned car from your Cairo\\/ Giza hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Listen as the Egyptologist will narrate information about the pyramids on your way to the pyramids, including facts, myths, and more. Marvel at the view of the pyramids of Giza, which includes three pyramid complexes and a Sphinx, is a visual treat. Admire the largest among the three Pyramids of Giza, the Great Pyramid of Khufu, a must-see attraction for history enthusiasts and wanderlusts alike.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Take a walk around the pyramid, and feel lucky to witness the panoramic views of the Pyramids &ndash; Cheops, Chephren, and Menkaure, the three important pyramids in the Giza complex. Reward yourself with the inside views of the great pyramid if you choose the option when booking.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Feel as though you are traveling back in time while you traverse inside the pyramid. Roam around, and make sure to capture all the memories in your camera as these pyramids make for excellent photographic backdrops.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy a chance to visit the famous Sphinx of Giza. Take in views of the fabled sculpture that is composed of half a lion and half a pharaoh and was carved out of a single piece is a must-see attraction while in Egypt. With a heart full of memories collected in half a day, you&rsquo;ll be dropped back at your hotel at the end of the day.<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,6,NULL,'{\"en\":\"6 hours\"}',NULL,64.00,NULL,64.00,NULL,64.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,99,0,0,64.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-20 14:44:00',10,'{\"en\":\"Cairo Half-Day Tour to Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore the ancient wonders of Egypt with our Half-Day Tour to the Pyramids of Giza and the Sphinx. Uncover history with an expert Egyptologist. Book today!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','38','cairo-half-day-tour-to-pyramids-of-giza-and-the-sphinx','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-20 14:44:00','2026-04-01 14:52:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(100,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'cairo-day-tour-to-pyramids-of-giza-grand-egyptian-museum-private-tour','{\"en\":\"Cairo Day Tour to Pyramids of Giza & Grand Egyptian Museum | Private Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Egypt’s wonders on a Cairo day tour to the Pyramids of Giza and the Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM). Visit the Great Sphinx, explore Tutankhamun’s treasures, and enjoy a private guided experience.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>See the Pyramids of Giza, the largest surviving monuments of the ancient world, and the Sphinx on a half-day tour. Start this thrilling experience as an Egyptologist tour guide picks you up in a comfortable air-conditioned car from your Cairo\\/ Giza hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Listen as the Egyptologist will narrate information about the pyramids on your way to the pyramids, including facts, myths, and more. Marvel at the view of the pyramids of Giza, which includes three pyramid complexes and a Sphinx, is a visual treat. Admire the largest among the three Pyramids of Giza, the Great Pyramid of Khufu, a must-see attraction for history enthusiasts and wanderlusts alike.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Feel as though you are traveling back in time while you traverse inside the pyramid. Roam around, and make sure to capture all the memories in your camera as these pyramids make for excellent photographic backdrops.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy a chance to visit the famous Sphinx of Giza. Take in views of the fabled sculpture that is composed of half a lion and half a pharaoh and was carved out of a single piece is a must-see attraction while in Egypt. With a heart full of memories collected in half a day, you&rsquo;ll be dropped back at your hotel at the end of the day.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Great Pyramids of Giza &amp; the Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn history from your private Egyptologist guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the world&rsquo;s most modern museum &ndash; the Grand Egyptian Muse.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable private transfers with hotel pick-up and drop-off.<br \\/>.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,7,NULL,'{\"en\":\"7 hours\"}',NULL,70.00,NULL,70.00,NULL,70.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,70.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-20 14:46:23',10,'{\"en\":\"Cairo Day Tour to Pyramids of Giza & Grand Egyptian Museum | Private Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover Egypt’s wonders on a Cairo day tour to the Pyramids of Giza and the Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM). Visit the Great Sphinx, explore Tutankhamun’s treasures, and enjoy a private guided experience.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','39','Cairo-Day-Tour-to-Pyramids-of-Giza-&-Grand-Egyptian-Museum-Private-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-20 14:46:23','2026-04-01 14:55:19',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(101,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'explore-luxor-in-2-days-temples-tombs-lunch-included','{\"en\":\"Explore Luxor in 2 Days: Temples, Tombs & Lunch Included\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Luxor in 2 days on our tour of iconic temples & tombs. Explore Karnak, the Valley of the Kings & more with an expert guide. Lunch included!\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>After pickup from your hotel or the bus or train station on day 1, drive in a comfortable air-conditioned vehicle to the prodigious East Bank of Luxor with an Egyptologist tour guide.<br \\/>Upon arrival, witness the sprawling Karnak Temple Complex, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Discover the vestiges of ancient temples, pylons, chapels and other historic buildings, as well as the Karnak Open Air Museum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Next, continue to the magnificent Luxor Temple, an ancient sandstone temple complex built by great kings such as Amenhotep III, Alexander the Great, Tutankhamun and Ramesses II. After exploring the temple complex, take a delightful ride a felucca, traditional Egyptian sailing boat before savoring a lovely lunch at a local restaurant (upgrade lunch at Banana Island is available as an add-on). You&rsquo;ll then be dropped off back at your hotel or selected location around 2 PM.<br \\/>In the evening, rejoin your guide with hotel pickup at around 6 PM for the Sound and Light Show at Karnak Temple, if you select this optional tour.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Find out about the eventful history of ancient Thebes, the glory of Egyptian civilization, and the legacy of the pharaohs with the show&rsquo;s narration. Enjoy a supernatural experience of poetic voices, haunting music, and light and sound effects before being dropped back to your hotel or selected location. Day 2 begins with pickup again, after which you&rsquo;ll make your way to either the hot air balloon port or the West Bank of Luxor, depending on the tour option selected.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>If you opt for the balloon ride, cross to the west bank of the River Nile to watch the sunrise. Listen to the pilot and ground crew&rsquo;s safety briefing and instructions, then hop into the basket of the balloon.<br \\/>As the balloon gently rises in the sky, relish the breathtaking view of Luxor and catch the glory of the morning sun. Next, head to the West Bank of Luxor to visit the Valley of the Kings, or go there directly if you don&rsquo;t take the hot air balloon option.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Glance around the complex and see the tombs and resting places of remarkable Egyptian kings such as Merneptah, Ramesses III, and Ramesses VI. You can also visit the entrance to the famed Tutankhamun&rsquo;s Tomb if you purchase the add-on. From here, move on to the Mortuary Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, dedicated to the fifth pharaoh and the only female ruler of Egypt who reigned for 20 peaceful years.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Finally, discover the Mortuary Temple of Amenhotep III at the Colossi of Memnon before breaking for lunch at a local restaurant.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Thereafter, you will be dropped back to your hotel or selected location.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Marvel at the historical edifices in the splendid Karnak Temple Complex.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Admire the spell-binding architecture of Luxor Temple.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Experience the complete grandeur of Luxor with a comprehensive 2-day tour of the East and West Banks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Maximize your time in Luxor and explore its most significant historical sites at a relaxed pace.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Explore the Valley of Kings and visit the tombs of celebrated Egyptian rulers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Marvel at the Colossi of Memnon, two massive statues guarding the Theban necropolis.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',2,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"2 Days\"}',NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,0,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-20 15:26:36',10,'{\"en\":\"Explore Luxor in 2 Days: Temples, Tombs & Lunch Included\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover Luxor in 2 days on our tour of iconic temples & tombs. Explore Karnak, the Valley of the Kings & more with an expert guide. Lunch included!\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','40','explore-luxor-in-2-days-temples-tombs-lunch-included','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-20 15:26:36','2026-04-01 14:52:32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(102,41,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'sharm-el-sheikh-giza-pyramids-egyptian-museum-by-air','{\"en\":\"Sharm El Sheikh: Giza Pyramids & Egyptian Museum by Air\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\" trip from the beautiful Red Sea resort of Sharm El Sheikh to the historic capital of Cairo is a highlight for many travelers. This professionally crafted itinerary, offers a seamless and unforgettable day trip to see Egypt\'s most famous wonders.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h3><strong>Sharm El Sheikh: Giza Pyramids &amp; Egyptian Museum by Air<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>This one-day, round-trip itinerary is designed to maximize your sightseeing time in Cairo, eliminating the long, overnight bus journey and providing a comfortable, efficient experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>ourney to the Heart of Ancient Egypt<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Early Morning (4:30 AM - 6:00 AM):<\\/strong> Your adventure begins with a professional pick-up from your hotel in Sharm El Sheikh in a private, air-conditioned vehicle. You will be transferred to Sharm El Sheikh International Airport for your short domestic flight to Cairo. The flight duration is approximately one hour, allowing for an early arrival and a full day of exploration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Morning (7:00 AM - 12:00 PM):<\\/strong> Upon arrival at Cairo International Airport, you will be met by your certified Egyptologist guide. Your first stop is the magnificent <strong>Grand Egyptian Museum (GEM)<\\/strong>, located near the Pyramids of Giza. As the world\'s largest archaeological museum, the GEM is home to over 100,000 artifacts, with a special focus on the treasures of Tutankhamun. Your guide will lead you through the highlights, including the iconic golden death mask, sarcophagi, and the stunning artifacts from the tomb of the boy king.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Mid-Day (12:00 PM - 1:00 PM):<\\/strong> Enjoy a well-deserved break for lunch at a quality local restaurant. Savor traditional Egyptian cuisine, offering a taste of authentic local flavors.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Afternoon (1:00 PM - 4:00 PM):<\\/strong> After lunch, the journey continues to the <strong>Giza Plateau<\\/strong>, home to one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World. Your guided tour will include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The <strong>Great Pyramid of Khufu<\\/strong>, the oldest and largest pyramid.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>The <strong>Pyramids of Khafre and Menkaure<\\/strong>, all of which you can admire from a panoramic viewpoint.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>A visit to the majestic <strong>Great Sphinx<\\/strong>, the mythical guardian of the Giza Plateau. Your guide will share the history and mysteries surrounding this iconic monument.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Late Afternoon (4:00 PM - 5:00 PM):<\\/strong> Depending on time and interest, your guide may offer a visit to an authentic local papyrus institute or perfume workshop, where you can learn about these traditional Egyptian crafts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Evening (6:00 PM - 8:00 PM):<\\/strong> Transfer from the Giza Plateau to Cairo International Airport for your return flight to Sharm El Sheikh.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Late Evening:<\\/strong> Upon arrival back at Sharm El Sheikh Airport, you will be met and transferred back to your hotel, concluding an enriching and unforgettable day trip.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3>Please remember to bring:<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Camera<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Passports<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,280.00,NULL,280.00,NULL,280.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,82,0,0,280.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-24 10:56:25',10,'{\"en\":\"Sharm El Sheikh: Giza Pyramids & Egyptian Museum by Air\"}','{\"en\":\" trip from the beautiful Red Sea resort of Sharm El Sheikh to the historic capital of Cairo is a highlight for many travelers. This professionally crafted itinerary, offers a seamless and unforgettable day trip to see Egypt\'s most famous wonders.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','42','Sharm-El-Sheikh:-Giza-Pyramids-&-Egyptian-Museum-by-Air','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-24 10:56:25','2026-04-01 14:53:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(103,41,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'luxor-day-trip-from-sharm-el-sheikh-by-plane-the-ultimate-guide','{\"en\":\"Luxor Day Trip from Sharm El Sheikh by Plane: The Ultimate Guide\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Luxor Day Trip from Sharm El Sheikh by Plane: The Ultimate Guide\"}','{\"en\":\"<h3><strong>Luxor Day Trip from Sharm El Sheikh by Plane: The Ultimate Guide<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>trip from the beautiful Red Sea resort of Sharm El Sheikh to the historic city of Luxor is a popular day trip for travelers who want to experience ancient Egypt. Traveling by air is the most efficient and comfortable way to do it, turning what would be a very long bus journey into a full, yet manageable, day of exploration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>day trip to Luxor from Sharm El Sheikh by plane is a perfect way to discovr Luxor Sights, an excellent way to see the main sights. The domestic flight is short, typically lasting around <strong>1 hour and 15 minutes<\\/strong>. This saves you from the 7-9 hour bus ride each way. The tour is meticulously planned to ensure you get the most out of your time.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Early Morning:<\\/strong> Your day begins with a pre-dawn hotel pickup (typically around 4:00 AM) and a transfer to Sharm El Sheikh International Airport (SSH). You\'ll take an early flight to Luxor International Airport (LXR).<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Morning:<\\/strong> Upon arrival, you\'ll be greeted by your certified Egyptologist guide. The tour generally begins on the <strong>West Bank<\\/strong>, the ancient \\\"City of the Dead.\\\"<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Afternoon:<\\/strong> After lunch, you will cross to the <strong>East Bank<\\/strong>, the \\\"City of the Living.\\\"<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><strong>Evening:<\\/strong> At the end of the day, you will be transferred back to Luxor Airport for your return flight to Sharm El Sheikh, followed by a final transfer back to your hotel.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,285.00,NULL,285.00,NULL,285.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,86,0,0,285.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,1,'2025-09-24 12:00:01',10,'{\"en\":\"Luxor Day Trip from Sharm El Sheikh by Plane: The Ultimate Guide\"}','{\"en\":\"Luxor Day Trip from Sharm El Sheikh by Plane: The Ultimate Guide\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','43','Luxor-Day-Trip-from-Sharm-El-Sheikh-by-Plane:-The-Ultimate-Guide','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-24 12:00:01','2026-04-01 14:53:29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(104,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'private-day-tour-from-hurghada-to-luxor-valley-of-the-kings','{\"en\":\"Private Day Tour from Hurghada to Luxor | Valley of the Kings\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Book a private Luxor day trip from Hurghada. Visit Karnak Temple, Valley of the Kings & Hatshepsut Temple with Egyptologist guide & lunch included.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2><strong>Private Day Tour from Hurghada to Luxor<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the treasures of ancient Egypt on a private day trip from Hurghada to Luxor. Travel in comfort across the Eastern Desert and explore the wonders of the world&rsquo;s largest open-air museum with your own Egyptologist guide.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your journey begins with an early morning pick-up from your Hurghada hotel in a private, air-conditioned vehicle. Upon arrival in Luxor, you&rsquo;ll step inside the legendary Karnak Temple Complex, with its towering columns and sacred lake. Afterward, enjoy lunch at a local restaurant before crossing the Nile to the West Bank.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Here you&rsquo;ll explore the Valley of the Kings, home to the richly decorated tombs of Egypt&rsquo;s pharaohs. Visit the stunning Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, and stop for photos at the Colossi of Memnon. If time allows, add an optional Nile felucca boat ride for magical views.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This full-day Luxor tour includes all main entrance fees, a professional guide, and lunch. Drinks, optional tombs such as Tutankhamun, and Nile sailing can be arranged on the spot.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable private transfer from your Hurghada hotel to Luxor<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guided visit to the Karnak Temple Complex<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Valley of the Kings with entry to several royal tombs<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the Temple of Queen Hatshepsut<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Photo stop at the Colossi of Memnon<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Delicious lunch at a local restaurant<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional Nile felucca ride for panoramic views<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1-Day\"}',NULL,180.00,NULL,180.00,NULL,180.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,99,0,0,180.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-28 10:42:46',10,'{\"en\":\"Private Day Tour from Hurghada to Luxor | Valley of the Kings\"}','{\"en\":\"Book a private Luxor day trip from Hurghada. Visit Karnak Temple, Valley of the Kings & Hatshepsut Temple with Egyptologist guide & lunch included.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','44','Private-Day-Tour-from-Hurghada-to-Luxor-Valley-of-the-Kings','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-28 10:42:46','2026-04-01 14:53:23',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(105,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'one-package-luxor-hot-air-balloon-ride-private-full-day-sightseeing-tour','{\"en\":\"One Package: Luxor Hot Air Balloon Ride & Private Full Day Sightseeing Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Fly over Luxor at sunrise by hot air balloon, then explore Karnak, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple & more on a full-day East & West Bank tour.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Make your visit to Luxor unforgettable with this once-in-a-lifetime <strong>hot air balloon flight<\\/strong> combined with a guided tour of the East and West Bank&rsquo;s greatest treasures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your adventure begins before dawn as you float high above Luxor in a <strong>sunrise hot air balloon ride<\\/strong>. Watch the golden sun rise over the Nile River, illuminating temples, tombs, and the green fields of the West Bank &mdash; an experience you&rsquo;ll never forget.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After landing, continue your journey with a professional Egyptologist guide. Start on the West Bank, where you&rsquo;ll visit the world-famous <strong>Valley of the Kings<\\/strong>, final resting place of Egypt&rsquo;s pharaohs. Explore three royal tombs, then head to the <strong>Temple of Queen Hatshepsut<\\/strong>, one of Egypt&rsquo;s most remarkable monuments. Stop at the <strong>Colossi of Memnon<\\/strong> for photos before crossing to the East Bank.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>On the East Bank, discover the magnificent <strong>Karnak Temple<\\/strong> Complex, the largest religious site ever built. End the day at the stunning <strong>Luxor Temple<\\/strong>, beautifully lit by the afternoon sun. A delicious lunch at a local restaurant is included along the way.<\\/p>\\r\\n<div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"title__uQE0\\\">\\r\\n<h3><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Spend the day exploring Luxor\'s ancient remains with a private guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Get a bird&rsquo;s-eye view of the archaeological sites from a hot-air balloon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Cover both east and west banks: ideal for time-pressed travelers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>All transportation included with hotel pickup and drop-off.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<\\/div>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,105.00,NULL,105.00,NULL,105.00,NULL,NULL,7,0,88,0,0,105.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,1,'2025-09-28 19:17:58',10,'{\"en\":\"One Package: Luxor Hot Air Balloon Ride & Private Full Day Sightseeing Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Fly over Luxor at sunrise by hot air balloon, then explore Karnak, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple & more on a full-day East & West Bank tour.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','45','One-Package-Luxor-Hot-Air-Balloon-Ride-&-Private-Full-Day-Sightseeing-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-28 19:17:58','2026-04-01 14:54:58',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(106,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'private-day-trip-to-edfu-kom-ombo-temples-from-luxor','{\"en\":\"Edfu & Kom Ombo Temples Private Day Tour from Luxor\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Book a private day tour from Luxor to Edfu & Kom Ombo Temples. Explore ancient wonders with an Egyptologist guide, hotel transfers & personalized experience.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Edfu &amp; Kom Ombo Temples Private Tour from Luxor<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Step back in time and explore two of Egypt&rsquo;s most impressive temples on this private day tour from Luxor to Edfu and Kom Ombo. Travel in comfort along the Nile Valley with your expert Egyptologist guide and enjoy a personalized experience at your own pace.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Visit the Temple of Horus at Edfu, one of the best-preserved temples in Egypt, dedicated to the falcon-headed god. Continue to Kom Ombo Temple, a unique double temple devoted to both Sobek, the crocodile god, and Horus the Elder. Discover fascinating carvings, ancient medical reliefs, and the nearby Crocodile Museum.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This tour is ideal for history lovers and travelers seeking a deeper understanding of ancient Egyptian religion and architecture.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Temple of Horus at Edfu, one of the most complete temples in Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the unique double temple of Kom Ombo dedicated to Sobek &amp; Horus.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn about ancient rituals, carvings, and daily life in Pharaonic times.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private tour for a personalized experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable transfers along the Nile Valley.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,88,0,0,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-28 20:40:39',10,'{\"en\":\"Edfu & Kom Ombo Temples Private Day Tour from Luxor\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover two of Egypt’s most remarkable temples on a private day trip from Luxor to Edfu & Kom Ombo. Travel in comfort with your personal Egyptologist guide, explore well-preserved temples, and learn the secrets of ancient Egyptian gods and rituals along the Nile Valley.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','46','private-day-trip-to-edfu-kom-ombo-temples-from-luxor','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-28 20:40:39','2026-04-01 14:53:53',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(107,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'giza-pyramids-saqqara-memphis-day-tour-private-cairo-excursion','{\"en\":\"Giza Pyramids, Saqqara & Memphis Day Tour | Private Cairo Excursion\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Egypt’s ancient wonders on a full-day tour to the Giza Pyramids, Saqqara Step Pyramid, and Memphis. Visit the Great Sphinx, explore tombs and pyramids, and see the Colossus of Ramses II with a private Egyptologist guide.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2><strong>Giza Pyramids, Saqqara &amp; Memphis Day Tour | Private Cairo Excursion<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p><strong>Discover Egypt&rsquo;s <\\/strong>ancient wonders on a full-day tour to the Giza Pyramids, Saqqara Step Pyramid, and Memphis. Visit the Great Sphinx, explore tombs and pyramids, and see the Colossus of Ramses II with a private Egyptologist guide.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Great Pyramids of Giza &amp; Sphinx<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the Step Pyramid of Djoser at Saqqara<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the ancient capital Memphis and its open-air museum<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private guided tour with hotel pick-up and drop-off<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hour \"}',NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,89.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,0,0,0,89.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-09-30 05:39:30',10,'{\"en\":\"Giza Pyramids, Saqqara & Memphis Day Tour | Private Cairo Excursion\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Egypt’s treasures on a private day tour to the Giza Pyramids, Saqqara Step Pyramid, and Memphis. Discover ancient tombs, the Great Sphinx, and the Colossus of Ramses II with your expert guide.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','47','Giza-Pyramids-Saqqara-&-Memphis-Day-Tour-Private-Cairo-Excursion','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-09-30 05:39:30','2026-04-01 14:52:49',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(108,44,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'private-luxor-day-trip-from-el-gouna-visit-karnak-valley-of-the-kings','{\"en\":\"Private Luxor Day Trip from El Gouna – Visit Karnak & Valley of the Kings\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover the wonders of ancient Thebes on this private day tour from El Gouna to Luxor. Travel in comfort with an expert Egyptologist guide and explore the most famous temples and tombs of Egypt’s golden age.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Private Luxor Day Trip from El Gouna &ndash; Visit Karnak, Valley of the Kings &amp; Hatshepsut Temple with Lunch.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Discover the wonders of ancient Thebes on this private day tour from El Gouna to Luxor. Travel in comfort with an expert Egyptologist guide and explore the most famous temples and tombs of Egypt&rsquo;s golden age.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Visit the majestic Karnak Temple Complex, the largest religious site ever built, and the beautiful Luxor Temple, glowing with timeless grandeur. Cross the Nile to the West Bank, home to the Valley of the Kings, where Egypt&rsquo;s pharaohs were laid to rest in richly decorated tombs. Continue to the elegant Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, the only female pharaoh, and capture stunning photos at the Colossi of Memnon.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy a delicious lunch at a local restaurant before heading back to El Gouna &mdash; a day filled with history, culture, and unforgettable memories along the Nile Valley.<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,14,NULL,'{\"en\":\"14 Hours \"}',NULL,90.00,NULL,90.00,NULL,90.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,99,0,0,90.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-10-11 07:22:44',10,'{\"en\":\"Private Luxor Day Trip from El Gouna – Visit Karnak & Valley of the Kings\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover the wonders of ancient Thebes on this private day tour from El Gouna to Luxor. Travel in comfort with an expert Egyptologist guide and explore the most famous temples and tombs of Egypt’s golden age.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','66','Private-Luxor-Day-Trip-from-El-Gouna-Visit-Karnak-&-Valley-of-the-Kings','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-10-11 07:22:44','2026-04-01 14:54:06',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(109,40,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'2-day-luxor-tour-from-marsa-alam-with-hot-air-balloon-ride','{\"en\":\"2-Day Luxor Tour from Marsa Alam with Hot Air Balloon Ride\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the magic of ancient Thebes on a 2-day tour from Marsa Alam to Luxor. Visit Karnak and Luxor Temples, soar above Luxor in a hot air balloon, and explore the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, and Colossi of Memnon with expert guides.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2><strong>2-Day Luxor Tour from Marsa Alam with Hot Air Balloon Ride<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the ancient wonders of Luxor on this unforgettable 2-day tour from Marsa Alam. Travel in comfort through the desert and Nile Valley to explore Karnak and Luxor Temples on the first day &mdash; two of Egypt&rsquo;s most impressive monuments on the East Bank.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After an overnight stay in a 4★ hotel, wake up early for an amazing hot air balloon ride over Luxor, where the sunrise paints the temples and the Nile in golden light. Continue your adventure to the West Bank to visit the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, and the Colossi of Memnon before returning to Marsa Alam.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This tour includes hotel pickup, a professional Egyptologist guide, entrance fees, meals, and accommodation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Why Book This Tour:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Experience Luxor&rsquo;s East and West Bank highlights in just two days.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Soar above the city in a once-in-a-lifetime balloon ride.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private transportation ensures comfort and flexibility.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Expert guides bring Egypt&rsquo;s ancient history to life.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>✨ <strong>Highlights: <\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Karnak Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hot Air Balloon Ride.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hatshepsut Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Colossi of Memnon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>📍 <strong>Duration: 2 Days | From: Marsa Alam | Style: Private Guided Tour.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"2-Days \"}',NULL,280.00,NULL,280.00,NULL,280.00,NULL,NULL,7,0,99,0,0,280.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-10-17 08:59:55',10,'{\"en\":\"2-Day Luxor Tour from Marsa Alam with Hot Air Balloon Ride\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience the magic of ancient Thebes on a 2-day tour from Marsa Alam to Luxor. Visit Karnak and Luxor Temples, soar above Luxor in a hot air balloon, and explore the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, and Colossi of Memnon with expert guides.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','67','2-Day-Luxor-Tour-from-Marsa-Alam-with-Hot-Air-Balloon-Ride','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-10-17 08:59:55','2026-03-27 09:00:46',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(110,44,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'two-day-luxor-tour-from-el-gouna-valley-of-the-kings-karnak-optional-hot-air-balloon-ride','{\"en\":\"Two-Day Luxor Tour from El Gouna Valley of the Kings Karnak & Optional Hot-Air Balloon Ride\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore ancient Luxor on a 2-day tour from El Gouna. Visit the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, Karnak, and Luxor Temple with optional hot-air balloon ride. Includes hotel transfers, private Egyptologist guide, meals, and accommodation.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><br \\/><strong>Two-Day Luxor Tour from El Gouna with Optional Hot-Air Balloon Ride<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Experience the magic and history of Luxor with this two-day private tour from El Gouna, designed for travelers who want to explore the highlights of Egypt&rsquo;s ancient capital at a relaxed pace. This overnight journey provides a comprehensive exploration of Luxor&rsquo;s East and West Banks, iconic temples, royal tombs, and cultural landmarks, while offering the option to soar above the city in a sunrise hot-air balloon ride, creating unforgettable memories.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your journey begins with an early morning pickup from your El Gouna hotel in a private air-conditioned vehicle. Travel across the Eastern Desert as your expert Egyptologist guide introduces the fascinating history of Luxor, the ancient capital of Thebes, home to monumental temples and tombs. Upon arrival, you will start on the West Bank, visiting the Valley of the Kings, the final resting place of Egypt&rsquo;s most famous pharaohs. Explore several decorated tombs including those of Tutankhamun (optional entry), Seti I, or Ramses III, and learn about the rituals, mythology, and artistry of the New Kingdom.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Next, visit the majestic Temple of Queen Hatshepsut, an architectural marvel carved into the cliffs of Deir el-Bahari, followed by a brief stop at the Colossi of Memnon, two giant statues guarding the mortuary temple of Amenhotep III. After a morning of exploration, enjoy a lunch break at a local Nile-view restaurant before being transferred to your 4- or 5-star hotel in Luxor for check-in and overnight stay.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>On Day 2, you may begin early with an optional hot-air balloon ride at sunrise, offering breathtaking panoramic views over the Nile, Luxor, and surrounding desert. Afterwards, visit the East Bank, including the Karnak Temple Complex, with its massive columns, sacred lake, statues, and obelisks, followed by a visit to the Luxor Temple, beautifully illuminated and filled with historical significance. After sightseeing, enjoy lunch before your private transfer back to El Gouna.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Valley of the Kings exploration.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Temple of Queen Hatshepsut.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Colossi of Memnon.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Karnak Temple Complex and Luxor Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional sunrise hot-air balloon ride.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Overnight 4- or 5-star hotel in Luxor.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private Egyptologist guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Nile-view lunch.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',2,NULL,1,'{\"en\":\"2 Day \\\\ 1 Night\"}',NULL,299.00,NULL,299.00,NULL,299.00,NULL,NULL,7,0,99,0,0,299.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-24 07:39:10',10,'{\"en\":\"Two-Day Luxor Tour from El Gouna | Valley of the Kings, Karnak & Optional Hot-Air Balloon Ride\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore ancient Luxor on a 2-day tour from El Gouna. Visit the Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, Karnak, and Luxor Temple with optional hot-air balloon ride. Includes hotel transfers, private Egyptologist guide, meals, and accommodation.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','68','Two-Day-Luxor-Tour-from-El-Gouna-Valley-of-the-Kings-Karnak-&-Optional-Hot-Air-Balloon-Ride','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-11-24 07:39:10','2026-04-01 14:54:44',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(111,44,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'dolphin-house-snorkeling-trip-from-el-gouna','{\"en\":\"Dolphin House Snorkeling Trip from El Gouna\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Embark on a luxurious full-day snorkeling adventure from El Gouna to the world-famous Dolphin House, a pristine lagoon in the Red Sea renowned for its wild dolphins and vibrant coral reefs. This tour offers a perfect blend of adventure, relaxation, and eco-conscious marine exploration. Swim alongside colorful reef fish, snorkel in crystal-clear waters, and experience the magic of wild dolphins in their natural habitat under the guidance of professional crew and marine experts.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>Embark on a luxurious full-day snorkeling adventure from El Gouna to the world-famous Dolphin House, a pristine lagoon in the Red Sea renowned for its wild dolphins and vibrant coral reefs. This tour offers a perfect blend of adventure, relaxation, and eco-conscious marine exploration. Swim alongside colorful reef fish, snorkel in crystal-clear waters, and experience the magic of wild dolphins in their natural habitat under the guidance of professional crew and marine experts.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Ideal for families, couples, and marine enthusiasts, this tour combines exciting snorkeling spots, onboard dining, and optional water sports, ensuring an unforgettable Red Sea experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Why Choose This Tour<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Encounter wild dolphins in their natural habitat.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Snorkel pristine Red Sea coral reefs.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy luxurious, full-day onboard comfort.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guided by experienced marine experts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Eco-conscious and family-friendly.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><strong>Important Details<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>tour Duration: 7&ndash;8 hours.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Departure Time: 07:30&ndash;08:30 AM.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Difficulty Level: Easy &ndash; suitable for beginners, children, and non-swimmers (life jackets provided).<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>What to Bring: Swimsuit, towel, sunscreen, sunglasses, hat, underwater camera, change of clothes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Safety &amp; Ethics: Guides follow ethical wildlife interaction practices; respect for dolphins is a priority.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Best Time: Morning departures offer calm seas and better chances to spot dolphins.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,45.00,NULL,45.00,NULL,45.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,99,0,0,45.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-11-24 08:26:18',10,'{\"en\":\"Dolphin House Snorkeling Trip from El Gouna\"}','{\"en\":\"Experience a full-day Dolphin House snorkeling trip from El Gouna. Swim in crystal-clear Red Sea waters, snorkel coral reefs, enjoy a buffet lunch, and encounter wild dolphins responsibly. Book your adventure now\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','69','Dolphin-House-Snorkeling-Trip-from-El Gouna','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-11-24 08:26:18','2026-04-01 14:53:10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(112,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'diving-snorkeling-boat-tour-with-lunch','{\"en\":\"Diving & Snorkeling Tour with Lunch from Hurghada\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Enjoy a Red Sea diving and snorkeling tour from Hurghada with lunch, crystal-clear waters, coral reefs, and professional guides.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Diving &amp; Snorkeling Tour with Lunch from Hurghada<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Experience the underwater beauty of the Red Sea on a diving and snorkeling tour from Hurghada with lunch included. Sail to some of the best snorkeling and diving sites, famous for crystal-clear water, vibrant coral reefs, and colorful marine life. This Hurghada snorkeling and diving excursion is perfect for both beginners and certified divers. Professional instructors provide full guidance and equipment, ensuring a safe and enjoyable experience. Relax onboard the boat between stops and enjoy a freshly prepared lunch. Whether you choose snorkeling or an introductory dive, this Red Sea tour offers unforgettable moments beneath the waves and is a must-do activity during your Hurghada vacation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Snorkeling at top Red Sea reefs.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Optional introductory diving.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Colorful marine life and corals.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Boat trip with sea views.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Lunch onboard.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,40.00,NULL,40.00,NULL,40.00,NULL,NULL,7,0,77,0,0,40.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-12-20 10:59:31',10,'{\"en\":\"Diving & Snorkeling Tour with Lunch from Hurghada\"}','{\"en\":\"Enjoy a Red Sea diving and snorkeling tour from Hurghada with lunch, crystal-clear waters, coral reefs, and professional guides.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','70','diving-snorkeling-boat-tour-with-lunch','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-12-20 10:59:31','2026-04-01 14:55:12',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(113,39,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'quad-safari-adventure-from-hurghada','{\"en\":\"Quad Safari Adventure from Hurghada\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Enjoy a thrilling quad safari from Hurghada with Bedouin village visit, desert views, and professional guides. Book your desert adventure today.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Quad Safari Adventure from Hurghada<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy an adrenaline-filled quad safari tour from Hurghada and explore the breathtaking Eastern Desert landscapes. This exciting desert adventure takes you across golden sand dunes and rugged terrain on a powerful quad bike, offering stunning panoramic views of the Red Sea mountains. Led by professional desert guides, this Hurghada quad safari combines thrill, safety, and cultural discovery. During the journey, you will visit a traditional Bedouin village, learn about desert life, enjoy Bedouin tea, and take memorable photos at scenic desert viewpoints. This tour is ideal for adventure seekers, couples, and families looking to experience the desert in a fun and authentic way. The Hurghada quad biking tour is one of the most popular desert excursions and a perfect addition to your Red Sea holiday.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Quad biking across Hurghada desert dunes.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit a Bedouin village.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Authentic Bedouin tea.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Stunning desert photo stops.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Professional desert guides.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,5,NULL,'{\"en\":\"5 Hours\"}',NULL,35.00,NULL,35.00,NULL,35.00,NULL,NULL,6,0,77,0,0,35.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2025-12-20 11:15:48',10,'{\"en\":\"Quad Safari Adventure from Hurghada\"}','{\"en\":\"Enjoy a thrilling quad safari from Hurghada with Bedouin village visit, desert views, and professional guides. Book your desert adventure today.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','71','Quad-Safari-Adventure-from-Hurghada','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2025-12-20 11:15:48','2026-04-01 14:55:05',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(114,28,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'giza-pyramids-guided-tour','{\"en\":\"Giza Pyramids Guided Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Experience the ultimate Giza Pyramids guided tour. See the Great Sphinx, enjoy a desert camel ride, and explore the Grand Egyptian Museum with an expert Egyptologist. Book your adventure today\"}','{\"en\":\"<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Experiencing the Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour is one of the most memorable ways to witness Egypt&rsquo;s ancient wonders in a short time. This tour focuses on the most magical moments of the day, when soft morning light or warm evening colors transform the desert landscape. Designed as a half-day experience, it suits travelers who want depth without long schedules, while respecting local regulations and cultural guidelines.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Choosing this tour means enjoying the pyramids in calmer conditions, with fewer crowds and better lighting. It is a practical option for visitors seeking a meaningful cultural experience combined with comfort and flexibility, especially when time in Cairo is limited.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2 data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">What Is a Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">The Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour is a guided experience that takes place either early in the morning or late in the afternoon. Instead of visiting during peak hours, the tour aligns with sunrise or sunset to offer a quieter atmosphere and unique views of the Giza Plateau.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">This type of tour usually includes a guided walk or camel ride around the pyramids, focusing on panoramic viewpoints rather than long indoor visits. Because it lasts only a few hours, it fits perfectly into a travel plan without causing fatigue, while still delivering a strong emotional and visual impact.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Why Choose a Sunrise or Sunset Camel Tour at the Giza Pyramids?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Many travelers ask why timing matters so much. A Sunrise or Sunset Camel Tour at the Giza Pyramids changes the entire experience, not just the lighting.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Early mornings bring cooler temperatures and peaceful surroundings, while evenings offer dramatic skies and a relaxed pace. Both options reduce crowd density, making it easier to connect with the place. In addition, camel rides add a traditional element that aligns naturally with the desert environment, enhancing the authenticity of the journey.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Sunrise Experience at the Giza Pyramids<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Watching the pyramids at sunrise is a calm and almost meditative experience. As the first light touches the Great Pyramid of Khufu, the desert slowly awakens, creating a sense of timelessness that is hard to replicate later in the day.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">This option is ideal for travelers who enjoy quiet moments, photographers seeking soft shadows, and visitors sensitive to heat. The atmosphere feels exclusive, allowing you to focus on the scale and history of the monuments without distractions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Sunset Experience at the Giza Pyramids<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">The sunset version of the Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour offers a very different mood. As the sun lowers, the sky fills with warm tones that highlight the outlines of the pyramids against the horizon.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">This experience is especially popular with couples, content creators, and travelers who prefer a relaxed end to their day. The golden hour light creates striking photo opportunities, while the cooling desert air adds comfort after a busy day in Cairo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Which Is Better &ndash; Sunrise or Sunset at the Giza Pyramids?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">There is no universal answer, as each option serves a different travel style. Sunrise tours emphasize tranquility and cooler weather, while sunset tours focus on colors and atmosphere.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">A simple comparison helps clarify the choice. Sunrise offers fewer people and softer light, while sunset provides dramatic skies and a more social feel. Both options deliver strong value, and the best choice depends on personal preferences and daily schedules.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Camel Ride Experience at the Giza Pyramids<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">A camel ride is a central element of this tour, offering a traditional way to explore the desert surroundings. The ride follows established paths around the pyramids, ensuring safety and respect for heritage protection rules.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Guides explain how to ride comfortably, making the experience suitable even for beginners. The pace is slow and steady, allowing time to observe details, take photos, and appreciate the scale of the ancient structures without rushing.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Tour Itinerary &ndash; Simple Route Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">The itinerary is designed to be clear and efficient, focusing on quality rather than quantity. The route follows a logical flow that maximizes views while minimizing unnecessary movement.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Arrival at the Giza Plateau and meeting the local guide<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Short introduction to the history and layout of the pyramids<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Camel ride toward panoramic viewpoints overlooking the three main pyramids<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Time allocated for photos during sunrise or sunset<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Gradual return and conclusion of the tour<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>Who Is This Tour Perfect For?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">The Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour suits a wide range of travelers. It works well for first-time visitors who want a strong introduction, as well as repeat travelers seeking a different perspective.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">It is particularly suitable for those with limited time, photography enthusiasts, couples, solo travelers, and anyone interested in a calm yet immersive cultural experience. Families with older children often find it manageable due to its short duration.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Why Book with Egypt Tours Company?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Booking with Egypt Tours Company offers practical advantages rooted in experience and local knowledge. The company focuses on clear communication, flexible scheduling, and compliance with tourism standards.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Their approach emphasizes respectful guiding, realistic itineraries, and support before and during the tour. This reduces uncertainty and helps travelers focus on enjoying the experience rather than managing logistics.<\\/p>\\r\\n<div data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<h2 data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;49&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\\\">Conclusion &ndash; Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;439&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;51&quot;}\\\">In the end, choosing a&nbsp;<span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;111&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;74&quot;}\\\">Giza Pyramids Sunrise Sunset Tour<\\/span>&nbsp;offers a rare opportunity to experience one of the world&rsquo;s most iconic landmarks at its most atmospheric moments. Sunrise and sunset tours consistently rank among the most satisfying short experiences in Cairo, especially for travelers seeking calm conditions, better lighting, and meaningful photos within a limited timeframe.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;618&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;458&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<li data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;496&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;458&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;496&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;460&quot;}\\\">Ideal timing away from peak crowds<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;532&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;497&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;532&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;499&quot;}\\\">Authentic camel ride experience<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;566&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;533&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;566&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;535&quot;}\\\">Simple, well-structured route<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;618&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;567&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;618&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;569&quot;}\\\">Perfect for short stays and first-time visitors<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;data-end&quot;:&quot;791&quot;,&quot;data-is-last-node&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-is-only-node&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-start&quot;:&quot;620&quot;}\\\">If you value quality moments over rushed schedules, booking this tour with Egypt Tours Company is a practical step toward a memorable and well-balanced pyramid experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/div>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,130.00,NULL,130.00,NULL,130.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,99,0,0,130.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'city',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,1,'2026-01-14 20:25:49',10,'{\"en\":\"Giza Pyramids Guided Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover Ancient Egypt in style with a private Giza Pyramids tour. Enjoy hotel transfers, a panoramic lunch with pyramid views, and expert-led tours of the Giza Plateau.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','73','Giza-Pyramids-Guided-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-01-14 20:25:49','2026-02-06 19:20:26',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(115,27,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'cairo-layover-tour-quick-highlights','{\"en\":\"Cairo Layover Tour - Quick Highlights\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Transit through Cairo? Turn your wait into an adventure. Book a guided layover tour of the Pyramids and Old Cairo. 100% on-time airport return guaranteed for your flight\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>A short stop in Cairo does not have to mean waiting at the airport. A well-planned Cairo Layover Tour &ndash; Quick Highlights allows travelers with limited transit time to experience some of Egypt&rsquo;s most iconic sights without stress or rushing. This type of layover tour is designed for efficiency, focusing on key landmarks while respecting flight schedules and transit requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For many international travelers, a layover excursion tour in Cairo transforms unused hours into a meaningful cultural experience. With professional coordination, clear timing, and local guidance, even a few hours can deliver memorable highlights and a smooth return to the airport, fully aligned with travel regulations and time constraints.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Why Choose a Cairo Layover Tour for a Short Stop?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Choosing a Cairo layover tour during a short stop is about making smart use of time rather than simply filling it. Cairo is one of the few cities in the world where globally recognized landmarks are located relatively close to the international airport, making short sightseeing experiences realistic. This proximity allows travelers to leave the airport, explore, and return comfortably within the same day.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A Cairo Layover Tour &ndash; Quick Highlights is built around efficiency and flexibility. Routes are adjusted to traffic conditions, time availability, and traveler preferences, which reduces uncertainty. Instead of navigating transportation, tickets, and timing alone, travelers rely on structured planning that prioritizes punctuality and safety.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Cairo Layover Tour &ndash; Quick Highlights Itinerary<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The itinerary of a layover excursion tour in Cairo is intentionally simple and time-focused. Each step is planned to minimize waiting and maximize the experience, especially for travelers unfamiliar with the city.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Typical route overview and explanation:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<li><strong>Airport Pickup and Orientation:&nbsp;<\\/strong>Arrival assistance and meeting with a local representative at Cairo International Airport. A short briefing explains the route, timing, and key considerations for the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><strong data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Transfer to Main Highlight Area:&nbsp;<\\/strong><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">A direct transfer to the selected sightseeing area, usually chosen based on traffic patterns and available layover time.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><strong data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Guided Sightseeing Stop:&nbsp;<\\/strong><span data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">Exploration of one or more major Cairo landmarks with clear explanations, photo stops, and cultural context, without rushing or unnecessary detours.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><span style=\\\"font-family: Arial;\\\" data-keep-original-tag=\\\"false\\\" data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;data-sheets-root&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\\\"><strong data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;