(122,28,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'giza-pyramids-sphinx-private-tour','{\"en\":\"Giza Pyramids & Sphinx Private Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Witness the Last Standing Wonder of the Ancient World Journey to the Giza Plateau for a comprehensive tour of the most iconic monuments on Earth. Accompanied by a certified Egyptologist, you’ll bypass the chaos and dive straight into 4,500 years of history.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p>The Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour is one of the most popular short sightseeing experiences in Egypt, especially for travelers who want to explore world-famous landmarks without committing to a full-day program. This tour focuses on the Giza Plateau, combining cultural discovery, historical context, and smooth logistics into a single, well-structured visit.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Designed for first-time visitors and travelers with limited time, the tour follows approved routes and tourism standards. It offers a balanced experience that prioritizes clarity, comfort, and meaningful exploration while remaining suitable for a global audience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>What Is a Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour is a guided excursion that takes visitors to the Giza Plateau, home to the Great Pyramid, the surrounding pyramids, and the iconic Sphinx. The experience typically lasts a few hours and is structured to provide essential insight without rushing or unnecessary complexity.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Rather than covering multiple locations, the tour focuses on depth and organization. Visitors benefit from local guidance, managed transportation, and clear explanations that simplify complex historical concepts. Egypt Tours Company designs this tour to suit beginners while maintaining accuracy and cultural respect.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Why Choose a Tour to Giza Pyramids and Sphinx?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Choosing a Tour to Giza Pyramids and Sphinx helps travelers avoid common challenges associated with independent visits. The Giza Plateau is expansive, and navigating it alone can be confusing, particularly for visitors unfamiliar with Cairo&rsquo;s layout and local procedures.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A guided tour ensures efficient use of time, access to reliable explanations, and a smoother overall experience. It also helps visitors follow local regulations and approved paths, which enhances safety and comfort. For international travelers, this structured approach offers confidence and clarity from start to finish.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour Itinerary<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The itinerary of the Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour follows a logical and efficient route, designed to reduce fatigue and maximize viewing opportunities. The sequence allows visitors to enjoy each stop without feeling rushed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul data-original-attrs=\\\"{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\\\">\\r\\n<li><strong>Pick-up and Transfer to the Giza Plateau:<\\/strong>&nbsp;The tour begins with an organized pick-up and transfer. During the journey, the guide outlines the route and provides introductory context about the Giza area. This stage helps visitors prepare mentally for the experience ahead.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Visit the Great Pyramid Area:<\\/strong>&nbsp;Upon arrival, the focus shifts to the main pyramid zone. Visitors explore the area around the Great Pyramid and nearby structures, learning about their significance through clear, beginner-friendly explanations. Time is allocated for walking and photography at approved locations.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Sphinx Viewing and Photo Stop:&nbsp;<\\/strong>The next stop highlights the Sphinx, one of Egypt&rsquo;s most recognizable monuments. The guide explains its symbolism and role within the Giza complex. A dedicated photo stop allows visitors to capture memorable images without pressure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Return Transfer:<\\/strong>&nbsp;After completing the visit, the tour concludes with a comfortable return transfer. This final stage ensures the experience ends smoothly, leaving visitors relaxed and satisfied.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>How Long Does the Tour Take and Who Is It For?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The<strong>&nbsp;Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour<\\/strong>&nbsp;is designed to last less than one day, making it ideal for travelers with limited schedules. The duration is long enough to provide value while remaining physically manageable for most visitors.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This tour suits solo travelers, couples, families, and older visitors who prefer a controlled pace. It is also a practical choice for transit passengers or business travelers seeking a cultural highlight without disrupting other plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Is the Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour Worth It?<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For many travelers, value lies in organization and clarity rather than duration. A well-structured Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx offers a focused introduction to Egypt&rsquo;s most famous site, avoiding unnecessary complexity.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Compared to unplanned visits, guided tours often save time and reduce confusion. Visitors gain context, practical support, and a clearer understanding of what they are seeing. This balance makes the tour a strong option for those seeking an efficient yet meaningful experience.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Important Tips Before Joining the Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Preparing in advance can significantly improve the overall experience and help visitors feel comfortable throughout the tour.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Wear comfortable walking shoes suitable for uneven terrain<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Choose light, weather-appropriate clothing<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Bring sun protection such as a hat or sunscreen<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Keep personal belongings minimal and secure<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Follow guide instructions for safety and site compliance<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>These practical tips help travelers focus on enjoyment rather than logistics.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h2>Conclusion &ndash; Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>In conclusion, the Cairo Pyramids &amp; Sphinx Tour offers a practical and engaging way to experience one of the world&rsquo;s most iconic historical sites within a limited timeframe. Short guided tours represent a large share of global sightseeing bookings, reflecting their growing appeal among modern travelers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Key advantages include:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Clear and efficient itinerary<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Professional guidance<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Flexible scheduling<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p>Suitable for first-time visitors<\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>If you are planning a visit to Cairo and want a focused cultural experience without unnecessary complexity, booking this tour with Egypt Tours Company is a smart next step. Secure your place, plan with confidence, and turn your visit to the pyramids into a smooth and memorable journey.<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,6,NULL,'{\"en\":\"6 Hours\"}',NULL,90.00,NULL,90.00,NULL,90.00,NULL,NULL,3,0,99,0,0,90.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-01-14 23:06:29',10,'{\"en\":\"Giza Pyramids & Sphinx Private Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Visit the Giza Pyramids and Sphinx in 2026! Enjoy a private guided tour with skip-the-line entry, panoramic photo stops, and an optional camel ride. Book your Cairo adventure today\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','81','Giza-Pyramids-Sphinx-Private-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-01-14 23:06:29','2026-02-08 20:25:44',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(123,38,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'full-day-luxor-east-west-bank-tour','{\"en\":\"Full Day Luxor East and West Bank Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover the highlights of ancient Thebes on a Full Day Luxor East and West Bank Tour, designed to showcase Luxor’s most iconic archaeological treasures in one comprehensive experience. This guided journey takes you to the spiritual heart of ancient Egypt on the East Bank and the legendary royal necropolis on the West Bank. Explore the vast Karnak Temple Complex, the largest religious site ever constructed, followed by the elegant Luxor Temple.\"}','{\"en\":\"<p><strong>Full Day Luxor East &amp; West Bank Tour | Karnak, Luxor Temple &amp; Valley of the Kings<\\/strong><br \\/><strong>Full Description<\\/strong><br \\/>Experience the essence of ancient Egypt on a Full Day Luxor East and West Bank Tour, carefully designed to showcase the most important archaeological treasures of Luxor in one comprehensive day. This immersive journey takes you through temples, royal tombs, and monuments that reflect over 3,000 years of Egyptian history.<br \\/>Your day begins with a comfortable hotel pick-up in Luxor, accompanied by a professional Egyptologist guide who brings each site to life with expert storytelling and historical insight. On the East Bank, explore the spiritual heart of ancient Thebes, where grand temples were built to honor powerful gods and celebrate royal ceremonies. On the West Bank, cross the Nile to the legendary necropolis, where pharaohs prepared for eternity with richly decorated tombs carved deep into the desert cliffs.<br \\/>Throughout the tour, you will enjoy smooth transportation, carefully timed visits, and ample opportunities for photography. This tour is ideal for first-time visitors and history lovers who wish to fully understand Luxor&rsquo;s significance while traveling in comfort and safety.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Explore Luxor&rsquo;s East and West Banks in one comprehensive day.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit Egypt&rsquo;s largest temple complex at Karnak.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover royal tombs in the Valley of the Kings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Admire the unique cliff-side Temple of Hatshepsut.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn from a certified professional Egyptologist guide.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,79.00,NULL,79.00,NULL,79.00,NULL,NULL,2,0,99,0,0,79.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-01-22 17:35:48',10,'{\"en\":\"Full Day Luxor East and West Bank Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Full day Luxor East and West Bank tour exploring Karnak Temple, Luxor Temple, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut Temple, and Colossi of Memnon.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','82','Full-Day-Luxor-East-West-Bank-Tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-01-22 17:35:48','2026-04-01 14:55:45',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(124,37,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'abu-simbel-day-tour-from-aswan','{\"en\":\"Abu Simbel Day Tour from Aswan | Private Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Book a private Abu Simbel Day Tour from Aswan and explore the magnificent temples of Ramses II and Queen Nefertari with an expert Egyptologist and private transportation.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2><strong>Tour Overview<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover one of<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/attractions\\/Ancient-Egypt-Wonders\\\"> ancient Egypt\'s<\\/a> most extraordinary monuments on a private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/abu-simbel-temples\\\"><strong>Abu Simbel<\\/strong><\\/a> Day Tour from <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tours\\/Aswan-Tours\\\"><strong>Aswan<\\/strong><\\/a>. Travel comfortably from Aswan to the remarkable temples of Abu Simbel, built during the reign of Pharaoh Ramses II and dedicated to the gods Amun, Ra-Horakhty and Ptah. With your private English-speaking Egyptologist, explore the Great Temple of Ramses II and the beautiful Temple of Queen Nefertari, learning about their history, architecture and remarkable relocation in the 20th century. After your guided visit, enjoy a comfortable private journey back to Aswan with convenient hotel or <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Nile-Cruise\\\"><strong>Nile cruise<\\/strong><\\/a> drop-off.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>- Private Abu Simbel Day Tour from Aswan<br \\/>- Comfortable private air-conditioned transportation<br \\/>- Visit the magnificent Great Temple of Ramses II<br \\/>- Explore the Temple of Queen Nefertari<br \\/>- Discover spectacular ancient Egyptian reliefs and architecture<br \\/>- Learn about the history of Ramses II and Queen Nefertari<br \\/>- Professional private English-speaking Egyptologist<br \\/>- Hotel or Nile cruise pickup and drop-off in Aswan<br \\/>- Flexible private tour experience<br \\/>- Bottled water during the journey<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,165.00,NULL,165.00,NULL,165.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,80,0,0,165.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"<h2>Tour Information<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Tour Duration: Full Day.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour Type: Private Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Departure: Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Destination: Abu Simbel.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Transportation: Private air-conditioned vehicle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guide: Private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Pickup: Aswan hotel, Nile cruise, or accommodation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Drop-off: Aswan hotel, Nile cruise, or agreed location.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Availability: Daily, subject to site and transportation arrangements.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-08-27 20:11:54',10,'{\"en\":\"Abu Simbel Day Tour from Aswan | Private Egyptologist Guide\"}','{\"en\":\"xplore the magnificent Abu Simbel Temples on a private day tour from Aswan. Visit the temples of Ramses II and Nefertari with a private Egyptologist guide and entrance tickets included.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','83','abu-simbel-day-tour-from-aswan','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-08-27 20:11:54','2026-08-27 20:37:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(125,32,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'alexandria-day-tour-from-cairo','{\"en\":\"Private Alexandria Day Tour from Cairo\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover Alexandria on a private day tour from Cairo. Visit the Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa, Pompey\'s Pillar, Qaitbay Citadel and Bibliotheca Alexandrina with an Egyptologist.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>Tour Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Discover the Mediterranean charm and fascinating history of Egypt\'s second-largest city on a private Alexandria Day Tour from Cairo. Founded by Alexander the Great in 331 BC, Alexandria became one of the most important cultural, intellectual and commercial centers of the ancient Mediterranean. Travel comfortably from Cairo to the Mediterranean coast with your private driver and professional Egyptologist, then explore the city\'s most remarkable historical landmarks. Visit the impressive Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa, one of Alexandria\'s most important underground archaeological sites, and discover Pompey\'s Pillar, a towering ancient column associated with the city\'s Roman period. Continue to the magnificent Qaitbay Citadel, built on the site traditionally associated with the ancient Pharos Lighthouse, and visit the modern Bibliotheca Alexandrina, an architectural landmark celebrating Alexandria\'s ancient intellectual heritage. Enjoy time to experience the Mediterranean atmosphere before returning to Cairo in your private vehicle.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private Alexandria Day Tour from Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Comfortable private air-conditioned transportation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Professional private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the historic Mediterranean city of Alexandria.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the impressive Pompey\'s Pillar.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the historic Qaitbay Citadel.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the Bibliotheca Alexandrina.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy views of the Mediterranean Sea.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore Alexandria\'s ancient Greek, Roman and Egyptian heritage.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private hotel pickup and drop-off in Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flexible and personalized sightseeing experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Bottled water during the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Information<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Tour Duration: Full Day.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour Type: Private Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Destination: Alexandria.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Starting Point: Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Transportation: Private air-conditioned vehicle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guide: Private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Pickup: Cairo hotel or accommodation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Drop-off: Cairo hotel or agreed location.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Availability: Daily, subject to attraction opening hours and availability.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Recommended For: Couples, families, solo travelers and private groups.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',1,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1 Day\"}',NULL,110.00,NULL,110.00,NULL,110.00,NULL,NULL,5,0,80,0,0,110.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'boat',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-08-28 10:47:50',10,'{\"en\":\"Alexandria Day Tour from Cairo | Private Egypt Day Trip\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover Alexandria on a private day tour from Cairo. Visit the Catacombs of Kom El Shoqafa, Pompey\'s Pillar, Qaitbay Citadel and Bibliotheca Alexandrina with an Egyptologist.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','84','alexandria-day-tour-from-cairo','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-08-28 10:47:50','2026-08-28 11:12:07',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(126,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'cairo-layover-tour-from-cairo-airport','{\"en\":\"Cairo Layover Tour from Cairo Airport – Pyramids, Sphinx & Grand Egyptian Museum\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Make the most of your Cairo layover with a private airport tour to the Pyramids, Sphinx and Egyptian Museum. Private vehicle, Egyptologist guide and airport transfers included.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>Private Cairo Layover Tour from Cairo Airport<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Tour Overview<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Turn your time between flights into an unforgettable Egyptian adventure with a private Cairo Layover Tour from Cairo Airport. Instead of spending your entire connection at the airport, explore some of the world\'s most famous ancient monuments with a professional Egyptologist and private air-conditioned vehicle. After meeting your representative at Cairo International Airport, travel to the Giza Plateau to admire the Great Pyramid of Khufu, the Pyramid of Khafre and the Pyramid of Menkaure, followed by the legendary Great Sphinx. Depending on your available layover time and flight schedule, you can also visit the Egyptian Museum in downtown Cairo to discover an extraordinary collection of ancient Egyptian treasures. Your itinerary is carefully planned around your arrival and departure flights, allowing sufficient time for transportation, sightseeing and returning to the airport. This private experience is ideal for travelers with a long international connection who want to see Cairo comfortably and efficiently without booking an overnight stay.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private Cairo layover tour from Cairo International Airport.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Airport pickup and return transfer.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the world-famous Giza Pyramids.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the Great Pyramid of Khufu.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Admire the Pyramid of Khafre and Pyramid of Menkaure.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the legendary Great Sphinx.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Egyptian Museum, depending on available time.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned vehicle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flexible itinerary based on your flight schedule.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Local Egyptian lunch available upon request.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Safe and comfortable airport-to-airport experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ideal for long international layovers and transit passengers.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"en\":\"1-Day\"}',NULL,180.00,NULL,180.00,NULL,180.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,88,0,0,180.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-08-28 16:07:07',10,'{\"en\":\"Cairo Layover Tour from Airport | Pyramids & Grand Egyptian Museum\"}','{\"en\":\"Make the most of your Cairo layover with a private airport tour to the Pyramids, Sphinx and Egyptian Museum. Private vehicle, Egyptologist guide and airport transfers included.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','85','cairo-layover-tour-from-cairo-airport','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-08-28 16:07:07','2026-08-29 11:44:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(127,37,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'aswan-highlights-day-tour','{\"en\":\"Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Discover the highlights of Aswan on a private day tour visiting Philae Temple, the Unfinished Obelisk and Aswan High Dam with a private Egyptologist and comfortable transportation.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Overview<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Discover the ancient heritage and modern achievements of southern Egypt on a private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tours\\/Aswan-Tours\\\">Aswan<\\/a> Highlights Day Tour. This carefully designed excursion introduces you to three of the city\'s most important landmarks: the beautiful <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/philae-temple\\\">Philae Temple<\\/a>, the fascinating <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/unfinished-obelisk\\\">Unfinished Obelisk<\\/a> and the impressive <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/aswan-high-dam\\\">Aswan High Dam<\\/a>. Accompanied by a professional private Egyptologist, you will explore the history of Aswan from ancient times to the modern era while traveling comfortably in a private air-conditioned vehicle. Begin with Philae Temple, a remarkable sanctuary dedicated primarily to the goddess Isis and beautifully reconstructed on Agilkia Island after the original site was threatened by the rising waters of Lake Nasser. Continue to the Unfinished Obelisk in Aswan\'s ancient granite quarries, where you can see how ancient craftsmen worked enormous blocks of stone. Finally, visit the Aswan High Dam, one of Egypt\'s most significant modern engineering projects. This private tour offers an excellent introduction to Aswan for first-time visitors, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/cruise\\/Nile-Cruise\\\">Nile cruise<\\/a> passengers and travelers with limited time.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Highlights<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>&nbsp;Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the beautiful Philae Temple.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy a boat ride to Agilkia Island.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn about the worship of the goddess Isis.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the ancient granite quarries of Aswan.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the enormous Unfinished Obelisk.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn about ancient Egyptian stone-working techniques.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the impressive Aswan High Dam.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover the importance of the Nile River to ancient and modern Egypt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Professional private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned transportation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hotel and Nile cruise pickup and drop-off.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flexible private sightseeing experience.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Bottled water during the tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>Book Your Private Aswan Highlights Day Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Experience the essential highlights of Aswan with a private Egyptologist and comfortable transportation. Explore the sacred Philae Temple, discover the ancient techniques behind the Unfinished Obelisk and learn how the modern Aswan High Dam transformed the Nile Valley.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you are staying in Aswan, arriving on a Nile cruise or simply have limited time in the city, this private sightseeing experience provides an ideal introduction to the history, culture and landscapes of southern Egypt.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Contact Egypt Tour Pro today to check availability and arrange your private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tours\\/Aswan-Tours\\\">Aswan<\\/a> Highlights Day Tour.<\\/p>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,49.00,NULL,49.00,NULL,49.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,88,0,0,49.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,0,NULL,10,'{\"en\":\"Aswan Highlights Day Tour | Philae Temple, Obelisk & High Dam\"}','{\"en\":\"Discover the highlights of Aswan on a private day tour visiting Philae Temple, the Unfinished Obelisk and Aswan High Dam with a private Egyptologist and comfortable transportation.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','86','aswan-highlights-day-tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-08-29 11:07:58','2026-08-29 11:24:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL),
(128,43,NULL,NULL,1,'day_tour',NULL,NULL,'nmec-citadel-old-cairo-tour','{\"en\":\"Private NMEC, Citadel & Old Cairo Day Tour\"}',NULL,'{\"en\":\"Explore Cairo\'s history on a private tour of NMEC, Saladin Citadel and Old Cairo. Visit the Royal Mummies, Muhammad Ali Mosque and historic churches with an Egyptologist.\"}','{\"en\":\"<h2>Private NMEC, Citadel &amp; Old Cairo Day Tour<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p><strong>Tour Overview<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Discover three fascinating chapters of Cairo\'s history on a private <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/national-museum-egyptian-civilization\\\">NMEC<\\/a>, Citadel and Old <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/tours\\/Cairo-Tours\\\">Cairo Day Tour<\\/a>. This carefully designed experience takes you from the earliest periods of Egyptian civilization to the medieval Islamic era and the historic Christian heritage of Old Cairo. Begin at the <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/egypttourpro.com\\/sights\\/national-museum-egyptian-civilization\\\">National Museum of Egyptian Civilization<\\/a> in Fustat, where your private Egyptologist introduces you to the development of Egyptian civilization through thousands of years of history. Explore the museum\'s galleries and discover its famous Royal Mummies collection, alongside exhibits covering different aspects of Egyptian heritage. Continue to the historic Citadel of Saladin, dramatically positioned on the Muqattam Hills and offering impressive views across Cairo. Visit the magnificent Mosque of Muhammad Ali, famous for its Ottoman-inspired architecture and grand interior. Finally, explore Old Cairo, one of the city\'s most historic districts, where you can discover ancient churches and the fascinating religious heritage of Coptic Cairo. With private transportation and a dedicated Egyptologist, this tour offers a deeper cultural experience beyond Cairo\'s famous pyramids.<\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>Tour Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Private NMEC, Citadel and Old Cairo Day Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the National Museum of Egyptian Civilization.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the Royal Mummies Gallery.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover Egyptian civilization through different historical periods.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the historic Citadel of Saladin.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the magnificent Mosque of Muhammad Ali.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Enjoy panoramic views of Cairo from the Citadel.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Discover historic Old Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Visit the Hanging Church.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>See the Church of St. Sergius and Bacchus.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Explore the historic Coptic heritage of Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Learn about the coexistence of different religious traditions in Old Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Professional private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Private air-conditioned transportation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Hotel pickup and drop-off.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Flexible private itinerary.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Bottled water.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h2>Tour Information<\\/h2>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Tour Duration: Full Day.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Tour Type: Private Tour.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Starting Point: Cairo or Giza.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Destination: Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Transportation: Private air-conditioned vehicle.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Guide: Private English-speaking Egyptologist.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Main Attractions: NMEC, Royal Mummies Gallery, Citadel of Saladin, Mosque of Muhammad Ali and Old Cairo.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Pickup: Cairo or Giza hotel.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Drop-off: Cairo or Giza hotel.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Availability: Daily, subject to attraction opening hours.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Recommended For: Couples, families, solo travelers, history enthusiasts and private groups.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\"}','hours',NULL,8,NULL,'{\"en\":\"8 Hours\"}',NULL,60.00,NULL,60.00,NULL,60.00,NULL,NULL,1,0,87,0,0,60.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'general',NULL,NULL,0.00,0,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,0,1,'2026-08-29 11:51:30',10,'{\"en\":\"NMEC, Citadel & Old Cairo Tour | Private Cairo Day Tour\"}','{\"en\":\"Explore Cairo\'s history on a private tour of NMEC, Saladin Citadel and Old Cairo. Visit the Royal Mummies, Muhammad Ali Mosque and historic churches with an Egyptologist.\"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'legacy_rails_day_tour','87','nmec-citadel-old-cairo-tour','2026-09-13 09:54:42','2026-08-29 11:51:30','2026-08-29 13:08:47',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL);
